\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiWga3xh4uWAxXUgOEIHc0BNaYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Animasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menayangkan kisah inspiratif tentang tolong-menolong dari YouTube atau platform edukasi.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiWga3xh4uWAxXUgOEIHc0BNaYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Presentasi Interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggunakan Canva atau PowerPoint interaktif untuk membedah dalil <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">amar makruf nahi mungkar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiWga3xh4uWAxXUgOEIHc0BNaYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Infografis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Membagikan poster digital berisi contoh nyata taat perintah Allah di era modern.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiWga3xh4uWAxXUgOEIHc0BNaYQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIBRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiWga3xh4uWAxXUgOEIHc0BNaYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman pembelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang menaati pemerintah dan menolong orang lain dalam kebaikan merupakan bagian dari materi cabang-cabang iman (</span><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">shu\'abul iman<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>). Siswa belajar bahwa patuh pada pemimpin yang sah dan tolong-menolong dalam kebajikan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">al-birr<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) adalah wujud nyata keimanan sosial untuk menciptakan masyarakat yang tertib, rukun, dan penuh rahmat</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran PAI kelas 12 tentang menaati pemerintah dan menolong orang lain dalam kebaikan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"nKcLjc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf nKcLjc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb nKcLjc_j/HugV6-->menunjukkan pentingnya taat kepada pemimpin yang sah selama tidak maksiat, serta berlomba-lomba dalam kebaikan dan takwa untuk memperkuat persatuan sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Refleksi Menaati Pemerintah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Taat pada pemimpin hukumnya wajib dalam Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Syarat utamanya adalah perintah itu tidak melanggar ajaran Allah SWT.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ketaatan menjaga ketertiban dan keamanan negara.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Warga yang baik ikut membangun bangsa dengan damai.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Q-7AUegoIAggACAAIBRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Refleksi Menolong dalam Kebaikan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tolong-menolong harus pada hal kebaikan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">al-birr<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) dan takwa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dilarang menolong dalam perbuatan dosa dan permusuhan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">al-udwan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sikap ini menumbuhkan rasa kasih sayang antarmanusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kerja sama membuat masyarakat menjadi kuat dan rukun.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"http://digilib.uinsa.ac.id/61768/2/Ratna%20Talia%20Syasa%20Billa_D71219082%20ok.pdf\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Q-7AUegoIAggACAAIBxAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Penerapan dalam Kehidupan Sehari-hari<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Patuhi aturan lalu lintas dan hukum negara.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Bantu teman yang kesulitan belajar atau terkena musibah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tolak ajakan buruk dari siapa pun.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Jaga persatuan di sekolah dan lingkungan rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Q-7AUegoIAggACAAICRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAQ\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAg\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 03:38:51','2026-08-06 03:38:51'),
(85,7,1,NULL,23,NULL,'MENAATI PEMERINTAH, MENOLONG ORG LAIN DALAM KEBAIKAN KEBAIKAN','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi menaati pemerintah dan menolong orang lain dalam kebaikan pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"kMRXJf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjBhbqhhouWAxWpOS4FHXXMMccQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf kMRXJf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb kMRXJf_j/HugV6-->termasuk dalam lingkup <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Syu\'abul Iman<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (cabang-cabang iman)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diharapkan mampu memahami, menganalisis, dan menerapkan sikap taat serta tolong-menolong (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">ta\'awun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) sebagai wujud peneguhan praktik beragama dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran PAI kelas 12 pada materi menaati pemerintah dan menolong orang lain dalam kebaikan adalah agar siswa mampu menganalisis dalil, memahami konsep cabang iman (</span><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">shu\'abul iman<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta menerapkan sikap patuh pada ajaran Islam dan gemar bekerja sama dalam kebaikan secara nyata dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</p>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Langkah dan Metode Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ9ZeLh4uWAxWjhmMGHe4sK-wQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Keteladanan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Guru memberi contoh nyata cara bersikap patuh dan ringan tangan membantu sesama di sekolah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ9ZeLh4uWAxWjhmMGHe4sK-wQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Pembiasaan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Siswa diminta melakukan aksi tolong-menolong harian, seperti piket kelas atau mengumpulkan sumbangan sosial.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ9ZeLh4uWAxWjhmMGHe4sK-wQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Sosiodrama (Bermain Peran)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Siswa memperagakan adegan saat harus menolak ajakan buruk dan memilih menolong teman yang kesulitan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ9ZeLh4uWAxWjhmMGHe4sK-wQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Diskusi Kelompok<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Siswa membahas ayat Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang taat aturan dan tolong-menolong (QS. Al-Ma\'idah: 2).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://pai-fitkiainambon.id/kegiatan-pendidikan-dan-pelatihan-pai-fitki-aina-ambon-untuk-komunitas/\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://repository.uinsuku.ac.id/11238/5/5.%20BAB%20II.pdf\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.jppipa.unram.ac.id/index.php/jcar/article/download/3069/2407\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ9ZeLh4uWAxWjhmMGHe4sK-wQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIBRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ9ZeLh4uWAxWjhmMGHe4sK-wQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Media Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiqg8Ogh4uWAxXr6jgGHQ8EHe4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-r