 tidak dzalim . Menolong orang lain dalam kebaikan. Ini salah satu perintah Allah dalam Al Qur&#39;an bagi kita sebagai umat Islam. Saling menolong dalam kebaikan akan mendatangkan kebaikan pula bagi diri sendiri .&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcRdzmOZtMsaHs3YSRDErye0TvmE78CqSdEPewruDlvuuU1JHUS3JJ8JKwdcDaifhj_JW_Etw-Q2CbkNDDY&quot;,&quot;Rubel PAI 12&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.pai12.rubel.web.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785987395285053,149000247,2669864731],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,20]]],null,&quot;8da37b71-3615-4653-a61d-98df2f912453&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-2\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi94JPCiYuWAxU3kOEIHRvnIp8Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIExAK\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBMQCg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi Materi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Paparan materi terstruktur dan ringkas mengenai cabang iman ini tersedia di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" d