\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Jaga persatuan di sekolah dan lingkungan rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Q-7AUegoIAggACAAICRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinqd-kiYuWAxXzOS4FHRDwHH4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAQ\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAg\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 03:38:51','2026-08-06 03:38:51'),
(88,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'Adab Bermasyarakat: Menjalin Silaturahmi dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Target Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami konsep dasar dan pentingnya adab bermasyarakat sesuai tuntunan syariat Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis makna, hakikat, dan keutamaan menjalin tali silaturahmi dengan sesama manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengidentifikasi bentuk hak-hak tetangga dan kewajiban muslim dalam menghormati lingkungan sosial terdekat</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat dan Menjalin Silaturahmi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LAsok_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTt-XNi4uWAxXxj-EIHf3NOWEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LAsok_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LAsok_k/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu memahami konsep dasar interaksi sosial, menerapkan etika pergaulan, serta membiasakan sikap peduli, toleran, dan mempererat persaudaraan sesuai tuntunan Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Tahapan dan Metode Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Muhasabah (Refleksi Diri):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diajak merenungkan peran diri sebagai makhluk sosial yang butuh berinteraksi dengan tetangga dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Observasi Lapangan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mengamati secara berkelompok bentuk interaksi sosial dan penerapan adab di lingkungan sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalami Materi (Kajian Teks):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memaparkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang keutamaan silaturahmi, hak tetangga, dan adab bertamu.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2FZXK-F6EI&amp;t=343\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAQ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQEA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Elaborasi &amp; Diskusi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa berdiskusi memecahkan studi kasus nyata terkait konflik tetangga atau pudarnya kepedulian sosial.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAU\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQFA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ruang Aktualisasi (Praktik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Simulasi atau praktik langsung adab bertamu, saling memberi, dan menyambung kembali hubungan yang renggang.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAY\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQGA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Afirmasi &amp; Refleksi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Penguatan karakter agar siswa terbiasa menebar senyum, berlemah lembut, dan menjaga lisan dalam masyarakat</span></div>','<p>Media pembelajaran yang efektif meliputi <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"dn7krf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjOtbPwi4uWAxVqleEIHazTMF8QuJAPegoIAggACAAIEhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf dn7krf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb dn7krf_1b/HugV6-->tayangan video interaktif, peta konsep digital, modul presentasi slide, serta Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD) berbasis studi kasus sosial di masyarakat</mark></p>','<p>Buku Paket PAI &amp; Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek serta rujukan akidah akhlak, yang merujuk pada Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang etika sosial</p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rujukan Utama Sumber Ajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket Siswa PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembahasan bab akhlak dan muamalah kemasyarakatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalil Naqli:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> QS. An-Nisa\' ayat 36 tentang berbuat baik kepada tetangga dekat dan jauh.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hadis Riwayat Bukhari &amp; Muslim:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Anjuran memuliakan tetangga dan tamu sebagai tanda keimanan</span></div>','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBgQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Metode Penilaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Sikap (Afektif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Observasi kebiasaan salam dan kepedulian sosial di sekolah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Pengetahuan (Kognitif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Tes tertulis mengenai dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang hak tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Keterampilan (Psikomotorik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Portofolio atau laporan kegiatan aksi sosial di lingkungan rumah</span></div>','2 x 45 menit','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Strategi Praktik Pedagogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kontekstualisasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan realitas sosial di lingkungan tempat tinggal peserta didik.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Keteladanan (Uswah Hasanah):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru mencontohkan sikap 5S (Sapa, Salam, Senyum, Sopan, Santun) di kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Diskusi kasus nyata konflik antar-tetangga lalu mencari solusi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Proyek Sosial (Aksi Nyata):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa praktik langsung menjenguk tetangga sakit, kerja bakti, atau berbagi makanan</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, silaturahmi</span>, dan hak tetangga <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"r0l3ye_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwje6ZnjjIuWAxW9leEIHXqFOpQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf r0l3ye_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb r0l3ye_1b/HugV6-->berfokus pada pembentukan karakter sosial siswa<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini menekankan bahwa hubungan baik dengan tetangga adalah tanda keimanan, mencakup sikap saling menghormati, tidak menyakiti, dan tolong-menolong dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam adab bermasyarakat mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gUIcqc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiPw7SCjYuWAxVTmeEIHSFpIFwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gUIcqc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gUIcqc_1b/HugV6-->penggunaan grup pesan instan dan media sosial untuk mempererat silaturahmi, berbagi informasi penting, dan saling membantu<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Sarana teknologi ini memudahkan komunikasi jarak jauh, namun tetap harus dilandasi etika agar hak-hak tetangga terjaga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat, Menjalin Silaturahmi, dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"YkeKf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjNncedjYuWAxUAk-EIHcABO_4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf YkeKf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb YkeKf_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman bahwa akhlak mulia tidak hanya ditujukan kepada Allah, tetapi juga diwujudkan secara nyata melalui keharmonisan sosial dan kepedulian di lingkungan tempat tinggal</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, menjalin silaturahmi, dan menjaga hak tetangga </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"aTHJzd_7w\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf aTHJzd_7v/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb aTHJzd_7v/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa Islam sangat mengatur hubungan sosial. Setiap Muslim wajib berbuat baik kepada tetangga, menjaga lisan, dan mempererat persaudaraan agar tercipta masyarakat yang rukun, damai, dan peduli sesama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Hasil Refleksi Diri :<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kesadaran:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya sadar masih kurang peduli dengan kondisi tetangga sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perbaikan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya mau mulai menyapa dan bersikap lebih ramah kepada tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Komitmen:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya akan menjaga lisan dan perbuatan agar tidak mengganggu kenyamanan tetangga.</span></div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 03:56:10','2026-08-06 03:56:10'),
(89,7,1,NULL,23,NULL,'Adab Bermasyarakat: Menjalin Silaturahmi dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Target Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami konsep dasar dan pentingnya adab bermasyarakat sesuai tuntunan syariat Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis makna, hakikat, dan keutamaan menjalin tali silaturahmi dengan sesama manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengidentifikasi bentuk hak-hak tetangga dan kewajiban muslim dalam menghormati lingkungan sosial terdekat</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat dan Menjalin Silaturahmi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LAsok_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTt-XNi4uWAxXxj-EIHf3NOWEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LAsok_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LAsok_k/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu memahami konsep dasar interaksi sosial, menerapkan etika pergaulan, serta membiasakan sikap peduli, toleran, dan mempererat persaudaraan sesuai tuntunan Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Tahapan dan Metode Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Muhasabah (Refleksi Diri):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diajak merenungkan peran diri sebagai makhluk sosial yang butuh berinteraksi dengan tetangga dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Observasi Lapangan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mengamati secara berkelompok bentuk interaksi sosial dan penerapan adab di lingkungan sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalami Materi (Kajian Teks):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memaparkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang keutamaan silaturahmi, hak tetangga, dan adab bertamu.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2FZXK-F6EI&amp;t=343\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAQ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQEA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Elaborasi &amp; Diskusi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa berdiskusi memecahkan studi kasus nyata terkait konflik tetangga atau pudarnya kepedulian sosial.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAU\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQFA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ruang Aktualisasi (Praktik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Simulasi atau praktik langsung adab bertamu, saling memberi, dan menyambung kembali hubungan yang renggang.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAY\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQGA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Afirmasi &amp; Refleksi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Penguatan karakter agar siswa terbiasa menebar senyum, berlemah lembut, dan menjaga lisan dalam masyarakat</span></div>','<p>Media pembelajaran yang efektif meliputi <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"dn7krf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjOtbPwi4uWAxVqleEIHazTMF8QuJAPegoIAggACAAIEhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf dn7krf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb dn7krf_1b/HugV6-->tayangan video interaktif, peta konsep digital, modul presentasi slide, serta Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD) berbasis studi kasus sosial di masyarakat</mark></p>','<p>Buku Paket PAI &amp; Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek serta rujukan akidah akhlak, yang merujuk pada Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang etika sosial</p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rujukan Utama Sumber Ajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket Siswa PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembahasan bab akhlak dan muamalah kemasyarakatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalil Naqli:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> QS. An-Nisa\' ayat 36 tentang berbuat baik kepada tetangga dekat dan jauh.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hadis Riwayat Bukhari &amp; Muslim:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Anjuran memuliakan tetangga dan tamu sebagai tanda keimanan</span></div>','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBgQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Metode Penilaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Sikap (Afektif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Observasi kebiasaan salam dan kepedulian sosial di sekolah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Pengetahuan (Kognitif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Tes tertulis mengenai dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang hak tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Keterampilan (Psikomotorik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Portofolio atau laporan kegiatan aksi sosial di lingkungan rumah</span></div>','2 x 45 menit','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Strategi Praktik Pedagogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kontekstualisasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan realitas sosial di lingkungan tempat tinggal peserta didik.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Keteladanan (Uswah Hasanah):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru mencontohkan sikap 5S (Sapa, Salam, Senyum, Sopan, Santun) di kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Diskusi kasus nyata konflik antar-tetangga lalu mencari solusi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Proyek Sosial (Aksi Nyata):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa praktik langsung menjenguk tetangga sakit, kerja bakti, atau berbagi makanan</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, silaturahmi</span>, dan hak tetangga <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"r0l3ye_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwje6ZnjjIuWAxW9leEIHXqFOpQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf r0l3ye_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb r0l3ye_1b/HugV6-->berfokus pada pembentukan karakter sosial siswa<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini menekankan bahwa hubungan baik dengan tetangga adalah tanda keimanan, mencakup sikap saling menghormati, tidak menyakiti, dan tolong-menolong dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam adab bermasyarakat mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gUIcqc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiPw7SCjYuWAxVTmeEIHSFpIFwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gUIcqc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gUIcqc_1b/HugV6-->penggunaan grup pesan instan dan media sosial untuk mempererat silaturahmi, berbagi informasi penting, dan saling membantu<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Sarana teknologi ini memudahkan komunikasi jarak jauh, namun tetap harus dilandasi etika agar hak-hak tetangga terjaga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat, Menjalin Silaturahmi, dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"YkeKf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjNncedjYuWAxUAk-EIHcABO_4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf YkeKf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb YkeKf_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman bahwa akhlak mulia tidak hanya ditujukan kepada Allah, tetapi juga diwujudkan secara nyata melalui keharmonisan sosial dan kepedulian di lingkungan tempat tinggal</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, menjalin silaturahmi, dan menjaga hak tetangga </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"aTHJzd_7w\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf aTHJzd_7v/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb aTHJzd_7v/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa Islam sangat mengatur hubungan sosial. Setiap Muslim wajib berbuat baik kepada tetangga, menjaga lisan, dan mempererat persaudaraan agar tercipta masyarakat yang rukun, damai, dan peduli sesama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Hasil Refleksi Diri :<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kesadaran:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya sadar masih kurang peduli dengan kondisi tetangga sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perbaikan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya mau mulai menyapa dan bersikap lebih ramah kepada tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Komitmen:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya akan menjaga lisan dan perbuatan agar tidak mengganggu kenyamanan tetangga.</span></div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 03:56:10','2026-08-06 03:56:10'),
(90,7,1,NULL,24,NULL,'Adab Bermasyarakat: Menjalin Silaturahmi dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Target Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami konsep dasar dan pentingnya adab bermasyarakat sesuai tuntunan syariat Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis makna, hakikat, dan keutamaan menjalin tali silaturahmi dengan sesama manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengidentifikasi bentuk hak-hak tetangga dan kewajiban muslim dalam menghormati lingkungan sosial terdekat</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat dan Menjalin Silaturahmi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LAsok_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTt-XNi4uWAxXxj-EIHf3NOWEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LAsok_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LAsok_k/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu memahami konsep dasar interaksi sosial, menerapkan etika pergaulan, serta membiasakan sikap peduli, toleran, dan mempererat persaudaraan sesuai tuntunan Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Tahapan dan Metode Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Muhasabah (Refleksi Diri):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diajak merenungkan peran diri sebagai makhluk sosial yang butuh berinteraksi dengan tetangga dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Observasi Lapangan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mengamati secara berkelompok bentuk interaksi sosial dan penerapan adab di lingkungan sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalami Materi (Kajian Teks):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memaparkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang keutamaan silaturahmi, hak tetangga, dan adab bertamu.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2FZXK-F6EI&amp;t=343\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAQ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQEA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Elaborasi &amp; Diskusi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa berdiskusi memecahkan studi kasus nyata terkait konflik tetangga atau pudarnya kepedulian sosial.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAU\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQFA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ruang Aktualisasi (Praktik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Simulasi atau praktik langsung adab bertamu, saling memberi, dan menyambung kembali hubungan yang renggang.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAY\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQGA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Afirmasi &amp; Refleksi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Penguatan karakter agar siswa terbiasa menebar senyum, berlemah lembut, dan menjaga lisan dalam masyarakat</span></div>','<p>Media pembelajaran yang efektif meliputi <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"dn7krf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjOtbPwi4uWAxVqleEIHazTMF8QuJAPegoIAggACAAIEhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf dn7krf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb dn7krf_1b/HugV6-->tayangan video interaktif, peta konsep digital, modul presentasi slide, serta Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD) berbasis studi kasus sosial di masyarakat</mark></p>','<p>Buku Paket PAI &amp; Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek serta rujukan akidah akhlak, yang merujuk pada Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang etika sosial</p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rujukan Utama Sumber Ajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket Siswa PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembahasan bab akhlak dan muamalah kemasyarakatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalil Naqli:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> QS. An-Nisa\' ayat 36 tentang berbuat baik kepada tetangga dekat dan jauh.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hadis Riwayat Bukhari &amp; Muslim:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Anjuran memuliakan tetangga dan tamu sebagai tanda keimanan</span></div>','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBgQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Metode Penilaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Sikap (Afektif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Observasi kebiasaan salam dan kepedulian sosial di sekolah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Pengetahuan (Kognitif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Tes tertulis mengenai dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang hak tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Keterampilan (Psikomotorik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Portofolio atau laporan kegiatan aksi sosial di lingkungan rumah</span></div>','2 x 45 menit','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Strategi Praktik Pedagogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kontekstualisasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan realitas sosial di lingkungan tempat tinggal peserta didik.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Keteladanan (Uswah Hasanah):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru mencontohkan sikap 5S (Sapa, Salam, Senyum, Sopan, Santun) di kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Diskusi kasus nyata konflik antar-tetangga lalu mencari solusi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Proyek Sosial (Aksi Nyata):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa praktik langsung menjenguk tetangga sakit, kerja bakti, atau berbagi makanan</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, silaturahmi</span>, dan hak tetangga <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"r0l3ye_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwje6ZnjjIuWAxW9leEIHXqFOpQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf r0l3ye_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb r0l3ye_1b/HugV6-->berfokus pada pembentukan karakter sosial siswa<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini menekankan bahwa hubungan baik dengan tetangga adalah tanda keimanan, mencakup sikap saling menghormati, tidak menyakiti, dan tolong-menolong dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam adab bermasyarakat mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gUIcqc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiPw7SCjYuWAxVTmeEIHSFpIFwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gUIcqc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gUIcqc_1b/HugV6-->penggunaan grup pesan instan dan media sosial untuk mempererat silaturahmi, berbagi informasi penting, dan saling membantu<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Sarana teknologi ini memudahkan komunikasi jarak jauh, namun tetap harus dilandasi etika agar hak-hak tetangga terjaga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat, Menjalin Silaturahmi, dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"YkeKf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjNncedjYuWAxUAk-EIHcABO_4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf YkeKf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb YkeKf_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman bahwa akhlak mulia tidak hanya ditujukan kepada Allah, tetapi juga diwujudkan secara nyata melalui keharmonisan sosial dan kepedulian di lingkungan tempat tinggal</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, menjalin silaturahmi, dan menjaga hak tetangga </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"aTHJzd_7w\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf aTHJzd_7v/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb aTHJzd_7v/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa Islam sangat mengatur hubungan sosial. Setiap Muslim wajib berbuat baik kepada tetangga, menjaga lisan, dan mempererat persaudaraan agar tercipta masyarakat yang rukun, damai, dan peduli sesama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Hasil Refleksi Diri :<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kesadaran:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya sadar masih kurang peduli dengan kondisi tetangga sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perbaikan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya mau mulai menyapa dan bersikap lebih ramah kepada tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Komitmen:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya akan menjaga lisan dan perbuatan agar tidak mengganggu kenyamanan tetangga.</span></div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 03:56:10','2026-08-06 03:56:10'),
(91,7,1,NULL,25,NULL,'Adab Bermasyarakat: Menjalin Silaturahmi dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Target Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami konsep dasar dan pentingnya adab bermasyarakat sesuai tuntunan syariat Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis makna, hakikat, dan keutamaan menjalin tali silaturahmi dengan sesama manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjtpdSqi4uWAxWpiuEIHfT2H54Qi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengidentifikasi bentuk hak-hak tetangga dan kewajiban muslim dalam menghormati lingkungan sosial terdekat</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat dan Menjalin Silaturahmi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LAsok_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTt-XNi4uWAxXxj-EIHf3NOWEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LAsok_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LAsok_k/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu memahami konsep dasar interaksi sosial, menerapkan etika pergaulan, serta membiasakan sikap peduli, toleran, dan mempererat persaudaraan sesuai tuntunan Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Tahapan dan Metode Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Muhasabah (Refleksi Diri):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diajak merenungkan peran diri sebagai makhluk sosial yang butuh berinteraksi dengan tetangga dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Observasi Lapangan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mengamati secara berkelompok bentuk interaksi sosial dan penerapan adab di lingkungan sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalami Materi (Kajian Teks):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memaparkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang keutamaan silaturahmi, hak tetangga, dan adab bertamu.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2FZXK-F6EI&amp;t=343\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAQ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQEA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Elaborasi &amp; Diskusi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa berdiskusi memecahkan studi kasus nyata terkait konflik tetangga atau pudarnya kepedulian sosial.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAU\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQFA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ruang Aktualisasi (Praktik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Simulasi atau praktik langsung adab bertamu, saling memberi, dan menyambung kembali hubungan yang renggang.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.pai12.rubel.web.id/materi-kelas-xii/alur-belajar-bab-3\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi6vs_gi4uWAxVymeEIHQJIMe0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAY\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQGA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Afirmasi &amp; Refleksi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Penguatan karakter agar siswa terbiasa menebar senyum, berlemah lembut, dan menjaga lisan dalam masyarakat</span></div>','<p>Media pembelajaran yang efektif meliputi <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"dn7krf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjOtbPwi4uWAxVqleEIHazTMF8QuJAPegoIAggACAAIEhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf dn7krf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb dn7krf_1b/HugV6-->tayangan video interaktif, peta konsep digital, modul presentasi slide, serta Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD) berbasis studi kasus sosial di masyarakat</mark></p>','<p>Buku Paket PAI &amp; Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek serta rujukan akidah akhlak, yang merujuk pada Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang etika sosial</p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rujukan Utama Sumber Ajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket Siswa PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembahasan bab akhlak dan muamalah kemasyarakatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Dalil Naqli:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> QS. An-Nisa\' ayat 36 tentang berbuat baik kepada tetangga dekat dan jauh.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7k-nSjYuWAxUSxDgGHexIIbQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hadis Riwayat Bukhari &amp; Muslim:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Anjuran memuliakan tetangga dan tamu sebagai tanda keimanan</span></div>','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBgQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Metode Penilaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Sikap (Afektif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Observasi kebiasaan salam dan kepedulian sosial di sekolah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Pengetahuan (Kognitif):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Tes tertulis mengenai dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis tentang hak tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian Keterampilan (Psikomotorik):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Portofolio atau laporan kegiatan aksi sosial di lingkungan rumah</span></div>','2 x 45 menit','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Strategi Praktik Pedagogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kontekstualisasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan realitas sosial di lingkungan tempat tinggal peserta didik.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Keteladanan (Uswah Hasanah):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru mencontohkan sikap 5S (Sapa, Salam, Senyum, Sopan, Santun) di kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Diskusi kasus nyata konflik antar-tetangga lalu mencari solusi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjfqvO0jIuWAxWFjeEIHeg-KZsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Proyek Sosial (Aksi Nyata):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa praktik langsung menjenguk tetangga sakit, kerja bakti, atau berbagi makanan</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, silaturahmi</span>, dan hak tetangga <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"r0l3ye_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwje6ZnjjIuWAxW9leEIHXqFOpQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf r0l3ye_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb r0l3ye_1b/HugV6-->berfokus pada pembentukan karakter sosial siswa<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini menekankan bahwa hubungan baik dengan tetangga adalah tanda keimanan, mencakup sikap saling menghormati, tidak menyakiti, dan tolong-menolong dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam adab bermasyarakat mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gUIcqc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiPw7SCjYuWAxVTmeEIHSFpIFwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gUIcqc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gUIcqc_1b/HugV6-->penggunaan grup pesan instan dan media sosial untuk mempererat silaturahmi, berbagi informasi penting, dan saling membantu<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Sarana teknologi ini memudahkan komunikasi jarak jauh, namun tetap harus dilandasi etika agar hak-hak tetangga terjaga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Adab Bermasyarakat, Menjalin Silaturahmi, dan Menjaga Hak-Hak Tetangga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"YkeKf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjNncedjYuWAxUAk-EIHcABO_4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf YkeKf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb YkeKf_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman bahwa akhlak mulia tidak hanya ditujukan kepada Allah, tetapi juga diwujudkan secara nyata melalui keharmonisan sosial dan kepedulian di lingkungan tempat tinggal</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang adab bermasyarakat, menjalin silaturahmi, dan menjaga hak tetangga </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"aTHJzd_7w\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf aTHJzd_7v/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb aTHJzd_7v/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa Islam sangat mengatur hubungan sosial. Setiap Muslim wajib berbuat baik kepada tetangga, menjaga lisan, dan mempererat persaudaraan agar tercipta masyarakat yang rukun, damai, dan peduli sesama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Hasil Refleksi Diri :<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kesadaran:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya sadar masih kurang peduli dengan kondisi tetangga sekitar rumah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perbaikan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya mau mulai menyapa dan bersikap lebih ramah kepada tetangga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiy2bK6jYuWAxXF7zgGHRPzFacQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Komitmen:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Saya akan menjaga lisan dan perbuatan agar tidak mengganggu kenyamanan tetangga.</span></div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 03:56:10','2026-08-06 03:56:10'),
(92,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'PERNIKAHAN DALAM ISLAM','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 (Fase F) adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xHCOKd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwih7Y6PjouWAxXJ2DgGHaDiE-oQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xHCOKd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xHCOKd_k/HugV6-->peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi ketentuan hukum perkawinan, rukun dan syarat sah nikah, hak serta kewajiban suami istri, hingga hikmah pembentukan keluarga sakinah sesuai syariat Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan utama pernikahan dalam Islam pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 meliputi: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EJrd0b_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EJrd0b_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EJrd0b_j/HugV6-->melaksanakan ibadah kepada Allah, mengikuti sunnah Nabi, mendapatkan keturunan yang saleh, menjaga kehormatan diri dari perbuatan dosa, serta mewujudkan keluarga yang tenang, penuh cinta, dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rincian Tujuan Pernikahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Melaksanakan Ibadah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menikah adalah bentuk ketaatan kepada Allah SWT dan bernilai ibadah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengikuti Sunnah Rasul:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menjalankan petunjuk dan ajaran Nabi Muhammad SAW.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menjaga Kehormatan Diri:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menundukkan pandangan dan melindungi kemaluan dari perbuatan zina.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mendapatkan Keturunan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Melanjutkan keturunan yang sah dan mencetak generasi Islam yang berkualitas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Membentuk Keluarga Harmonis:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menciptakan ketenteraman jiwa melalui ikatan cinta dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</span></div>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Metode Pembelajaran yang Digunakan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Kelompok &amp; Analisis Kasus:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa dibagi menjadi beberapa kelompok untuk membahas isu nyata di masyarakat seperti pernikahan dini, hak dan kewajiban suami-istri, atau prosedur hukum pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/744600759/Modul-Ajar-Pernikahan-Dalam-Islam\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning (PBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diberi pertanyaan pemantik atau skenario masalah keluarga, lalu merumuskan solusi berdasarkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ceramah Interaktif &amp; Tanya Jawab:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru menjelaskan konsep dasar seperti pengertian, tujuan, rukun, syarat sah, dan mahram, lalu membuka sesi diskusi bagi siswa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.cimbniaga.co.id/id/inspirasi/perencanaan/rukun-nikah\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rcvYJNJn_z4&amp;t=16\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAR\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQEQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Demonstrasi / Simulasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Praktik atau simulasi prosesi akad nikah untuk memberikan gambaran nyata tata cara ijab kabul yang sah secara syariat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">edia pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">PAI Kelas 12<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> meliputi</p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf JTUFnb_l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb JTUFnb_l/HugV6-->slide PowerPoint interaktif, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">video animasi pembelajaran, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul digital, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">dan Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Materi ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, syarat, tujuan, dan hikmah pernikahan secara komprehensif</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Qt8Gqb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Terbaru, modul ajar, Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, serta presentasi atau video pembelajaran digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Materi ini membahas ketentuan, rukun, dan hikmah berkeluarga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Buku dan Modul Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Sumber utama dari Kementerian Agama atau Kemendikbudristek yang memuat bab khusus ketentuan pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP PAI:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Panduan pengajaran guru yang sering diunggah di platform pendidikan seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Studocu</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Modul Ajar PAI Kelas XII: Ketentuan Pernikahan dalam Islam ...&quot;,&quot;4. Rukun nikah adalah suatu perkara yang harus dipenuhi dalam pelaksanaan nikah,. jika tidak maka nikahnya tidak sah. Rukun nikah itu adalah sebagai berikut,.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcR58Qmdj6LJ3x7qTp6JrpyJaRZyb_5z47BdkD1HRxvzV3AufoCEqlid2W2tTUXr43Mdu-X5zn_ZKbb-ihI&quot;,&quot;Studocu ID&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.studocu.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,13]]],null,&quot;5d5c0de7-5f61-4774-a916-c9bf0bdaeb8c&quot;]]--></span> atau <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Materi Pernikahan dalam Islam Kelas 12 | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Sumber Belajar/Materi pelajaran: 1. Buku PAI Kelas XII Hal. 142 dan hal. 116 2. [Link] 3. [Link] c. Tiap kelompok menetapkan anggota ahli yang akan ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQBGzLsmGcZh0cPq6S3yj8u-3Xx78g94r50pWC_o5eFHp6PueN0YWkNFUjmXX7UFAlFJFF4isCjLv-g69A&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,14]]],null,&quot;3883a8e9-bc53-404c-a504-dda15a438982&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab Suci:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahan Kemenag RI sebagai rujukan dalil normatif.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup tiga aspek utama: <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gELdJd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwib4p-JkIuWAxXmhGMGHYCJGSsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gELdJd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gELdJd_k/HugV6-->penilaian sikap (afektif), pengetahuan (kognitif), dan keterampilan (psikomotorik) untuk mengukur pemahaman syariat, hikmah, dan kemampuan aplikatif siswa.</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 PAI </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"I6LSte_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf I6LSte_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb I6LSte_j/HugV6-->menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Cooperative Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Guru menerapkan metode ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok (tipe Jigsaw), analisis dalil, hingga simulasi atau praktik akad nikah secara nyata di kelas untuk menguji pemahaman rukun dan syarat sah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Pendekatan dan Model Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning (PjBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membuat proyek video simulasi prosesi akad nikah atau unjuk kerja langsung tata cara ijab kabul.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cooperative Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembelajaran kelompok kecil untuk mendiskusikan hukum fiqih munakahat, mahram, dan hak kewajiban suami istri.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Contextual Teaching and Learning (CTL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan aturan batas usia nikah yang berlaku di Indonesia agar siswa paham aspek hukum agama dan negara.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk kelas 12 PAI <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uzLvgd_15\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3zr2ej4uWAxWSSWwGHd9iO1YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uzLvgd_14/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uzLvgd_14/HugV6-->mencakup suasana kelas yang kondusif, religius, dan dialogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Proses ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, hak, kewajiban, serta hikmah berkeluarga guna membentuk generasi yang siap menjaga kesucian diri dan norma agama</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup&nbsp;<mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eKPu4e_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eKPu4e_k/HugV6-->penggunaan&nbsp;</mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul interaktif, video animasi hukum fikih, kuis gamifikasi, dan peta konsep digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pendekatan ini membuat konsep fikih munakahat lebih mudah dipahami, menarik, dan relevan bagi siswa</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">engalaman belajar materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eLEIkb_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjAiuvWj4uWAxXUe2wGHVxAEIkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eLEIkb_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eLEIkb_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman mendalam bahwa nikah bukan sekadar ikatan lahir batin, melainkan ibadah sakral untuk membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami hukum, rukun, syarat, hingga hak dan kewajiban suami istri secara kontekstual</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi pernikahan (munakahat) PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"TmYNed_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJg_fkj4uWAxVITGwGHaXnGCsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf TmYNed_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb TmYNed_j/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa pernikahan bukan sekadar urusan biologis atau sah secara hukum negara, melainkan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mitsaqan ghaliza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (janji yang kokoh), ibadah panjang kepada Allah, serta sarana menjaga kehormatan dan membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah</em></mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 04:06:35','2026-08-06 04:06:35'),
(93,7,1,NULL,23,NULL,'PERNIKAHAN DALAM ISLAM','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 (Fase F) adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xHCOKd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwih7Y6PjouWAxXJ2DgGHaDiE-oQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xHCOKd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xHCOKd_k/HugV6-->peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi ketentuan hukum perkawinan, rukun dan syarat sah nikah, hak serta kewajiban suami istri, hingga hikmah pembentukan keluarga sakinah sesuai syariat Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan utama pernikahan dalam Islam pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 meliputi: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EJrd0b_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EJrd0b_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EJrd0b_j/HugV6-->melaksanakan ibadah kepada Allah, mengikuti sunnah Nabi, mendapatkan keturunan yang saleh, menjaga kehormatan diri dari perbuatan dosa, serta mewujudkan keluarga yang tenang, penuh cinta, dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rincian Tujuan Pernikahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Melaksanakan Ibadah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menikah adalah bentuk ketaatan kepada Allah SWT dan bernilai ibadah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengikuti Sunnah Rasul:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menjalankan petunjuk dan ajaran Nabi Muhammad SAW.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menjaga Kehormatan Diri:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menundukkan pandangan dan melindungi kemaluan dari perbuatan zina.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mendapatkan Keturunan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Melanjutkan keturunan yang sah dan mencetak generasi Islam yang berkualitas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Membentuk Keluarga Harmonis:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menciptakan ketenteraman jiwa melalui ikatan cinta dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</span></div>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Metode Pembelajaran yang Digunakan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Kelompok &amp; Analisis Kasus:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa dibagi menjadi beberapa kelompok untuk membahas isu nyata di masyarakat seperti pernikahan dini, hak dan kewajiban suami-istri, atau prosedur hukum pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/744600759/Modul-Ajar-Pernikahan-Dalam-Islam\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning (PBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diberi pertanyaan pemantik atau skenario masalah keluarga, lalu merumuskan solusi berdasarkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ceramah Interaktif &amp; Tanya Jawab:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru menjelaskan konsep dasar seperti pengertian, tujuan, rukun, syarat sah, dan mahram, lalu membuka sesi diskusi bagi siswa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.cimbniaga.co.id/id/inspirasi/perencanaan/rukun-nikah\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rcvYJNJn_z4&amp;t=16\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAR\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQEQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Demonstrasi / Simulasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Praktik atau simulasi prosesi akad nikah untuk memberikan gambaran nyata tata cara ijab kabul yang sah secara syariat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">edia pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">PAI Kelas 12<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> meliputi</p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf JTUFnb_l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb JTUFnb_l/HugV6-->slide PowerPoint interaktif, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">video animasi pembelajaran, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul digital, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">dan Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Materi ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, syarat, tujuan, dan hikmah pernikahan secara komprehensif</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Qt8Gqb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Terbaru, modul ajar, Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, serta presentasi atau video pembelajaran digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Materi ini membahas ketentuan, rukun, dan hikmah berkeluarga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Buku dan Modul Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Sumber utama dari Kementerian Agama atau Kemendikbudristek yang memuat bab khusus ketentuan pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP PAI:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Panduan pengajaran guru yang sering diunggah di platform pendidikan seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Studocu</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Modul Ajar PAI Kelas XII: Ketentuan Pernikahan dalam Islam ...&quot;,&quot;4. Rukun nikah adalah suatu perkara yang harus dipenuhi dalam pelaksanaan nikah,. jika tidak maka nikahnya tidak sah. Rukun nikah itu adalah sebagai berikut,.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcR58Qmdj6LJ3x7qTp6JrpyJaRZyb_5z47BdkD1HRxvzV3AufoCEqlid2W2tTUXr43Mdu-X5zn_ZKbb-ihI&quot;,&quot;Studocu ID&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.studocu.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,13]]],null,&quot;5d5c0de7-5f61-4774-a916-c9bf0bdaeb8c&quot;]]--></span> atau <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Materi Pernikahan dalam Islam Kelas 12 | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Sumber Belajar/Materi pelajaran: 1. Buku PAI Kelas XII Hal. 142 dan hal. 116 2. [Link] 3. [Link] c. Tiap kelompok menetapkan anggota ahli yang akan ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQBGzLsmGcZh0cPq6S3yj8u-3Xx78g94r50pWC_o5eFHp6PueN0YWkNFUjmXX7UFAlFJFF4isCjLv-g69A&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,14]]],null,&quot;3883a8e9-bc53-404c-a504-dda15a438982&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab Suci:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahan Kemenag RI sebagai rujukan dalil normatif.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup tiga aspek utama: <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gELdJd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwib4p-JkIuWAxXmhGMGHYCJGSsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gELdJd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gELdJd_k/HugV6-->penilaian sikap (afektif), pengetahuan (kognitif), dan keterampilan (psikomotorik) untuk mengukur pemahaman syariat, hikmah, dan kemampuan aplikatif siswa.</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 PAI </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"I6LSte_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf I6LSte_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb I6LSte_j/HugV6-->menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Cooperative Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Guru menerapkan metode ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok (tipe Jigsaw), analisis dalil, hingga simulasi atau praktik akad nikah secara nyata di kelas untuk menguji pemahaman rukun dan syarat sah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Pendekatan dan Model Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning (PjBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membuat proyek video simulasi prosesi akad nikah atau unjuk kerja langsung tata cara ijab kabul.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cooperative Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembelajaran kelompok kecil untuk mendiskusikan hukum fiqih munakahat, mahram, dan hak kewajiban suami istri.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Contextual Teaching and Learning (CTL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan aturan batas usia nikah yang berlaku di Indonesia agar siswa paham aspek hukum agama dan negara.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk kelas 12 PAI <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uzLvgd_15\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3zr2ej4uWAxWSSWwGHd9iO1YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uzLvgd_14/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uzLvgd_14/HugV6-->mencakup suasana kelas yang kondusif, religius, dan dialogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Proses ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, hak, kewajiban, serta hikmah berkeluarga guna membentuk generasi yang siap menjaga kesucian diri dan norma agama</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup&nbsp;<mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eKPu4e_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eKPu4e_k/HugV6-->penggunaan&nbsp;</mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul interaktif, video animasi hukum fikih, kuis gamifikasi, dan peta konsep digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pendekatan ini membuat konsep fikih munakahat lebih mudah dipahami, menarik, dan relevan bagi siswa</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">engalaman belajar materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eLEIkb_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjAiuvWj4uWAxXUe2wGHVxAEIkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eLEIkb_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eLEIkb_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman mendalam bahwa nikah bukan sekadar ikatan lahir batin, melainkan ibadah sakral untuk membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami hukum, rukun, syarat, hingga hak dan kewajiban suami istri secara kontekstual</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi pernikahan (munakahat) PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"TmYNed_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJg_fkj4uWAxVITGwGHaXnGCsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf TmYNed_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb TmYNed_j/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa pernikahan bukan sekadar urusan biologis atau sah secara hukum negara, melainkan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mitsaqan ghaliza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (janji yang kokoh), ibadah panjang kepada Allah, serta sarana menjaga kehormatan dan membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah</em></mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 04:06:35','2026-08-06 04:06:35'),
(94,7,1,NULL,24,NULL,'PERNIKAHAN DALAM ISLAM','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 (Fase F) adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xHCOKd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwih7Y6PjouWAxXJ2DgGHaDiE-oQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xHCOKd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xHCOKd_k/HugV6-->peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi ketentuan hukum perkawinan, rukun dan syarat sah nikah, hak serta kewajiban suami istri, hingga hikmah pembentukan keluarga sakinah sesuai syariat Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan utama pernikahan dalam Islam pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 meliputi: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EJrd0b_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EJrd0b_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EJrd0b_j/HugV6-->melaksanakan ibadah kepada Allah, mengikuti sunnah Nabi, mendapatkan keturunan yang saleh, menjaga kehormatan diri dari perbuatan dosa, serta mewujudkan keluarga yang tenang, penuh cinta, dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rincian Tujuan Pernikahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Melaksanakan Ibadah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menikah adalah bentuk ketaatan kepada Allah SWT dan bernilai ibadah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengikuti Sunnah Rasul:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menjalankan petunjuk dan ajaran Nabi Muhammad SAW.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menjaga Kehormatan Diri:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menundukkan pandangan dan melindungi kemaluan dari perbuatan zina.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mendapatkan Keturunan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Melanjutkan keturunan yang sah dan mencetak generasi Islam yang berkualitas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Membentuk Keluarga Harmonis:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menciptakan ketenteraman jiwa melalui ikatan cinta dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</span></div>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Metode Pembelajaran yang Digunakan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Kelompok &amp; Analisis Kasus:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa dibagi menjadi beberapa kelompok untuk membahas isu nyata di masyarakat seperti pernikahan dini, hak dan kewajiban suami-istri, atau prosedur hukum pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/744600759/Modul-Ajar-Pernikahan-Dalam-Islam\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning (PBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diberi pertanyaan pemantik atau skenario masalah keluarga, lalu merumuskan solusi berdasarkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ceramah Interaktif &amp; Tanya Jawab:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru menjelaskan konsep dasar seperti pengertian, tujuan, rukun, syarat sah, dan mahram, lalu membuka sesi diskusi bagi siswa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.cimbniaga.co.id/id/inspirasi/perencanaan/rukun-nikah\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rcvYJNJn_z4&amp;t=16\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAR\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQEQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Demonstrasi / Simulasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Praktik atau simulasi prosesi akad nikah untuk memberikan gambaran nyata tata cara ijab kabul yang sah secara syariat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">edia pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">PAI Kelas 12<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> meliputi</p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf JTUFnb_l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb JTUFnb_l/HugV6-->slide PowerPoint interaktif, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">video animasi pembelajaran, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul digital, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">dan Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Materi ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, syarat, tujuan, dan hikmah pernikahan secara komprehensif</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Qt8Gqb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Terbaru, modul ajar, Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, serta presentasi atau video pembelajaran digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Materi ini membahas ketentuan, rukun, dan hikmah berkeluarga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Buku dan Modul Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Sumber utama dari Kementerian Agama atau Kemendikbudristek yang memuat bab khusus ketentuan pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP PAI:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Panduan pengajaran guru yang sering diunggah di platform pendidikan seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Studocu</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Modul Ajar PAI Kelas XII: Ketentuan Pernikahan dalam Islam ...&quot;,&quot;4. Rukun nikah adalah suatu perkara yang harus dipenuhi dalam pelaksanaan nikah,. jika tidak maka nikahnya tidak sah. Rukun nikah itu adalah sebagai berikut,.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcR58Qmdj6LJ3x7qTp6JrpyJaRZyb_5z47BdkD1HRxvzV3AufoCEqlid2W2tTUXr43Mdu-X5zn_ZKbb-ihI&quot;,&quot;Studocu ID&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.studocu.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,13]]],null,&quot;5d5c0de7-5f61-4774-a916-c9bf0bdaeb8c&quot;]]--></span> atau <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Materi Pernikahan dalam Islam Kelas 12 | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Sumber Belajar/Materi pelajaran: 1. Buku PAI Kelas XII Hal. 142 dan hal. 116 2. [Link] 3. [Link] c. Tiap kelompok menetapkan anggota ahli yang akan ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQBGzLsmGcZh0cPq6S3yj8u-3Xx78g94r50pWC_o5eFHp6PueN0YWkNFUjmXX7UFAlFJFF4isCjLv-g69A&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,14]]],null,&quot;3883a8e9-bc53-404c-a504-dda15a438982&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab Suci:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahan Kemenag RI sebagai rujukan dalil normatif.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup tiga aspek utama: <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gELdJd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwib4p-JkIuWAxXmhGMGHYCJGSsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gELdJd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gELdJd_k/HugV6-->penilaian sikap (afektif), pengetahuan (kognitif), dan keterampilan (psikomotorik) untuk mengukur pemahaman syariat, hikmah, dan kemampuan aplikatif siswa.</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 PAI </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"I6LSte_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf I6LSte_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb I6LSte_j/HugV6-->menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Cooperative Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Guru menerapkan metode ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok (tipe Jigsaw), analisis dalil, hingga simulasi atau praktik akad nikah secara nyata di kelas untuk menguji pemahaman rukun dan syarat sah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Pendekatan dan Model Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning (PjBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membuat proyek video simulasi prosesi akad nikah atau unjuk kerja langsung tata cara ijab kabul.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cooperative Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembelajaran kelompok kecil untuk mendiskusikan hukum fiqih munakahat, mahram, dan hak kewajiban suami istri.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Contextual Teaching and Learning (CTL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan aturan batas usia nikah yang berlaku di Indonesia agar siswa paham aspek hukum agama dan negara.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk kelas 12 PAI <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uzLvgd_15\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3zr2ej4uWAxWSSWwGHd9iO1YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uzLvgd_14/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uzLvgd_14/HugV6-->mencakup suasana kelas yang kondusif, religius, dan dialogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Proses ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, hak, kewajiban, serta hikmah berkeluarga guna membentuk generasi yang siap menjaga kesucian diri dan norma agama</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup&nbsp;<mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eKPu4e_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eKPu4e_k/HugV6-->penggunaan&nbsp;</mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul interaktif, video animasi hukum fikih, kuis gamifikasi, dan peta konsep digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pendekatan ini membuat konsep fikih munakahat lebih mudah dipahami, menarik, dan relevan bagi siswa</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">engalaman belajar materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eLEIkb_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjAiuvWj4uWAxXUe2wGHVxAEIkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eLEIkb_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eLEIkb_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman mendalam bahwa nikah bukan sekadar ikatan lahir batin, melainkan ibadah sakral untuk membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami hukum, rukun, syarat, hingga hak dan kewajiban suami istri secara kontekstual</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi pernikahan (munakahat) PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"TmYNed_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJg_fkj4uWAxVITGwGHaXnGCsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf TmYNed_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb TmYNed_j/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa pernikahan bukan sekadar urusan biologis atau sah secara hukum negara, melainkan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mitsaqan ghaliza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (janji yang kokoh), ibadah panjang kepada Allah, serta sarana menjaga kehormatan dan membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah</em></mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 04:06:35','2026-08-06 04:06:35'),
(95,7,1,NULL,25,NULL,'PERNIKAHAN DALAM ISLAM','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 (Fase F) adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xHCOKd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwih7Y6PjouWAxXJ2DgGHaDiE-oQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xHCOKd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xHCOKd_k/HugV6-->peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi ketentuan hukum perkawinan, rukun dan syarat sah nikah, hak serta kewajiban suami istri, hingga hikmah pembentukan keluarga sakinah sesuai syariat Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan utama pernikahan dalam Islam pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 meliputi: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EJrd0b_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EJrd0b_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EJrd0b_j/HugV6-->melaksanakan ibadah kepada Allah, mengikuti sunnah Nabi, mendapatkan keturunan yang saleh, menjaga kehormatan diri dari perbuatan dosa, serta mewujudkan keluarga yang tenang, penuh cinta, dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rincian Tujuan Pernikahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Melaksanakan Ibadah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menikah adalah bentuk ketaatan kepada Allah SWT dan bernilai ibadah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengikuti Sunnah Rasul:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menjalankan petunjuk dan ajaran Nabi Muhammad SAW.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menjaga Kehormatan Diri:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menundukkan pandangan dan melindungi kemaluan dari perbuatan zina.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mendapatkan Keturunan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Melanjutkan keturunan yang sah dan mencetak generasi Islam yang berkualitas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwja6OmwjouWAxWYhGMGHaFvMJoQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Membentuk Keluarga Harmonis:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menciptakan ketenteraman jiwa melalui ikatan cinta dan kasih sayang (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">sakinah, mawaddah, wa rahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)</span></div>','<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Metode Pembelajaran yang Digunakan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Kelompok &amp; Analisis Kasus:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa dibagi menjadi beberapa kelompok untuk membahas isu nyata di masyarakat seperti pernikahan dini, hak dan kewajiban suami-istri, atau prosedur hukum pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/744600759/Modul-Ajar-Pernikahan-Dalam-Islam\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning (PBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa diberi pertanyaan pemantik atau skenario masalah keluarga, lalu merumuskan solusi berdasarkan dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOP2MgVFjVo&amp;t=154\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Ceramah Interaktif &amp; Tanya Jawab:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru menjelaskan konsep dasar seperti pengertian, tujuan, rukun, syarat sah, dan mahram, lalu membuka sesi diskusi bagi siswa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.cimbniaga.co.id/id/inspirasi/perencanaan/rukun-nikah\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rcvYJNJn_z4&amp;t=16\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-p9bIjouWAxUpyDgGHThdBlgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAR\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQEQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Demonstrasi / Simulasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Praktik atau simulasi prosesi akad nikah untuk memberikan gambaran nyata tata cara ijab kabul yang sah secara syariat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">edia pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">PAI Kelas 12<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> meliputi</p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf JTUFnb_l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb JTUFnb_l/HugV6-->slide PowerPoint interaktif, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">video animasi pembelajaran, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul digital, </mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"JTUFnb_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjWubfYjouWAxXG7TgGHZvwH_wQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">dan Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Materi ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, syarat, tujuan, dan hikmah pernikahan secara komprehensif</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Qt8Gqb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Qt8Gqb_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Terbaru, modul ajar, Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, serta presentasi atau video pembelajaran digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Materi ini membahas ketentuan, rukun, dan hikmah berkeluarga.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Buku dan Modul Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Sumber utama dari Kementerian Agama atau Kemendikbudristek yang memuat bab khusus ketentuan pernikahan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP PAI:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Panduan pengajaran guru yang sering diunggah di platform pendidikan seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Studocu</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.studocu.id/id/document/uin-sunan-ampel-surabaya/sekolah-tinggi-ilmu/modul-ajar-pai-kelas-xii-bab-9/114094684&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Modul Ajar PAI Kelas XII: Ketentuan Pernikahan dalam Islam ...&quot;,&quot;4. Rukun nikah adalah suatu perkara yang harus dipenuhi dalam pelaksanaan nikah,. jika tidak maka nikahnya tidak sah. Rukun nikah itu adalah sebagai berikut,.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcR58Qmdj6LJ3x7qTp6JrpyJaRZyb_5z47BdkD1HRxvzV3AufoCEqlid2W2tTUXr43Mdu-X5zn_ZKbb-ihI&quot;,&quot;Studocu ID&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.studocu.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,13]]],null,&quot;5d5c0de7-5f61-4774-a916-c9bf0bdaeb8c&quot;]]--></span> atau <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIDBAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/848629656/MODUL-PERNIKAHAN-DALAM-ISLAM&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Materi Pernikahan dalam Islam Kelas 12 | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Sumber Belajar/Materi pelajaran: 1. Buku PAI Kelas XII Hal. 142 dan hal. 116 2. [Link] 3. [Link] c. Tiap kelompok menetapkan anggota ahli yang akan ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQBGzLsmGcZh0cPq6S3yj8u-3Xx78g94r50pWC_o5eFHp6PueN0YWkNFUjmXX7UFAlFJFF4isCjLv-g69A&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785989108792619,107759655,2383010525],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,14]]],null,&quot;3883a8e9-bc53-404c-a504-dda15a438982&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwir-pvzj4uWAxUnSGwGHd3aCY4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab Suci:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahan Kemenag RI sebagai rujukan dalil normatif.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 mencakup tiga aspek utama: <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gELdJd_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwib4p-JkIuWAxXmhGMGHYCJGSsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gELdJd_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gELdJd_k/HugV6-->penilaian sikap (afektif), pengetahuan (kognitif), dan keterampilan (psikomotorik) untuk mengukur pemahaman syariat, hikmah, dan kemampuan aplikatif siswa.</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran materi pernikahan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 PAI </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"I6LSte_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf I6LSte_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb I6LSte_j/HugV6-->menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Cooperative Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Guru menerapkan metode ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok (tipe Jigsaw), analisis dalil, hingga simulasi atau praktik akad nikah secara nyata di kelas untuk menguji pemahaman rukun dan syarat sah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Pendekatan dan Model Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning (PjBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membuat proyek video simulasi prosesi akad nikah atau unjuk kerja langsung tata cara ijab kabul.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cooperative Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pembelajaran kelompok kecil untuk mendiskusikan hukum fiqih munakahat, mahram, dan hak kewajiban suami istri.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi82P36jouWAxVqUGcHHScDM-4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Contextual Teaching and Learning (CTL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi dengan aturan batas usia nikah yang berlaku di Indonesia agar siswa paham aspek hukum agama dan negara.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk kelas 12 PAI <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uzLvgd_15\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3zr2ej4uWAxWSSWwGHd9iO1YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uzLvgd_14/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uzLvgd_14/HugV6-->mencakup suasana kelas yang kondusif, religius, dan dialogis<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>\r\n<p>Proses ini berfokus pada pemahaman hukum, rukun, hak, kewajiban, serta hikmah berkeluarga guna membentuk generasi yang siap menjaga kesucian diri dan norma agama</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup&nbsp;<mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eKPu4e_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eKPu4e_k/HugV6-->penggunaan&nbsp;</mark></p>\r\n<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eKPu4e_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjcjaK1j4uWAxVpSGcHHZBMA5MQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">e-modul interaktif, video animasi hukum fikih, kuis gamifikasi, dan peta konsep digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pendekatan ini membuat konsep fikih munakahat lebih mudah dipahami, menarik, dan relevan bagi siswa</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">engalaman belajar materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pernikahan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eLEIkb_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjAiuvWj4uWAxXUe2wGHVxAEIkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eLEIkb_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eLEIkb_k/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman mendalam bahwa nikah bukan sekadar ikatan lahir batin, melainkan ibadah sakral untuk membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami hukum, rukun, syarat, hingga hak dan kewajiban suami istri secara kontekstual</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi pernikahan (munakahat) PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"TmYNed_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJg_fkj4uWAxVITGwGHaXnGCsQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf TmYNed_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb TmYNed_j/HugV6-->menunjukkan bahwa pernikahan bukan sekadar urusan biologis atau sah secara hukum negara, melainkan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mitsaqan ghaliza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (janji yang kokoh), ibadah panjang kepada Allah, serta sarana menjaga kehormatan dan membentuk keluarga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sakinah, mawaddah, warahmah</em></mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 04:06:35','2026-08-06 04:06:35'),
(96,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia','<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"abEQGe_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi1nJK1souWAxVNgeEIHROqGpkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf abEQGe_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb abEQGe_1b/HugV6-->mampu menganalisis, mempresentasikan, dan membiasakan membaca dalil terkait, dengan keyakinan bahwa menjaga keselamatan nyawa sesama manusia bernilai setara dengan memelihara kehidupan seluruh umat manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi memelihara kehidupan manusia pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Fase F Kelas 12 Kurikulum Merdeka adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"v7gfhd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiH5ejUsouWAxXLOS4FHXswN60QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf v7gfhd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb v7gfhd_j/HugV6-->agar peserta didik mampu menganalisis ayat Al-Qur\'an dan hadis terkait, menyajikan pesan utamanya, serta membiasakan sikap peduli sosial dan toleransi dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"memelihara kehidupan manusia\" (berdasarkan Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32)</span> umumnya menggunakan <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"TnBbuf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf TnBbuf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb TnBbuf_1b/HugV6-->pendekatan aktif-kolaboratif seperti <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">diskusi kelompok, studi kasus, simulasi sosial, dan berbasis proyek<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk menumbuhkan kepedulian sosial dan pencegahan tindak kekerasan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Macam-Macam Metode Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Diskusi &amp; Tanya Jawab:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membahas makna ayat tentang larangan membunuh jiwa dan pentingnya menyelamatkan nyawa manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning (PBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memberikan contoh kasus nyata seperti perundungan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">bullying<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), tawuran, atau kekerasan, lalu siswa mencari solusi pencegahannya dalam perspektif Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Role Play (Bermain Peran / Simulasi):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mensimulasikan cara menyelesaikan konflik antarteman secara damai dan toleran.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Ceramah &amp; Refleksi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru menjelaskan konsep dasar <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hifz an-nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (menjaga jiwa) yang diakhiri dengan renungan atau tadabbur ayat.</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang \"Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia\" mencakup penggunaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"VbGGId_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj6oIj0souWAxVbm-EIHVASKf4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf VbGGId_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb VbGGId_1b/HugV6-->presentasi PowerPoint (PPT), video animasi interaktif, infografis Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5:32, serta modul ajar digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Materi ini fokus pada larangan melakukan tindakan kekerasan, pembunuhan, serta pentingnya menjaga keselamatan dan kelangsungan hidup sesama manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Media Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj6oIj0souWAxVbm-EIHVASKf4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; 