" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Situs Pembelajaran PAI<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Akses ringkasan materi dan alur belajar interaktif melalui Rubel PAI 12<!--TgQPHd|||[]-->.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjk5Z-gtIuWAxXlkOEIHb5KEbUQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi &amp; Dokumen Pembanding<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Materi ringkas dalam format PPT dan PDF dapat ditinjau melalui SlideShare<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> atau Scribd<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> dengan kata kunci \"Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia PAI Kelas 12\".<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjk5Z-gtIuWAxXlkOEIHb5KEbUQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Artikel Resmi Kemenag<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan kontekstual mengenai hifdzu an-nafs (penjagaan jiwa) diulas dalam publikasi Kemenag RI<!--TgQPHd|||[]-->.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia (berdasarkan Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32) mencakup tiga aspek utama: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Rfahqd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjFvOK6tIuWAxWQOS4FHUx_CYAQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Rfahqd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Rfahqd_1b/HugV6-->penilaian sikap (afektif) untuk mengukur kepedulian sosial, penilaian pengetahuan (kognitif) terkait pemahaman dalil dan makna, serta penilaian keterampilan (psikomotorik) melalui praktik atau kampanye penyelamatan nyawa</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia merujuk pada Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32</span>. Guru menggunakan pendekatan berbasis penyelidikan, diskusi kontekstual isu sosial (seperti perundungan atau kekerasan), serta proyek kepedulian nyata untuk menanamkan nilai penjagaan jiwa (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hifz an-nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) dan toleransi.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Perencanaan Pembelajaran (Pedagogi)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiewcOOs4uWAxUQieEIHVtSPKQQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cek <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">pemahaman awal<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> siswa tentang nilai kemanusiaan dan etika keselamatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiewcOOs4uWAxUQieEIHVtSPKQQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tentukan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tujuan belajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> agar siswa mampu membaca, menganalisis makna, dan meneladani pesan Al-Qur\'an.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiewcOOs4uWAxUQieEIHVtSPKQQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Siapkan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">media kontekstual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> berupa studi kasus penanganan konflik atau aksi kemanusiaan di masyarakat</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi PAI kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia berpusat pada pemahaman Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32</span> dan hadis terkait, yang menyatakan bahwa membunuh satu jiwa sama dengan membunuh seluruh manusia, sebaliknya menjaga satu kehidupan berarti menyelamatkan seluruh umat manusia. Pembelajaran ini <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"tEUgMc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQuJAPegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf tEUgMc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb tEUgMc_1b/HugV6-->membentuk sikap peduli, antikekerasan, dan menjaga kelestarian alam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Pokok Materi Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kajian Dalil Naqli<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Membaca, mengartikan, dan menganalisis Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32 serta hadis tentang nilai kesucian nyawa manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Konsep Pemeliharaan Jiwa (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hifzh an-Nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Memahami bahwa menjaga keselamatan, kesehatan, dan hak hidup sesama adalah kewajiban agama.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kepedulian Sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menghindari tindakan perundungan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">bullying<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), tawuran, kekerasan fisik, dan egoisme yang merugikan orang lain.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pelestarian Lingkungan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menjaga kebersihan dan kenyamanan lingkungan sekitar sebagai sarana pendukung kehidupan yang sehat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital dalam pembelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 pada materi memelihara kehidupan manusia (</span><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hifzhun nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) merujuk pada penggunaan media berbasis teknologi seperti video visualisasi, perpustakaan digital, dan forum diskusi daring. Tujuannya adalah untuk menginternalisasi nilai penyelamatan jiwa, kepedulian sosial, serta pencegahan kekerasan atau perundungan sesuai pesan Q.S. al-Māidah/5: 32 secara kontekstual</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\"Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia\"<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 (berdasarkan rujukan utama Q.S. al-Māidah/5: 32) <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eyVr7c_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjCwrz-s4uWAxWTgOEIHTwPJjEQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eyVr7c_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eyVr7c_k/HugV6-->berfokus pada pemahaman bahwa menjaga satu nyawa manusia bernilai setara dengan memelihara seluruh umat manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini membangun kesadaran afektif dan sosial siswa agar cinta damai serta peduli terhadap sesama</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia (berdasarkan Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5:32)</span> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"VK3MBb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ35eRtIuWAxW9m-EIHUIVLlwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf VK3MBb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb VK3MBb_j/HugV6-->menyadarkan kita bahwa menjaga satu nyawa sama dengan menjaga seluruh manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini menegaskan pentingnya menghargai hak hidup, menghindari kekerasan, serta menumbuhkan kepedulian sosial dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 06:49:29','2026-08-06 06:49:29'),
(98,7,1,NULL,24,NULL,'Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia','<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"abEQGe_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi1nJK1souWAxVNgeEIHROqGpkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf abEQGe_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb abEQGe_1b/HugV6-->mampu menganalisis, mempresentasikan, dan membiasakan membaca dalil terkait, dengan keyakinan bahwa menjaga keselamatan nyawa sesama manusia bernilai setara dengan memelihara kehidupan seluruh umat manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi memelihara kehidupan manusia pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Fase F Kelas 12 Kurikulum Merdeka adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"v7gfhd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiH5ejUsouWAxXLOS4FHXswN60QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf v7gfhd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb v7gfhd_j/HugV6-->agar peserta didik mampu menganalisis ayat Al-Qur\'an dan hadis terkait, menyajikan pesan utamanya, serta membiasakan sikap peduli sosial dan toleransi dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"memelihara kehidupan manusia\" (berdasarkan Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32)</span> umumnya menggunakan <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"TnBbuf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf TnBbuf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb TnBbuf_1b/HugV6-->pendekatan aktif-kolaboratif seperti <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">diskusi kelompok, studi kasus, simulasi sosial, dan berbasis proyek<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk menumbuhkan kepedulian sosial dan pencegahan tindak kekerasan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Macam-Macam Metode Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Diskusi &amp; Tanya Jawab:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membahas makna ayat tentang larangan membunuh jiwa dan pentingnya menyelamatkan nyawa manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem-Based Learning (PBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memberikan contoh kasus nyata seperti perundungan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">bullying<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), tawuran, atau kekerasan, lalu siswa mencari solusi pencegahannya dalam perspektif Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Role Play (Bermain Peran / Simulasi):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mensimulasikan cara menyelesaikan konflik antarteman secara damai dan toleran.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj5263jsouWAxXnDy4FHSgaMkQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Ceramah &amp; Refleksi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru menjelaskan konsep dasar <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hifz an-nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (menjaga jiwa) yang diakhiri dengan renungan atau tadabbur ayat.</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang \"Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia\" mencakup penggunaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"VbGGId_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj6oIj0souWAxVbm-EIHVASKf4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf VbGGId_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb VbGGId_1b/HugV6-->presentasi PowerPoint (PPT), video animasi interaktif, infografis Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5:32, serta modul ajar digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Materi ini fokus pada larangan melakukan tindakan kekerasan, pembunuhan, serta pentingnya menjaga keselamatan dan kelangsungan hidup sesama manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Media Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj6oIj0souWAxVbm-EIHVASKf4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; 