" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Situs Pembelajaran PAI<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Akses ringkasan materi dan alur belajar interaktif melalui Rubel PAI 12<!--TgQPHd|||[]-->.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjk5Z-gtIuWAxXlkOEIHb5KEbUQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi &amp; Dokumen Pembanding<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Materi ringkas dalam format PPT dan PDF dapat ditinjau melalui SlideShare<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> atau Scribd<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> dengan kata kunci \"Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia PAI Kelas 12\".<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjk5Z-gtIuWAxXlkOEIHb5KEbUQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Artikel Resmi Kemenag<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan kontekstual mengenai hifdzu an-nafs (penjagaan jiwa) diulas dalam publikasi Kemenag RI<!--TgQPHd|||[]-->.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia (berdasarkan Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32) mencakup tiga aspek utama: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Rfahqd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjFvOK6tIuWAxWQOS4FHUx_CYAQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Rfahqd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Rfahqd_1b/HugV6-->penilaian sikap (afektif) untuk mengukur kepedulian sosial, penilaian pengetahuan (kognitif) terkait pemahaman dalil dan makna, serta penilaian keterampilan (psikomotorik) melalui praktik atau kampanye penyelamatan nyawa</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia merujuk pada Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32</span>. Guru menggunakan pendekatan berbasis penyelidikan, diskusi kontekstual isu sosial (seperti perundungan atau kekerasan), serta proyek kepedulian nyata untuk menanamkan nilai penjagaan jiwa (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hifz an-nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) dan toleransi.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Perencanaan Pembelajaran (Pedagogi)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiewcOOs4uWAxUQieEIHVtSPKQQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cek <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">pemahaman awal<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> siswa tentang nilai kemanusiaan dan etika keselamatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiewcOOs4uWAxUQieEIHVtSPKQQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tentukan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tujuan belajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> agar siswa mampu membaca, menganalisis makna, dan meneladani pesan Al-Qur\'an.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiewcOOs4uWAxUQieEIHVtSPKQQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Siapkan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">media kontekstual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> berupa studi kasus penanganan konflik atau aksi kemanusiaan di masyarakat</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi PAI kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia berpusat pada pemahaman Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32</span> dan hadis terkait, yang menyatakan bahwa membunuh satu jiwa sama dengan membunuh seluruh manusia, sebaliknya menjaga satu kehidupan berarti menyelamatkan seluruh umat manusia. Pembelajaran ini <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"tEUgMc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQuJAPegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf tEUgMc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb tEUgMc_1b/HugV6-->membentuk sikap peduli, antikekerasan, dan menjaga kelestarian alam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Pokok Materi Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kajian Dalil Naqli<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Membaca, mengartikan, dan menganalisis Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5: 32 serta hadis tentang nilai kesucian nyawa manusia.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Konsep Pemeliharaan Jiwa (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hifzh an-Nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Memahami bahwa menjaga keselamatan, kesehatan, dan hak hidup sesama adalah kewajiban agama.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kepedulian Sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menghindari tindakan perundungan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">bullying<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), tawuran, kekerasan fisik, dan egoisme yang merugikan orang lain.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj_rIyns4uWAxVvj-EIHerAGToQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pelestarian Lingkungan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menjaga kebersihan dan kenyamanan lingkungan sekitar sebagai sarana pendukung kehidupan yang sehat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital dalam pembelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 pada materi memelihara kehidupan manusia (</span><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hifzhun nafs<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) merujuk pada penggunaan media berbasis teknologi seperti video visualisasi, perpustakaan digital, dan forum diskusi daring. Tujuannya adalah untuk menginternalisasi nilai penyelamatan jiwa, kepedulian sosial, serta pencegahan kekerasan atau perundungan sesuai pesan Q.S. al-Māidah/5: 32 secara kontekstual</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\"Memelihara Kehidupan Manusia\"<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 (berdasarkan rujukan utama Q.S. al-Māidah/5: 32) <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"eyVr7c_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjCwrz-s4uWAxWTgOEIHTwPJjEQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf eyVr7c_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb eyVr7c_k/HugV6-->berfokus pada pemahaman bahwa menjaga satu nyawa manusia bernilai setara dengan memelihara seluruh umat manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini membangun kesadaran afektif dan sosial siswa agar cinta damai serta peduli terhadap sesama</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang memelihara kehidupan manusia (berdasarkan Q.S. Al-Ma\'idah/5:32)</span> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"VK3MBb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiJ35eRtIuWAxW9m-EIHUIVLlwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf VK3MBb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb VK3MBb_j/HugV6-->menyadarkan kita bahwa menjaga satu nyawa sama dengan menjaga seluruh manusia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini menegaskan pentingnya menghargai hak hidup, menghindari kekerasan, serta menumbuhkan kepedulian sosial dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 06:49:29','2026-08-06 06:49:29'),
(100,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'Hari Akhir','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 (Fase F) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"SGmnv_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4rd_wtIuWAxXAjOEIHT6dO6YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf SGmnv_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb SGmnv_j/HugV6-->menargetkan peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi makna iman kepada hari akhir, serta mengaitkannya dengan perilaku jujur, tanggung jawab, dan etika dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EFFZU_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjrJCDtYuWAxWOlOEIHfKTNv0QuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EFFZU_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EFFZU_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menganalisis makna dan dalil, mengidentifikasi tanda-tanda serta tahapan yaumul akhir, menyajikan kaitan iman dengan perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab, serta meyakini adanya hari pembalasan dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir (Kiamat) yang efektif meliputi </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"D55Ozb_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwipxOmWtYuWAxU6kOEIHfddLAIQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf D55Ozb_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb D55Ozb_1b/HugV6-->metode <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">diskusi kelompok<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengkaji tanda-tanda kiamat, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">probing-prompting<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk menggali pemahaman, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">contextual teaching and learning (CTL)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengaitkan amal dengan kehidupan sehari-hari, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tontonan video reflektif</strong></mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir dapat menggunakan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"koLxJe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf koLxJe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb koLxJe_j/HugV6-->tayangan slide presentasi <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAC\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Dokumen ini membahas tentang makna dan perilaku beriman pada hari akhir, termasuk dalil dan tanda-tanda kiamat. Perilaku yang dianjurkan meliputi kejujuran, tanggung jawab, dan memilih teman yang baik. Hikmah dari iman kepada hari akhir mencakup ketaatan kepada Allah, ketenangan jiwa, dan motivasi untuk berusaha. - Download as a PPT, PDF or view online for free.&quot;,null,null,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,4]]],null,&quot;007333e2-4b9a-4d98-a3b4-269be582761a&quot;]]--></span>, video animasi fase kiamat <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f1oq9tS0Tx0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003df1oq9tS0Tx0&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...&quot;,&quot;Setelah alam semesta hancur total dan kehidupan semua makhluk berakhir, manusia akan menjalani tahapan kehidupan baru menuju alam baqa. Tahapan-tahapan tersebut meliputi Yaumul Ba&#39;ats (hari kebangkitan), Yaumul Hasyr (hari berkumpul), buku catatan amal, Yaumul Hisab (hari perhitungan amal) dan Mizan (timbangan amal), As-Shirath (jembatan di atas neraka), dan Yaumul Jaza (hari pembalasan). Balasan perbuatan baik adalah surga dan balasan perbuatan buruk adalah neraka.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQuqJEEVXIuZImFqb0MG6tAR1AekZTlH073XE6GI9GaE7z8OqBRxwHXg0l0GGS_34spFDMN2PlIU3fmKlk&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,5]]],null,&quot;42e3a35e-119a-464c-918a-f5e165ec7862&quot;]]--></span>, infografis tanda kiamat, peta konsep digital, serta kuis interaktif untuk evaluasi pemahaman siswa</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar utama untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Iman kepada Hari Akhir\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"ITJ0Ac_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Merdeka atau K-13 dari Kemendikbudristek, Kitab Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, modul ajar digital, serta video pembelajaran interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab suci<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Al-Qur\'anul Karim dan kitab tafsir untuk mengkaji ayat-ayat tentang kiamat sughra, kubra, dan fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Lembar kerja atau modul ajar PDF tentang iman kepada hari akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video online<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan alur fase hari akhir (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Yaumul Ba\'ats<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hisab<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mizan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, hingga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Jaza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) di platform edukasi</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Beriman kepada Hari Akhir<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"sbYMvf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjP3rustouWAxVrwTgGHe7iBGcQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf sbYMvf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb sbYMvf_k/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah penting: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">kognitif (pengetahuan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">afektif (sikap)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">psikomotorik (keterampilan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Penilaian ini mengukur pemahaman siswa tentang tanda-tanda kiamat, tahapan alam akhirat, serta penerapannya pada perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab</p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Beriman kepada Hari Akhir\"</span> menerapkan pendekatan berpusat pada peserta didik (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">student-centered<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>). Guru memadukan metode diskusi kelompok, analisis dalil, penayangan video kontekstual, dan refleksi perilaku jujur serta tanggung jawab agar siswa mampu mengaitkan keyakinan kiamat dengan kehidupan sehari-akherat</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) tentang Iman kepada Hari Akhir untuk kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"vXxghd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf vXxghd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb vXxghd_1b/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas yang religius, fasilitas digital interaktif, serta kegiatan reflektif di luar kelas untuk menumbuhkan kesadaran moral, tanggung jawab sosial, dan keyakinan peserta didik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Fisik dan Non-Fisik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Suasana Religius:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Ruang kelas yang bersih, tenang, dan dihiasi kaligrafi atau poster pengingat kematian agar siswa mudah fokus berfikir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Diskusi Terbuka:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memimpin suasana yang aman bagi siswa untuk bertanya dan membahas tanda-tanda kiamat serta fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Integrasi Digital:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pemanfaatan proyektor atau gawai untuk menampilkan video simulasi kehancuran alam semesta dan dalil ayat Al-Qur\'an terkait.</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pada materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir dapat dilakukan melalui </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xWIFgd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xWIFgd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xWIFgd_j/HugV6-->kuis interaktif, video animasi kiamat, dan forum diskusi daring untuk meningkatkan pemahaman siswa secara visual dan kontekstual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/modul-ajar-deep-learning-pai-bp-kelas-12-semester-2-terbaru-2026/285819572\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Media dan Metode Digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Animasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Tampilkan simulasi proses terjadinya kiamat kubra dari kanal YouTube edukasi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kuis Interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Gunakan Quizizz<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> atau Kahoot<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk evaluasi bab Hari Akhir secara seru.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Presentasi Visual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Pakai Canva<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk membuat infografis tanda-tanda kiamat sugra dan kubra.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">E-Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Manfaatkan Google Classroom atau LMS sekolah untuk mengumpulkan tugas refleksi kehidupan akhirat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman belajar materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"kCXEHc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjV-IL-tYuWAxVmhGMGHeUqHPgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf kCXEHc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb kCXEHc_j/HugV6-->memberikan kesadaran mendalam bahwa hidup di dunia bersifat sementara<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami proses kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta mawas diri untuk memperbanyak amal saleh dan meninggalkan perbuatan buruk.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"p6Zx4e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjE7_SNtouWAxV_4TgGHTjYAukQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf p6Zx4e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb p6Zx4e_j/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta kesadaran diri untuk meningkatkan amal saleh, meninggalkan larangan Allah, dan menjadikan kehidupan dunia sebagai persiapan menuju akhirat</mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 06:57:32','2026-08-06 06:57:32'),
(101,7,1,NULL,23,NULL,'Hari Akhir','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 (Fase F) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"SGmnv_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4rd_wtIuWAxXAjOEIHT6dO6YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf SGmnv_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb SGmnv_j/HugV6-->menargetkan peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi makna iman kepada hari akhir, serta mengaitkannya dengan perilaku jujur, tanggung jawab, dan etika dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EFFZU_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjrJCDtYuWAxWOlOEIHfKTNv0QuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EFFZU_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EFFZU_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menganalisis makna dan dalil, mengidentifikasi tanda-tanda serta tahapan yaumul akhir, menyajikan kaitan iman dengan perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab, serta meyakini adanya hari pembalasan dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir (Kiamat) yang efektif meliputi </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"D55Ozb_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwipxOmWtYuWAxU6kOEIHfddLAIQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf D55Ozb_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb D55Ozb_1b/HugV6-->metode <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">diskusi kelompok<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengkaji tanda-tanda kiamat, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">probing-prompting<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk menggali pemahaman, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">contextual teaching and learning (CTL)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengaitkan amal dengan kehidupan sehari-hari, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tontonan video reflektif</strong></mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir dapat menggunakan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"koLxJe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf koLxJe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb koLxJe_j/HugV6-->tayangan slide presentasi <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAC\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Dokumen ini membahas tentang makna dan perilaku beriman pada hari akhir, termasuk dalil dan tanda-tanda kiamat. Perilaku yang dianjurkan meliputi kejujuran, tanggung jawab, dan memilih teman yang baik. Hikmah dari iman kepada hari akhir mencakup ketaatan kepada Allah, ketenangan jiwa, dan motivasi untuk berusaha. - Download as a PPT, PDF or view online for free.&quot;,null,null,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,4]]],null,&quot;007333e2-4b9a-4d98-a3b4-269be582761a&quot;]]--></span>, video animasi fase kiamat <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f1oq9tS0Tx0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003df1oq9tS0Tx0&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...&quot;,&quot;Setelah alam semesta hancur total dan kehidupan semua makhluk berakhir, manusia akan menjalani tahapan kehidupan baru menuju alam baqa. Tahapan-tahapan tersebut meliputi Yaumul Ba&#39;ats (hari kebangkitan), Yaumul Hasyr (hari berkumpul), buku catatan amal, Yaumul Hisab (hari perhitungan amal) dan Mizan (timbangan amal), As-Shirath (jembatan di atas neraka), dan Yaumul Jaza (hari pembalasan). Balasan perbuatan baik adalah surga dan balasan perbuatan buruk adalah neraka.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQuqJEEVXIuZImFqb0MG6tAR1AekZTlH073XE6GI9GaE7z8OqBRxwHXg0l0GGS_34spFDMN2PlIU3fmKlk&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,5]]],null,&quot;42e3a35e-119a-464c-918a-f5e165ec7862&quot;]]--></span>, infografis tanda kiamat, peta konsep digital, serta kuis interaktif untuk evaluasi pemahaman siswa</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar utama untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Iman kepada Hari Akhir\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"ITJ0Ac_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Merdeka atau K-13 dari Kemendikbudristek, Kitab Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, modul ajar digital, serta video pembelajaran interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab suci<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Al-Qur\'anul Karim dan kitab tafsir untuk mengkaji ayat-ayat tentang kiamat sughra, kubra, dan fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Lembar kerja atau modul ajar PDF tentang iman kepada hari akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video online<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan alur fase hari akhir (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Yaumul Ba\'ats<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hisab<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mizan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, hingga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Jaza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) di platform edukasi</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Beriman kepada Hari Akhir<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"sbYMvf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjP3rustouWAxVrwTgGHe7iBGcQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf sbYMvf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb sbYMvf_k/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah penting: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">kognitif (pengetahuan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">afektif (sikap)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">psikomotorik (keterampilan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Penilaian ini mengukur pemahaman siswa tentang tanda-tanda kiamat, tahapan alam akhirat, serta penerapannya pada perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab</p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Beriman kepada Hari Akhir\"</span> menerapkan pendekatan berpusat pada peserta didik (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">student-centered<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>). Guru memadukan metode diskusi kelompok, analisis dalil, penayangan video kontekstual, dan refleksi perilaku jujur serta tanggung jawab agar siswa mampu mengaitkan keyakinan kiamat dengan kehidupan sehari-akherat</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) tentang Iman kepada Hari Akhir untuk kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"vXxghd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf vXxghd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb vXxghd_1b/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas yang religius, fasilitas digital interaktif, serta kegiatan reflektif di luar kelas untuk menumbuhkan kesadaran moral, tanggung jawab sosial, dan keyakinan peserta didik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Fisik dan Non-Fisik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Suasana Religius:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Ruang kelas yang bersih, tenang, dan dihiasi kaligrafi atau poster pengingat kematian agar siswa mudah fokus berfikir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Diskusi Terbuka:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memimpin suasana yang aman bagi siswa untuk bertanya dan membahas tanda-tanda kiamat serta fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Integrasi Digital:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pemanfaatan proyektor atau gawai untuk menampilkan video simulasi kehancuran alam semesta dan dalil ayat Al-Qur\'an terkait.</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pada materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir dapat dilakukan melalui </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xWIFgd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xWIFgd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xWIFgd_j/HugV6-->kuis interaktif, video animasi kiamat, dan forum diskusi daring untuk meningkatkan pemahaman siswa secara visual dan kontekstual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/modul-ajar-deep-learning-pai-bp-kelas-12-semester-2-terbaru-2026/285819572\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Media dan Metode Digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Animasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Tampilkan simulasi proses terjadinya kiamat kubra dari kanal YouTube edukasi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kuis Interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Gunakan Quizizz<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> atau Kahoot<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk evaluasi bab Hari Akhir secara seru.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Presentasi Visual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Pakai Canva<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk membuat infografis tanda-tanda kiamat sugra dan kubra.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">E-Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Manfaatkan Google Classroom atau LMS sekolah untuk mengumpulkan tugas refleksi kehidupan akhirat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman belajar materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"kCXEHc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjV-IL-tYuWAxVmhGMGHeUqHPgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf kCXEHc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb kCXEHc_j/HugV6-->memberikan kesadaran mendalam bahwa hidup di dunia bersifat sementara<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami proses kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta mawas diri untuk memperbanyak amal saleh dan meninggalkan perbuatan buruk.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"p6Zx4e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjE7_SNtouWAxV_4TgGHTjYAukQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf p6Zx4e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb p6Zx4e_j/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta kesadaran diri untuk meningkatkan amal saleh, meninggalkan larangan Allah, dan menjadikan kehidupan dunia sebagai persiapan menuju akhirat</mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 06:57:32','2026-08-06 06:57:32'),
(102,7,1,NULL,24,NULL,'Hari Akhir','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 (Fase F) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"SGmnv_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4rd_wtIuWAxXAjOEIHT6dO6YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf SGmnv_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb SGmnv_j/HugV6-->menargetkan peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi makna iman kepada hari akhir, serta mengaitkannya dengan perilaku jujur, tanggung jawab, dan etika dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EFFZU_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjrJCDtYuWAxWOlOEIHfKTNv0QuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EFFZU_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EFFZU_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menganalisis makna dan dalil, mengidentifikasi tanda-tanda serta tahapan yaumul akhir, menyajikan kaitan iman dengan perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab, serta meyakini adanya hari pembalasan dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir (Kiamat) yang efektif meliputi </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"D55Ozb_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwipxOmWtYuWAxU6kOEIHfddLAIQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf D55Ozb_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb D55Ozb_1b/HugV6-->metode <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">diskusi kelompok<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengkaji tanda-tanda kiamat, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">probing-prompting<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk menggali pemahaman, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">contextual teaching and learning (CTL)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengaitkan amal dengan kehidupan sehari-hari, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tontonan video reflektif</strong></mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir dapat menggunakan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"koLxJe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf koLxJe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb koLxJe_j/HugV6-->tayangan slide presentasi <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAC\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Dokumen ini membahas tentang makna dan perilaku beriman pada hari akhir, termasuk dalil dan tanda-tanda kiamat. Perilaku yang dianjurkan meliputi kejujuran, tanggung jawab, dan memilih teman yang baik. Hikmah dari iman kepada hari akhir mencakup ketaatan kepada Allah, ketenangan jiwa, dan motivasi untuk berusaha. - Download as a PPT, PDF or view online for free.&quot;,null,null,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,4]]],null,&quot;007333e2-4b9a-4d98-a3b4-269be582761a&quot;]]--></span>, video animasi fase kiamat <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f1oq9tS0Tx0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003df1oq9tS0Tx0&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...&quot;,&quot;Setelah alam semesta hancur total dan kehidupan semua makhluk berakhir, manusia akan menjalani tahapan kehidupan baru menuju alam baqa. Tahapan-tahapan tersebut meliputi Yaumul Ba&#39;ats (hari kebangkitan), Yaumul Hasyr (hari berkumpul), buku catatan amal, Yaumul Hisab (hari perhitungan amal) dan Mizan (timbangan amal), As-Shirath (jembatan di atas neraka), dan Yaumul Jaza (hari pembalasan). Balasan perbuatan baik adalah surga dan balasan perbuatan buruk adalah neraka.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQuqJEEVXIuZImFqb0MG6tAR1AekZTlH073XE6GI9GaE7z8OqBRxwHXg0l0GGS_34spFDMN2PlIU3fmKlk&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,5]]],null,&quot;42e3a35e-119a-464c-918a-f5e165ec7862&quot;]]--></span>, infografis tanda kiamat, peta konsep digital, serta kuis interaktif untuk evaluasi pemahaman siswa</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar utama untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Iman kepada Hari Akhir\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"ITJ0Ac_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Merdeka atau K-13 dari Kemendikbudristek, Kitab Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, modul ajar digital, serta video pembelajaran interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab suci<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Al-Qur\'anul Karim dan kitab tafsir untuk mengkaji ayat-ayat tentang kiamat sughra, kubra, dan fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Lembar kerja atau modul ajar PDF tentang iman kepada hari akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video online<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan alur fase hari akhir (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Yaumul Ba\'ats<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hisab<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mizan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, hingga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Jaza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) di platform edukasi</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Beriman kepada Hari Akhir<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"sbYMvf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjP3rustouWAxVrwTgGHe7iBGcQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf sbYMvf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb sbYMvf_k/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah penting: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">kognitif (pengetahuan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">afektif (sikap)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">psikomotorik (keterampilan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Penilaian ini mengukur pemahaman siswa tentang tanda-tanda kiamat, tahapan alam akhirat, serta penerapannya pada perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab</p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Beriman kepada Hari Akhir\"</span> menerapkan pendekatan berpusat pada peserta didik (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">student-centered<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>). Guru memadukan metode diskusi kelompok, analisis dalil, penayangan video kontekstual, dan refleksi perilaku jujur serta tanggung jawab agar siswa mampu mengaitkan keyakinan kiamat dengan kehidupan sehari-akherat</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) tentang Iman kepada Hari Akhir untuk kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"vXxghd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf vXxghd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb vXxghd_1b/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas yang religius, fasilitas digital interaktif, serta kegiatan reflektif di luar kelas untuk menumbuhkan kesadaran moral, tanggung jawab sosial, dan keyakinan peserta didik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Fisik dan Non-Fisik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Suasana Religius:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Ruang kelas yang bersih, tenang, dan dihiasi kaligrafi atau poster pengingat kematian agar siswa mudah fokus berfikir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Diskusi Terbuka:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memimpin suasana yang aman bagi siswa untuk bertanya dan membahas tanda-tanda kiamat serta fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Integrasi Digital:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pemanfaatan proyektor atau gawai untuk menampilkan video simulasi kehancuran alam semesta dan dalil ayat Al-Qur\'an terkait.</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pada materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir dapat dilakukan melalui </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xWIFgd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xWIFgd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xWIFgd_j/HugV6-->kuis interaktif, video animasi kiamat, dan forum diskusi daring untuk meningkatkan pemahaman siswa secara visual dan kontekstual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/modul-ajar-deep-learning-pai-bp-kelas-12-semester-2-terbaru-2026/285819572\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Media dan Metode Digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Animasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Tampilkan simulasi proses terjadinya kiamat kubra dari kanal YouTube edukasi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kuis Interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Gunakan Quizizz<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> atau Kahoot<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk evaluasi bab Hari Akhir secara seru.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Presentasi Visual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Pakai Canva<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk membuat infografis tanda-tanda kiamat sugra dan kubra.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">E-Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Manfaatkan Google Classroom atau LMS sekolah untuk mengumpulkan tugas refleksi kehidupan akhirat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman belajar materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"kCXEHc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjV-IL-tYuWAxVmhGMGHeUqHPgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf kCXEHc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb kCXEHc_j/HugV6-->memberikan kesadaran mendalam bahwa hidup di dunia bersifat sementara<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami proses kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta mawas diri untuk memperbanyak amal saleh dan meninggalkan perbuatan buruk.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"p6Zx4e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjE7_SNtouWAxV_4TgGHTjYAukQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf p6Zx4e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb p6Zx4e_j/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta kesadaran diri untuk meningkatkan amal saleh, meninggalkan larangan Allah, dan menjadikan kehidupan dunia sebagai persiapan menuju akhirat</mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 06:57:32','2026-08-06 06:57:32');
INSERT INTO `rencana_pembelajarans` VALUES
(103,7,1,NULL,25,NULL,'Hari Akhir','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 (Fase F) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"SGmnv_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4rd_wtIuWAxXAjOEIHT6dO6YQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf SGmnv_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb SGmnv_j/HugV6-->menargetkan peserta didik mampu menganalisis dan mengevaluasi makna iman kepada hari akhir, serta mengaitkannya dengan perilaku jujur, tanggung jawab, dan etika dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"EFFZU_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjrJCDtYuWAxWOlOEIHfKTNv0QuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf EFFZU_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb EFFZU_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menganalisis makna dan dalil, mengidentifikasi tanda-tanda serta tahapan yaumul akhir, menyajikan kaitan iman dengan perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab, serta meyakini adanya hari pembalasan dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir (Kiamat) yang efektif meliputi </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"D55Ozb_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwipxOmWtYuWAxU6kOEIHfddLAIQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf D55Ozb_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb D55Ozb_1b/HugV6-->metode <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">diskusi kelompok<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengkaji tanda-tanda kiamat, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">probing-prompting<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk menggali pemahaman, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">contextual teaching and learning (CTL)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mengaitkan amal dengan kehidupan sehari-hari, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tontonan video reflektif</strong></mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Beriman kepada Hari Akhir dapat menggunakan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"koLxJe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf koLxJe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb koLxJe_j/HugV6-->tayangan slide presentasi <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAC\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-smk-kelas-12-smt-ii-beriman-pada-hari-akhir/241607458&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Pai smk kelas 12 smt ii beriman pada hari akhir - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Dokumen ini membahas tentang makna dan perilaku beriman pada hari akhir, termasuk dalil dan tanda-tanda kiamat. Perilaku yang dianjurkan meliputi kejujuran, tanggung jawab, dan memilih teman yang baik. Hikmah dari iman kepada hari akhir mencakup ketaatan kepada Allah, ketenangan jiwa, dan motivasi untuk berusaha. - Download as a PPT, PDF or view online for free.&quot;,null,null,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,4]]],null,&quot;007333e2-4b9a-4d98-a3b4-269be582761a&quot;]]--></span>, video animasi fase kiamat <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f1oq9tS0Tx0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwibwLuntYuWAxXilOEIHSZmE9MQy_kOegoIAggACAAIBhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003df1oq9tS0Tx0&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 12 Bab 1 Beriman Kepada ...&quot;,&quot;Setelah alam semesta hancur total dan kehidupan semua makhluk berakhir, manusia akan menjalani tahapan kehidupan baru menuju alam baqa. Tahapan-tahapan tersebut meliputi Yaumul Ba&#39;ats (hari kebangkitan), Yaumul Hasyr (hari berkumpul), buku catatan amal, Yaumul Hisab (hari perhitungan amal) dan Mizan (timbangan amal), As-Shirath (jembatan di atas neraka), dan Yaumul Jaza (hari pembalasan). Balasan perbuatan baik adalah surga dan balasan perbuatan buruk adalah neraka.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQuqJEEVXIuZImFqb0MG6tAR1AekZTlH073XE6GI9GaE7z8OqBRxwHXg0l0GGS_34spFDMN2PlIU3fmKlk&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1785999150473243,149001442,3541263910],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,5]]],null,&quot;42e3a35e-119a-464c-918a-f5e165ec7862&quot;]]--></span>, infografis tanda kiamat, peta konsep digital, serta kuis interaktif untuk evaluasi pemahaman siswa</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar utama untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Iman kepada Hari Akhir\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"ITJ0Ac_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb ITJ0Ac_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 12 Kurikulum Merdeka atau K-13 dari Kemendikbudristek, Kitab Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, modul ajar digital, serta video pembelajaran interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XII terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kitab suci<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Al-Qur\'anul Karim dan kitab tafsir untuk mengkaji ayat-ayat tentang kiamat sughra, kubra, dan fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Lembar kerja atau modul ajar PDF tentang iman kepada hari akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwium9aZtouWAxUMxTgGHSvmI6gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video online<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan alur fase hari akhir (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Yaumul Ba\'ats<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hisab<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mizan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, hingga <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Jaza<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) di platform edukasi</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Beriman kepada Hari Akhir<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"sbYMvf_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjP3rustouWAxVrwTgGHe7iBGcQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf sbYMvf_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb sbYMvf_k/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah penting: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">kognitif (pengetahuan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">afektif (sikap)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">psikomotorik (keterampilan)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Penilaian ini mengukur pemahaman siswa tentang tanda-tanda kiamat, tahapan alam akhirat, serta penerapannya pada perilaku jujur dan tanggung jawab</p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang \"Beriman kepada Hari Akhir\"</span> menerapkan pendekatan berpusat pada peserta didik (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">student-centered<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>). Guru memadukan metode diskusi kelompok, analisis dalil, penayangan video kontekstual, dan refleksi perilaku jujur serta tanggung jawab agar siswa mampu mengaitkan keyakinan kiamat dengan kehidupan sehari-akherat</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) tentang Iman kepada Hari Akhir untuk kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"vXxghd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf vXxghd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb vXxghd_1b/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas yang religius, fasilitas digital interaktif, serta kegiatan reflektif di luar kelas untuk menumbuhkan kesadaran moral, tanggung jawab sosial, dan keyakinan peserta didik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Fisik dan Non-Fisik<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Suasana Religius:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Ruang kelas yang bersih, tenang, dan dihiasi kaligrafi atau poster pengingat kematian agar siswa mudah fokus berfikir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Diskusi Terbuka:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memimpin suasana yang aman bagi siswa untuk bertanya dan membahas tanda-tanda kiamat serta fase akhir.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX4OfUtYuWAxUl2TgGHfcKGzgQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Integrasi Digital:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Pemanfaatan proyektor atau gawai untuk menampilkan video simulasi kehancuran alam semesta dan dalil ayat Al-Qur\'an terkait.</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pada materi PAI kelas 12 tentang Hari Akhir dapat dilakukan melalui </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"xWIFgd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf xWIFgd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb xWIFgd_j/HugV6-->kuis interaktif, video animasi kiamat, dan forum diskusi daring untuk meningkatkan pemahaman siswa secara visual dan kontekstual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/modul-ajar-deep-learning-pai-bp-kelas-12-semester-2-terbaru-2026/285819572\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Media dan Metode Digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Animasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Tampilkan simulasi proses terjadinya kiamat kubra dari kanal YouTube edukasi Islami.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kuis Interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Gunakan Quizizz<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> atau Kahoot<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk evaluasi bab Hari Akhir secara seru.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Presentasi Visual<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Pakai Canva<!--TgQPHd|||[]--> untuk membuat infografis tanda-tanda kiamat sugra dan kubra.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi8n9_stYuWAxURzTgGHfIoB2MQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBRAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">E-Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Manfaatkan Google Classroom atau LMS sekolah untuk mengumpulkan tugas refleksi kehidupan akhirat.</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman belajar materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"kCXEHc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjV-IL-tYuWAxVmhGMGHeUqHPgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf kCXEHc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb kCXEHc_j/HugV6-->memberikan kesadaran mendalam bahwa hidup di dunia bersifat sementara<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa diajak memahami proses kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta mawas diri untuk memperbanyak amal saleh dan meninggalkan perbuatan buruk.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi Iman kepada Hari Akhir pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"p6Zx4e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjE7_SNtouWAxV_4TgGHTjYAukQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf p6Zx4e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb p6Zx4e_j/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep kiamat sugra dan kubra, tahapan alam akhirat, serta kesadaran diri untuk meningkatkan amal saleh, meninggalkan larangan Allah, dan menjadikan kehidupan dunia sebagai persiapan menuju akhirat</mark></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 06:57:32','2026-08-06 06:57:32'),
(104,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'peran organisasi islam di indonesia sebelum kemerdekaan','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 (Fase F) pada elemen Sejarah Peradaban Islam menuntut peserta didik untuk </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Q2ljDd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjE-O2rt4uWAxUQ-zgGHT9uAwkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Q2ljDd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Q2ljDd_j/HugV6-->mampu <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">menganalisis dan mempresentasikan peran serta pemikiran organisasi-organisasi Islam di Indonesia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dalam membangun peradaban dan memperjuangkan kemerdekaan sebelum masa kemerdekaan</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">peran organisasi Islam di Indonesia sebelum kemerdekaan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Ztd6N_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjql4HKt4uWAxVH-DgGHaO0LbEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Ztd6N_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Ztd6N_k/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menjelaskan sejarah perkembangan, menganalisis bentuk perjuangan, meneladani semangat nasionalisme, serta mengambil ibrah dari kontribusi nyata ormas Islam dalam memajukan pendidikan, sosial, dan kemerdekaan bangsa</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan umumnya menggunakan model aktif seperti </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LwIgif_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LwIgif_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LwIgif_j/HugV6--><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Discovery Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, diskusi kelompok, dan penugasan analitis untuk meneliti sejarah perjuangan Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Metode Pembelajaran yang Digunakan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Discovery Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mencari dan mengumpulkan informasi mandiri terkait sejarah serta peran nyata ormas Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Group Discussion:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mendiskusikan strategi pergerakan nasional yang dilakukan tokoh-tokoh Islam tempo dulu.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Inquiry / Analisis Historis:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa menelaah dokumen atau literatur sejarah perjuangan umat Islam melawan penjajah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Presentasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Perwakilan kelompok memaparkan hasil analisis peran organisasi Islam di depan kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>&nbsp;</div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI Kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan dapat menggunakan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LkwLNb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LkwLNb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LkwLNb_j/HugV6-->rancangan presentasi interaktif, video sejarah, infografis garis waktu (timeline), serta metode diskusi kelompok berbasis penugasan kontekstual untuk mengkaji perjuangan Syarikat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Komponen Media Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi (PPT)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Berisi peta konsep, foto tokoh (HOS Cokroaminoto, KH Ahmad Dahlan, KH Hasyim Asy\'ari), dan peta jalur pergerakan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAICBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Dokumenter<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Pemutaran cuplikan sejarah singkat detik-detik kebangkitan nasional dan peran resolusi awal umat Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAICBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Infografis Perbandingan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Ringkasan peran sosial, pendidikan, dan politik dari masing-masing organisasi.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQ-7AUegoIAggACAAICBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan meliputi </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"cNsuje_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf cNsuje_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb cNsuje_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas XII, Modul Ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, serta jurnal sejarah dan keagamaan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Organisasi utama yang dibahas mencakup Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, Nahdlatul Ulama (NU), Al-Irsyad, dan Persatuan Islam (Persis).&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Rincian Sumber Belajar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Teks Utama:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Buku Siswa PAI dan Budi Pekerti Kelas 12 (Bab mengenai Peran Organisasi Islam di Indonesia) yang dapat diakses ringkasan materinya di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-10_Peran-Organisasi-Islam-di-Indonesia_BS-12.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQy_kOegoIAggACAAIDhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Belajar PAI</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-10_Peran-Organisasi-Islam-di-Indonesia_BS-12.pdf&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Agama Islam - Belajar PAI&quot;,&quot;Oleh karena itu kita sangat perlu mengetahui bentuk-bentuk perjuangan organisasi. Islam dalam usaha mencapai kemerdekaan Indonesia dan mengetahui peran.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcRxGyelSIoPSMQw-1Zr50nS3CrUF_NzccMEFr9qaDqWhtKpCzdjnTT0W3FSwxmwnU-3Zuo6HWN5R9_s6eY&quot;,&quot;Belajar PAI&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.belajarpai.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000116445973,104394559,101546845],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,12]]],null,&quot;02f030ef-9544-4efd-852f-39a6cd50122f&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-10_Peran-Organisasi-Islam-di-Indonesia_BS-12.pdf\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar Digital:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Dokumen perencanaan pembelajaran dan perangkat ajar Kurikulum Merdeka Fase F kelas 12 tersedia pada platform <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/921149770/13-10-MA-PAI-BP-Kelas-XII-Nasukha-BAB-10-Peran-Organisasi-Islam-Di-Indonesia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQy_kOegoIAggACAAIDhAI\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QCA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Scribd - Modul Ajar PAI Bab 10</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/921149770/13-10-MA-PAI-BP-Kelas-XII-Nasukha-BAB-10-Peran-Organisasi-Islam-Di-Indonesia&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Peran Organisasi Islam di Indonesia | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;MODUL AJAR. FASE F KELAS XII. SMKN 2 TULUNGAGUNG. BAB 10 : PERAN ORGANISASI ISLAM DI INDONESIA. 0. MODUL AJAR PAI BP. A. INFORMASI UMUM 1. Identitas Modul&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTvwIVNe2SVqn2sxDMiceJKqffDNOA0weamft9poKqPHcwtu-xG1YIAOmvezI8Awl1g_FeNH_x6HW2ebWI&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000116445973,104394559,101546845],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,13]]],null,&quot;76eab007-f57d-4907-87f1-fc07e16e8bd3&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/921149770/13-10-MA-PAI-BP-Kelas-XII-Nasukha-BAB-10-Peran-Organisasi-Islam-Di-Indonesia\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/887972628/4-Modul-Ajar-BAB-10-Peran-Organisasi-Islam-di-Indonesia\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Referensi Artikel &amp; Jurnal Ilmiah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Kajian historis mengenai kontribusi ormas Islam dalam kebangkitan nasional dan pendidikan dapat dilihat melalui <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id/index.php/ibanah/article/download/196/181/800\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQy_kOegoIAggACAAIDhAN\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QDQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Jurnal IAIPI Bandung</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id/index.php/ibanah/article/download/196/181/800&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Peran Ormas Islam Dalam Pengembangan Pendidikan Islam ...&quot;,&quot;Peran organisasi masyarakat (ormas) keagamaan sangat diperlukan dalam mengembangkan lembaga pendidikan Islam. Peran itu telah dilakukan oleh organisasi keagamaan diantaranya Nahdatul Ulama (NU), Muhammadiyah, Persis dan Mathla&#39;ul Anwar.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTOG9unGx9lCen3z0W-0gwzq4c5AtUdBPIwwx86aYulGLGukM6Stp13e-vfLdBHsRCyESLCHKFcPB6maT4&quot;,&quot;IAI Persis Bandung&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000116445973,104394559,101546845],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,15]]],null,&quot;969c66e3-6c38-4d52-93e5-9680e24e6037&quot;]]--></span> dan ulasan sejarah di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQy_kOegoIAggACAAIDhAO\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QDg\" aria-label=\"Universitas Insan Cendekia Mandiri. Pratinjau link. Situs: UNIVERSITAS INSAN CITA INDONESIA - UICI. Judul: 6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan - UICI. URL: https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/.\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Universitas Insan Cendekia Mandiri</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan - UICI&quot;,&quot;Al Irsyad mendirikan banyak sekolah dan lembaga pendidikan yang mengajarkan ilmu pengetahuan umum dan agama.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQ_acOrd-TgXGMRuUyY7SFE0oxRaLWMnKYGi9UimIC_BhVuhbejBopaPlVGRN-FKXD3Dk2XhK2Jn-uD1rc&quot;,&quot;UNIVERSITAS INSAN CITA INDONESIA - UICI&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://uici.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000116445973,104394559,101546845],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,16]]],null,&quot;3193c146-a6d9-4c52-8a90-28ae30df8b2d&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id/index.php/ibanah/article/download/196/181/800\">2</a>]</div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"lOHY5c_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwip0cCIuYuWAxWrHGYEHUSkPewQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf lOHY5c_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb lOHY5c_j/HugV6-->mencakup aspek <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sikap (profil pelajar Pancasila)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">pengetahuan (kognitif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">keterampilan (psikomotorik)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Penilaian ini mengukur pemahaman siswa terhadap kontribusi organisasi seperti Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama dalam membangun nasionalisme serta memajukan pendidikan bangsa</p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam pra-kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"aoc4td_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjc7J-FuIuWAxXLzDgGHVT2MAwQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf aoc4td_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb aoc4td_j/HugV6-->menerapkan pendekatan student-centered learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru menggunakan modelinkuiri, penugasan proyek sejarah lokal, pemutaran film dokumenter perjuangan, serta diskusi kelompok kritis. Tujuannya agar siswa memahami strategi dakwah, sosial, dan pendidikan yang dilakukan tokoh bangsa</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 Bab tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> membahas bagaimana gerakan umat Islam membangun kesadaran nasional, melawan penjajah, serta memajukan pendidikan dan sosial. Lingkungan pembelajaran materi ini mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"oPXqhe_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf oPXqhe_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb oPXqhe_k/HugV6-->penanaman nilai nasionalisme religius, literasi sejarah, serta diskusi peran tokoh ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Lingkungan dan Proses Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kajian Teks dan Sejarah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membaca buku teks atau modul PAI mengenai latar belakang lahirnya berbagai ormas Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Kelompok:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menganalisis strategi pergerakan tiap organisasi dalam melawan kolonialisme secara kooperatif.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Keteladanan Tokoh:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Meneladani semangat patriotisme dan keikhlasan para pendiri bangsa dari kalangan ulama.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi Karakter:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menghubungkan nilai perjuangan masa lalu dengan peran pelajar Islam menjaga persatuan saat in</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">emanfaatan digital pembelajaran pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XTgSnd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XTgSnd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XTgSnd_j/HugV6-->melibatkan penggunaan media interaktif, e-learning, video sejarah, dan kuis online<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Teknologi ini mempermudah siswa memahami strategi dakwah, pendidikan, serta pergerakan nasional yang dilakukan oleh organisasi seperti Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Bentuk Pemanfaatan Media Digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Animasi Sejarah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menampilkan kilas balik perjuangan tokoh Islam masa pra-kemerdekaan melalui platform seperti YouTube atau media interaktif kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Digital &amp; E-Book:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Memakai bahan ajar elektronik interaktif yang praktis diakses lewat gawai siswa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kuis Interaktif (Gamifikasi):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menguji pemahaman materi lewat aplikasi seperti Kahoot! atau Quizizz agar belajar sejarah tidak membosankan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAN\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQDQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Daring (LMS):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Memanfaatkan Google Classroom atau ruang belajar digital sekolah untuk membahas esai peran tokoh ulama</span></div>','<p>Pengalaman pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"PC5inc_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiei73BuIuWAxU7xzgGHeXUGugQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf PC5inc_l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb PC5inc_l/HugV6-->pemahaman sejarah berdirinya gerakan seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiei73BuIuWAxU7xzgGHeXUGugQy_kOegoIAggACAAICRAC\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Sarekat Islam</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan - UICI&quot;,&quot;6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan * Jamiat Kheir. Jamiat Kheir adalah salah satu organisasi Islam tertua di Indonesia, didirikan pada tahun 1901 di Jakarta. ... * Sarekat Islam. Sarekat Islam (SI) didirikan pada tahun 1905 oleh Haji Samanhudi di Surakarta. ... * Perserikatan Ulama. ... * Muhammadiyah. ... * Al Irsyad. ... * Nahdlatul Ulama.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQ_acOrd-TgXGMRuUyY7SFE0oxRaLWMnKYGi9UimIC_BhVuhbejBopaPlVGRN-FKXD3Dk2XhK2Jn-uD1rc&quot;,&quot;UNIVERSITAS INSAN CITA INDONESIA - UICI&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://uici.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000010331550,104384315,3894072549],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,8]]],null,&quot;f3ee0de3-4b12-4e24-ba58-9fc006103b80&quot;]]--></span>, <span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Muhammadiyah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>, dan <span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Nahdlatul Ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa belajar bagaimana organisasi ini menggunakan jalur pendidikan, ekonomi, dan nasionalisme untuk melawan penjajah serta membangun kesadaran berbangsa</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran tentang peran organisasi Islam di Indonesia sebelum kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"BPQ1id_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf BPQ1id_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb BPQ1id_j/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman bahwa umat Islam ikut membangun bangsa<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Organisasi seperti Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama berjuang melawan penjajah. Mereka juga memajukan pendidikan serta menyatukan rakyat Nusantara demi tercapainya kemerdekaan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Nilai Keteladanan dan Refleksi Diri<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Semangat Persatuan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Tokoh Islam berbeda corak tetapi tetap bersatu melawan penjajah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kepedulian Sosial:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Organisasi tidak hanya mengaji, tetapi juga membantu rakyat miskin dan bodoh lewat sekolah serta balai pengobatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cinta Tanah Air:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Nasionalisme para ulama dibuktikan dengan semboyan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hubbul wathan minal iman<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (cinta tanah air adalah bagian dari iman</span></div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 07:09:39','2026-08-06 07:09:39'),
(105,7,1,NULL,23,NULL,'peran organisasi islam di indonesia sebelum kemerdekaan','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 (Fase F) pada elemen Sejarah Peradaban Islam menuntut peserta didik untuk </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Q2ljDd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjE-O2rt4uWAxUQ-zgGHT9uAwkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Q2ljDd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Q2ljDd_j/HugV6-->mampu <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">menganalisis dan mempresentasikan peran serta pemikiran organisasi-organisasi Islam di Indonesia<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dalam membangun peradaban dan memperjuangkan kemerdekaan sebelum masa kemerdekaan</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">peran organisasi Islam di Indonesia sebelum kemerdekaan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Ztd6N_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjql4HKt4uWAxVH-DgGHaO0LbEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Ztd6N_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Ztd6N_k/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menjelaskan sejarah perkembangan, menganalisis bentuk perjuangan, meneladani semangat nasionalisme, serta mengambil ibrah dari kontribusi nyata ormas Islam dalam memajukan pendidikan, sosial, dan kemerdekaan bangsa</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAUQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan umumnya menggunakan model aktif seperti </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LwIgif_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LwIgif_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LwIgif_j/HugV6--><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Discovery Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, diskusi kelompok, dan penugasan analitis untuk meneliti sejarah perjuangan Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Metode Pembelajaran yang Digunakan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Discovery Learning:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mencari dan mengumpulkan informasi mandiri terkait sejarah serta peran nyata ormas Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Group Discussion:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa mendiskusikan strategi pergerakan nasional yang dilakukan tokoh-tokoh Islam tempo dulu.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Inquiry / Analisis Historis:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa menelaah dokumen atau literatur sejarah perjuangan umat Islam melawan penjajah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjxh6PXt4uWAxVx3jgGHf14OJYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Presentasi:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Perwakilan kelompok memaparkan hasil analisis peran organisasi Islam di depan kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>&nbsp;</div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI Kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan dapat menggunakan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"LkwLNb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf LkwLNb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb LkwLNb_j/HugV6-->rancangan presentasi interaktif, video sejarah, infografis garis waktu (timeline), serta metode diskusi kelompok berbasis penugasan kontekstual untuk mengkaji perjuangan Syarikat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Komponen Media Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi (PPT)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Berisi peta konsep, foto tokoh (HOS Cokroaminoto, KH Ahmad Dahlan, KH Hasyim Asy\'ari), dan peta jalur pergerakan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAICBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Dokumenter<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Pemutaran cuplikan sejarah singkat detik-detik kebangkitan nasional dan peran resolusi awal umat Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAICBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Infografis Perbandingan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Ringkasan peran sosial, pendidikan, dan politik dari masing-masing organisasi.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQ-7AUegoIAggACAAICBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAgQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjd_MLpt4uWAxU0ZSoJHclOBwYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font