BP. A. INFORMASI UMUM 1. Identitas Modul&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTvwIVNe2SVqn2sxDMiceJKqffDNOA0weamft9poKqPHcwtu-xG1YIAOmvezI8Awl1g_FeNH_x6HW2ebWI&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000116445973,104394559,101546845],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,13]]],null,&quot;76eab007-f57d-4907-87f1-fc07e16e8bd3&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/921149770/13-10-MA-PAI-BP-Kelas-XII-Nasukha-BAB-10-Peran-Organisasi-Islam-Di-Indonesia\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/887972628/4-Modul-Ajar-BAB-10-Peran-Organisasi-Islam-di-Indonesia\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDhAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Referensi Artikel &amp; Jurnal Ilmiah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Kajian historis mengenai kontribusi ormas Islam dalam kebangkitan nasional dan pendidikan dapat dilihat melalui <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id/index.php/ibanah/article/download/196/181/800\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQy_kOegoIAggACAAIDhAN\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QDQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Jurnal IAIPI Bandung</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id/index.php/ibanah/article/download/196/181/800&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Peran Ormas Islam Dalam Pengembangan Pendidikan Islam ...&quot;,&quot;Peran organisasi masyarakat (ormas) keagamaan sangat diperlukan dalam mengembangkan lembaga pendidikan Islam. Peran itu telah dilakukan oleh organisasi keagamaan diantaranya Nahdatul Ulama (NU), Muhammadiyah, Persis dan Mathla&#39;ul Anwar.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTOG9unGx9lCen3z0W-0gwzq4c5AtUdBPIwwx86aYulGLGukM6Stp13e-vfLdBHsRCyESLCHKFcPB6maT4&quot;,&quot;IAI Persis Bandung&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000116445973,104394559,101546845],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,15]]],null,&quot;969c66e3-6c38-4d52-93e5-9680e24e6037&quot;]]--></span> dan ulasan sejarah di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV5on0uIuWAxU_7zgGHV17DQYQy_kOegoIAggACAAIDhAO\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QDg\" aria-label=\"Universitas Insan Cendekia Mandiri. Pratinjau link. Situs: UNIVERSITAS INSAN CITA INDONESIA - UICI. Judul: 6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan - UICI. URL: https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/.\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Universitas Insan Cendekia Mandiri</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan - UICI&quot;,&quot;Al Irsyad mendirikan banyak sekolah dan lembaga pendidikan yang mengajarkan ilmu pengetahuan umum dan agama.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQ_acOrd-TgXGMRuUyY7SFE0oxRaLWMnKYGi9UimIC_BhVuhbejBopaPlVGRN-FKXD3Dk2XhK2Jn-uD1rc&quot;,&quot;UNIVERSITAS INSAN CITA INDONESIA - UICI&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://uici.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000116445973,104394559,101546845],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,16]]],null,&quot;3193c146-a6d9-4c52-8a90-28ae30df8b2d&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://journal.iaipibandung.ac.id/index.php/ibanah/article/download/196/181/800\">2</a>]</div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"lOHY5c_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwip0cCIuYuWAxWrHGYEHUSkPewQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf lOHY5c_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb lOHY5c_j/HugV6-->mencakup aspek <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sikap (profil pelajar Pancasila)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">pengetahuan (kognitif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">keterampilan (psikomotorik)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Penilaian ini mengukur pemahaman siswa terhadap kontribusi organisasi seperti Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama dalam membangun nasionalisme serta memajukan pendidikan bangsa</p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam pra-kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"aoc4td_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjc7J-FuIuWAxXLzDgGHVT2MAwQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf aoc4td_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb aoc4td_j/HugV6-->menerapkan pendekatan student-centered learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru menggunakan modelinkuiri, penugasan proyek sejarah lokal, pemutaran film dokumenter perjuangan, serta diskusi kelompok kritis. Tujuannya agar siswa memahami strategi dakwah, sosial, dan pendidikan yang dilakukan tokoh bangsa</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 Bab tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> membahas bagaimana gerakan umat Islam membangun kesadaran nasional, melawan penjajah, serta memajukan pendidikan dan sosial. Lingkungan pembelajaran materi ini mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"oPXqhe_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf oPXqhe_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb oPXqhe_k/HugV6-->penanaman nilai nasionalisme religius, literasi sejarah, serta diskusi peran tokoh ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Lingkungan dan Proses Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kajian Teks dan Sejarah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa membaca buku teks atau modul PAI mengenai latar belakang lahirnya berbagai ormas Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Kelompok:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menganalisis strategi pergerakan tiap organisasi dalam melawan kolonialisme secara kooperatif.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Keteladanan Tokoh:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Meneladani semangat patriotisme dan keikhlasan para pendiri bangsa dari kalangan ulama.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj7_c-SuIuWAxV5xzgGHd8UJlEQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi Karakter:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menghubungkan nilai perjuangan masa lalu dengan peran pelajar Islam menjaga persatuan saat in</span></div>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">emanfaatan digital pembelajaran pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XTgSnd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XTgSnd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XTgSnd_j/HugV6-->melibatkan penggunaan media interaktif, e-learning, video sejarah, dan kuis online<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Teknologi ini mempermudah siswa memahami strategi dakwah, pendidikan, serta pergerakan nasional yang dilakukan oleh organisasi seperti Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Bentuk Pemanfaatan Media Digital<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Animasi Sejarah:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menampilkan kilas balik perjuangan tokoh Islam masa pra-kemerdekaan melalui platform seperti YouTube atau media interaktif kelas.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Digital &amp; E-Book:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Memakai bahan ajar elektronik interaktif yang praktis diakses lewat gawai siswa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kuis Interaktif (Gamifikasi):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Menguji pemahaman materi lewat aplikasi seperti Kahoot! atau Quizizz agar belajar sejarah tidak membosankan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjdqcituIuWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQi4wTegoIAggACAAICRAN\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQDQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Diskusi Daring (LMS):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Memanfaatkan Google Classroom atau ruang belajar digital sekolah untuk membahas esai peran tokoh ulama</span></div>','<p>Pengalaman pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang peran organisasi Islam sebelum kemerdekaan mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"PC5inc_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiei73BuIuWAxU7xzgGHeXUGugQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf PC5inc_l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb PC5inc_l/HugV6-->pemahaman sejarah berdirinya gerakan seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiei73BuIuWAxU7xzgGHeXUGugQy_kOegoIAggACAAICRAC\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAkQAg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Sarekat Islam</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://uici.ac.id/6-organisasi-islam-yang-lahir-sebelum-kemerdekaan/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan - UICI&quot;,&quot;6 Organisasi Islam yang Lahir Sebelum Kemerdekaan * Jamiat Kheir. Jamiat Kheir adalah salah satu organisasi Islam tertua di Indonesia, didirikan pada tahun 1901 di Jakarta. ... * Sarekat Islam. Sarekat Islam (SI) didirikan pada tahun 1905 oleh Haji Samanhudi di Surakarta. ... * Perserikatan Ulama. ... * Muhammadiyah. ... * Al Irsyad. ... * Nahdlatul Ulama.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQ_acOrd-TgXGMRuUyY7SFE0oxRaLWMnKYGi9UimIC_BhVuhbejBopaPlVGRN-FKXD3Dk2XhK2Jn-uD1rc&quot;,&quot;UNIVERSITAS INSAN CITA INDONESIA - UICI&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://uici.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786000010331550,104384315,3894072549],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,8]]],null,&quot;f3ee0de3-4b12-4e24-ba58-9fc006103b80&quot;]]--></span>, <span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Muhammadiyah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>, dan <span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Nahdlatul Ulama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa belajar bagaimana organisasi ini menggunakan jalur pendidikan, ekonomi, dan nasionalisme untuk melawan penjajah serta membangun kesadaran berbangsa</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran tentang peran organisasi Islam di Indonesia sebelum kemerdekaan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"BPQ1id_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf BPQ1id_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb BPQ1id_j/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman bahwa umat Islam ikut membangun bangsa<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Organisasi seperti Sarekat Islam, Muhammadiyah, dan Nahdlatul Ulama berjuang melawan penjajah. Mereka juga memajukan pendidikan serta menyatukan rakyat Nusantara demi tercapainya kemerdekaan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAYQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Nilai Keteladanan dan Refleksi Diri<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Semangat Persatuan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Tokoh Islam berbeda corak tetapi tetap bersatu melawan penjajah.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kepedulian Sosial:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Organisasi tidak hanya mengaji, tetapi juga membantu rakyat miskin dan bodoh lewat sekolah serta balai pengobatan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9k7XSuIuWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIBxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAcQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cinta Tanah Air:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Nasionalisme para ulama dibuktikan dengan semboyan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Hubbul wathan minal iman<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (cinta tanah air adalah bagian dari iman</span></div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 07:09:39','2026-08-06 07:09:39'),
(108,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"irC7ud_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3pcvBuYuWAxWh8TgGHUtlOlsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf irC7ud_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb irC7ud_k/HugV6-->berfokus pada pemahaman ketentuan ilmu <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mawaris<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (faraid), kemampuan menghitung pembagian harta peninggalan secara adil, serta kemampuan menghayati nilai kearifan untuk merawat keharmonisan keluarga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Oun8Ue_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-9-bnuYuWAxWBgGMGHROaA5sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Oun8Ue_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Oun8Ue_k/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep dasar ilmu faraid, kemampuan menganalisis ketentuan pembagian harta secara adil, serta penerapan nilai kearifan untuk menjaga keharmonisan dan mencegah perpecahan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">kewarisan dan kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Ilmu Mawaris/Faraid) dipelajari dengan <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gTQA2c_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiI9Z30uYuWAxU-xDgGHWDcD5IQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gTQA2c_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gTQA2c_k/HugV6-->metode interaktif seperti ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok studi kasus perhitungan harta, dan pemecahan masalah nyata agar siswa paham keadilan pembagian serta hikmah sosialnya</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" (Ilmu Mawaris) mencakup konsep dasar hukum</span>, pembagian bagian ahli waris, contoh hitungan, serta hikmah keadilan sosial. Guru dapat menggunakan media visual seperti <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XERLuf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjqzJj_uYuWAxWo2TgGHY3bN0gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XERLuf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XERLuf_j/HugV6-->presentasi, video animasi, dan lembar kerja studi kasus</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"lshUEc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf lshUEc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb lshUEc_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket Resmi Kemendikbudristek, modul ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, Al-Qur\'an (Surat An-Nisa\' ayat 11, 12, dan 176)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar yang Direkomendasikan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Buku Paket PAI dan Budi Pekerti Kelas 12 (Kurikulum Merdeka / K-13 Revisi) terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perangkat ajar pendukung:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Modul Ajar Bab Kewarisan Islam yang dibagikan lewat platform edukasi guru atau unduhan PDF.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Referensi ayat &amp; dalil:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, khususnya Surah An-Nisa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Latihan soal &amp; ringkasan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Dokumen materi bab dari situs belajar bersama seperti Studocu</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" untuk mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 mencakup tiga ranah utama: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"RQmXqf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjh5LHPu4uWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf RQmXqf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb RQmXqf_j/HugV6-->asesmen sikap (spiritual dan sosial), pengetahuan (konsep dan perhitungan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta keterampilan (praktik analisis dan simulasi pembagian harta waris yang adil)</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogik pembelajaran materi kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 SMA/SMK </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"WB3Sic_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwidpOOUuouWAxUc1TgGHWZHAksQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf WB3Sic_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb WB3Sic_j/HugV6-->menerapkan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Problem-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Discovery Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru memadukan ceramah interaktif, studi kasus penghitungan harta, serta diskusi kelompok untuk membangun kearifan sosial dalam mencegah sengketa keluarga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 bab \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"PoNBbe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwju_br4uouWAxWz-jgGHcbZL_sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf PoNBbe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb PoNBbe_j/HugV6-->membahas ketentuan hukum pembagian harta peninggalan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) secara adil, rukun dan syarat waris, golongan ahli waris, serta nilai kearifan sosial untuk mencegah perpecahan dan menjaga keharmonisan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital dalam materi PAI kelas 12 tentang kewarisan dan kearifan Islam mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"QZvF2e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjhn9qGu4uWAxXozjgGHVEOF1IQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf QZvF2e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb QZvF2e_j/HugV6-->penggunaan kalkulator faraid interaktif, e-modul kontekstual, video animasi pembagian harta, dan kuis gamifikasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media digital ini mempermudah siswa memahami perhitungan rumit, mencegah konflik keluarga, dan menghayati nilai keadilan.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 memberikan pengalaman bermakna tentang <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qVQLtc_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiE-feWu4uWAxUpxjgGHcmbH3kQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qVQLtc_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qVQLtc_k/HugV6-->pentingnya keadilan, kejujuran, dan keharmonisan keluarga dalam membagikan harta peninggalan sesuai syariat demi menghindari perpecahan</mark></p>','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 menegaskan bahwa <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"S0iy6_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwimyv-iu4uWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf S0iy6_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb S0iy6_k/HugV6-->aturan pembagian harta peninggalan bukan sekadar hitungan matematis, melainkan wujud keadilan, kasih sayang, dan cara menjaga keharmonisan serta persaudaraan di dalam keluarga agar terhindar dari perpecahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 07:21:05','2026-08-06 07:21:05'),
(109,7,1,NULL,23,NULL,'kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"irC7ud_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3pcvBuYuWAxWh8TgGHUtlOlsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf irC7ud_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb irC7ud_k/HugV6-->berfokus pada pemahaman ketentuan ilmu <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mawaris<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (faraid), kemampuan menghitung pembagian harta peninggalan secara adil, serta kemampuan menghayati nilai kearifan untuk merawat keharmonisan keluarga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Oun8Ue_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-9-bnuYuWAxWBgGMGHROaA5sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Oun8Ue_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Oun8Ue_k/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep dasar ilmu faraid, kemampuan menganalisis ketentuan pembagian harta secara adil, serta penerapan nilai kearifan untuk menjaga keharmonisan dan mencegah perpecahan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">kewarisan dan kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Ilmu Mawaris/Faraid) dipelajari dengan <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gTQA2c_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiI9Z30uYuWAxU-xDgGHWDcD5IQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gTQA2c_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gTQA2c_k/HugV6-->metode interaktif seperti ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok studi kasus perhitungan harta, dan pemecahan masalah nyata agar siswa paham keadilan pembagian serta hikmah sosialnya</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" (Ilmu Mawaris) mencakup konsep dasar hukum</span>, pembagian bagian ahli waris, contoh hitungan, serta hikmah keadilan sosial. Guru dapat menggunakan media visual seperti <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XERLuf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjqzJj_uYuWAxWo2TgGHY3bN0gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XERLuf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XERLuf_j/HugV6-->presentasi, video animasi, dan lembar kerja studi kasus</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"lshUEc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf lshUEc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb lshUEc_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket Resmi Kemendikbudristek, modul ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, Al-Qur\'an (Surat An-Nisa\' ayat 11, 12, dan 176)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar yang Direkomendasikan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Buku Paket PAI dan Budi Pekerti Kelas 12 (Kurikulum Merdeka / K-13 Revisi) terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perangkat ajar pendukung:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Modul Ajar Bab Kewarisan Islam yang dibagikan lewat platform edukasi guru atau unduhan PDF.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Referensi ayat &amp; dalil:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, khususnya Surah An-Nisa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Latihan soal &amp; ringkasan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Dokumen materi bab dari situs belajar bersama seperti Studocu</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" untuk mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 mencakup tiga ranah utama: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"RQmXqf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjh5LHPu4uWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf RQmXqf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb RQmXqf_j/HugV6-->asesmen sikap (spiritual dan sosial), pengetahuan (konsep dan perhitungan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta keterampilan (praktik analisis dan simulasi pembagian harta waris yang adil)</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogik pembelajaran materi kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 SMA/SMK </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"WB3Sic_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwidpOOUuouWAxUc1TgGHWZHAksQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf WB3Sic_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb WB3Sic_j/HugV6-->menerapkan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Problem-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Discovery Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru memadukan ceramah interaktif, studi kasus penghitungan harta, serta diskusi kelompok untuk membangun kearifan sosial dalam mencegah sengketa keluarga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 bab \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"PoNBbe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwju_br4uouWAxWz-jgGHcbZL_sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf PoNBbe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb PoNBbe_j/HugV6-->membahas ketentuan hukum pembagian harta peninggalan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) secara adil, rukun dan syarat waris, golongan ahli waris, serta nilai kearifan sosial untuk mencegah perpecahan dan menjaga keharmonisan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital dalam materi PAI kelas 12 tentang kewarisan dan kearifan Islam mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"QZvF2e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjhn9qGu4uWAxXozjgGHVEOF1IQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf QZvF2e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb QZvF2e_j/HugV6-->penggunaan kalkulator faraid interaktif, e-modul kontekstual, video animasi pembagian harta, dan kuis gamifikasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media digital ini mempermudah siswa memahami perhitungan rumit, mencegah konflik keluarga, dan menghayati nilai keadilan.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 memberikan pengalaman bermakna tentang <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qVQLtc_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiE-feWu4uWAxUpxjgGHcmbH3kQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qVQLtc_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qVQLtc_k/HugV6-->pentingnya keadilan, kejujuran, dan keharmonisan keluarga dalam membagikan harta peninggalan sesuai syariat demi menghindari perpecahan</mark></p>','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 menegaskan bahwa <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"S0iy6_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwimyv-iu4uWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf S0iy6_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb S0iy6_k/HugV6-->aturan pembagian harta peninggalan bukan sekadar hitungan matematis, melainkan wujud keadilan, kasih sayang, dan cara menjaga keharmonisan serta persaudaraan di dalam keluarga agar terhindar dari perpecahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 07:21:05','2026-08-06 07:21:05'),
(110,7,1,NULL,24,NULL,'kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"irC7ud_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3pcvBuYuWAxWh8TgGHUtlOlsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf irC7ud_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb irC7ud_k/HugV6-->berfokus pada pemahaman ketentuan ilmu <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mawaris<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (faraid), kemampuan menghitung pembagian harta peninggalan secara adil, serta kemampuan menghayati nilai kearifan untuk merawat keharmonisan keluarga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Oun8Ue_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-9-bnuYuWAxWBgGMGHROaA5sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Oun8Ue_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Oun8Ue_k/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep dasar ilmu faraid, kemampuan menganalisis ketentuan pembagian harta secara adil, serta penerapan nilai kearifan untuk menjaga keharmonisan dan mencegah perpecahan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">kewarisan dan kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Ilmu Mawaris/Faraid) dipelajari dengan <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gTQA2c_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiI9Z30uYuWAxU-xDgGHWDcD5IQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gTQA2c_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gTQA2c_k/HugV6-->metode interaktif seperti ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok studi kasus perhitungan harta, dan pemecahan masalah nyata agar siswa paham keadilan pembagian serta hikmah sosialnya</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" (Ilmu Mawaris) mencakup konsep dasar hukum</span>, pembagian bagian ahli waris, contoh hitungan, serta hikmah keadilan sosial. Guru dapat menggunakan media visual seperti <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XERLuf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjqzJj_uYuWAxWo2TgGHY3bN0gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XERLuf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XERLuf_j/HugV6-->presentasi, video animasi, dan lembar kerja studi kasus</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"lshUEc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf lshUEc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb lshUEc_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket Resmi Kemendikbudristek, modul ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, Al-Qur\'an (Surat An-Nisa\' ayat 11, 12, dan 176)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar yang Direkomendasikan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Buku Paket PAI dan Budi Pekerti Kelas 12 (Kurikulum Merdeka / K-13 Revisi) terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perangkat ajar pendukung:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Modul Ajar Bab Kewarisan Islam yang dibagikan lewat platform edukasi guru atau unduhan PDF.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Referensi ayat &amp; dalil:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, khususnya Surah An-Nisa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Latihan soal &amp; ringkasan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Dokumen materi bab dari situs belajar bersama seperti Studocu</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" untuk mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 mencakup tiga ranah utama: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"RQmXqf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjh5LHPu4uWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf RQmXqf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb RQmXqf_j/HugV6-->asesmen sikap (spiritual dan sosial), pengetahuan (konsep dan perhitungan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta keterampilan (praktik analisis dan simulasi pembagian harta waris yang adil)</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogik pembelajaran materi kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 SMA/SMK </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"WB3Sic_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwidpOOUuouWAxUc1TgGHWZHAksQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf WB3Sic_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb WB3Sic_j/HugV6-->menerapkan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Problem-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Discovery Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru memadukan ceramah interaktif, studi kasus penghitungan harta, serta diskusi kelompok untuk membangun kearifan sosial dalam mencegah sengketa keluarga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 bab \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"PoNBbe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwju_br4uouWAxWz-jgGHcbZL_sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf PoNBbe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb PoNBbe_j/HugV6-->membahas ketentuan hukum pembagian harta peninggalan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) secara adil, rukun dan syarat waris, golongan ahli waris, serta nilai kearifan sosial untuk mencegah perpecahan dan menjaga keharmonisan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital dalam materi PAI kelas 12 tentang kewarisan dan kearifan Islam mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"QZvF2e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjhn9qGu4uWAxXozjgGHVEOF1IQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf QZvF2e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb QZvF2e_j/HugV6-->penggunaan kalkulator faraid interaktif, e-modul kontekstual, video animasi pembagian harta, dan kuis gamifikasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media digital ini mempermudah siswa memahami perhitungan rumit, mencegah konflik keluarga, dan menghayati nilai keadilan.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 memberikan pengalaman bermakna tentang <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qVQLtc_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiE-feWu4uWAxUpxjgGHcmbH3kQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qVQLtc_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qVQLtc_k/HugV6-->pentingnya keadilan, kejujuran, dan keharmonisan keluarga dalam membagikan harta peninggalan sesuai syariat demi menghindari perpecahan</mark></p>','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 menegaskan bahwa <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"S0iy6_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwimyv-iu4uWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf S0iy6_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb S0iy6_k/HugV6-->aturan pembagian harta peninggalan bukan sekadar hitungan matematis, melainkan wujud keadilan, kasih sayang, dan cara menjaga keharmonisan serta persaudaraan di dalam keluarga agar terhindar dari perpecahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 07:21:05','2026-08-06 07:21:05'),
(111,7,1,NULL,25,NULL,'kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"irC7ud_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi3pcvBuYuWAxWh8TgGHUtlOlsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf irC7ud_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb irC7ud_k/HugV6-->berfokus pada pemahaman ketentuan ilmu <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">mawaris<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (faraid), kemampuan menghitung pembagian harta peninggalan secara adil, serta kemampuan menghayati nilai kearifan untuk merawat keharmonisan keluarga<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Oun8Ue_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi-9-bnuYuWAxWBgGMGHROaA5sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Oun8Ue_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Oun8Ue_k/HugV6-->pemahaman konsep dasar ilmu faraid, kemampuan menganalisis ketentuan pembagian harta secara adil, serta penerapan nilai kearifan untuk menjaga keharmonisan dan mencegah perpecahan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">kewarisan dan kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Ilmu Mawaris/Faraid) dipelajari dengan <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gTQA2c_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiI9Z30uYuWAxU-xDgGHWDcD5IQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gTQA2c_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gTQA2c_k/HugV6-->metode interaktif seperti ceramah interaktif, diskusi kelompok studi kasus perhitungan harta, dan pemecahan masalah nyata agar siswa paham keadilan pembagian serta hikmah sosialnya</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" (Ilmu Mawaris) mencakup konsep dasar hukum</span>, pembagian bagian ahli waris, contoh hitungan, serta hikmah keadilan sosial. Guru dapat menggunakan media visual seperti <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XERLuf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjqzJj_uYuWAxWo2TgGHY3bN0gQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XERLuf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XERLuf_j/HugV6-->presentasi, video animasi, dan lembar kerja studi kasus</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Sumber belajar materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Kelas 12 tentang \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"lshUEc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf lshUEc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb lshUEc_j/HugV6-->Buku Paket Resmi Kemendikbudristek, modul ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, Al-Qur\'an (Surat An-Nisa\' ayat 11, 12, dan 176)</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar yang Direkomendasikan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku teks utama:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Buku Paket PAI dan Budi Pekerti Kelas 12 (Kurikulum Merdeka / K-13 Revisi) terbitan Kemendikbudristek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Perangkat ajar pendukung:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Modul Ajar Bab Kewarisan Islam yang dibagikan lewat platform edukasi guru atau unduhan PDF.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Referensi ayat &amp; dalil:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Al-Qur\'an dan terjemahannya, khususnya Surah An-Nisa.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwis05-xu4uWAxWF8jgGHbuYJVIQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Latihan soal &amp; ringkasan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Dokumen materi bab dari situs belajar bersama seperti Studocu</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" untuk mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 mencakup tiga ranah utama: </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"RQmXqf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjh5LHPu4uWAxUc1TgGHe1GAkgQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf RQmXqf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb RQmXqf_j/HugV6-->asesmen sikap (spiritual dan sosial), pengetahuan (konsep dan perhitungan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta keterampilan (praktik analisis dan simulasi pembagian harta waris yang adil)</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogik pembelajaran materi kewarisan (mawaris) dan kearifan dalam Islam untuk kelas 12 SMA/SMK </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"WB3Sic_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwidpOOUuouWAxUc1TgGHWZHAksQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf WB3Sic_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb WB3Sic_j/HugV6-->menerapkan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Problem-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Discovery Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru memadukan ceramah interaktif, studi kasus penghitungan harta, serta diskusi kelompok untuk membangun kearifan sosial dalam mencegah sengketa keluarga</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 bab \"Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam\" </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"PoNBbe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwju_br4uouWAxWz-jgGHcbZL_sQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf PoNBbe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb PoNBbe_j/HugV6-->membahas ketentuan hukum pembagian harta peninggalan (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">faraid<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) secara adil, rukun dan syarat waris, golongan ahli waris, serta nilai kearifan sosial untuk mencegah perpecahan dan menjaga keharmonisan keluarga</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital dalam materi PAI kelas 12 tentang kewarisan dan kearifan Islam mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"QZvF2e_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjhn9qGu4uWAxXozjgGHVEOF1IQuJAPegoIAggACAAIChAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf QZvF2e_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb QZvF2e_j/HugV6-->penggunaan kalkulator faraid interaktif, e-modul kontekstual, video animasi pembagian harta, dan kuis gamifikasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media digital ini mempermudah siswa memahami perhitungan rumit, mencegah konflik keluarga, dan menghayati nilai keadilan.</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 memberikan pengalaman bermakna tentang <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qVQLtc_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiE-feWu4uWAxUpxjgGHcmbH3kQuJAPegoIAggACAAICRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qVQLtc_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qVQLtc_k/HugV6-->pentingnya keadilan, kejujuran, dan keharmonisan keluarga dalam membagikan harta peninggalan sesuai syariat demi menghindari perpecahan</mark></p>','<p><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kewarisan dan Kearifan dalam Islam<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (Fikih Mawaris) pada mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 menegaskan bahwa <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"S0iy6_l\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwimyv-iu4uWAxWX1jgGHSL8Hq4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf S0iy6_k/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb S0iy6_k/HugV6-->aturan pembagian harta peninggalan bukan sekadar hitungan matematis, melainkan wujud keadilan, kasih sayang, dan cara menjaga keharmonisan serta persaudaraan di dalam keluarga agar terhindar dari perpecahan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 07:21:05','2026-08-06 07:21:05'),
(112,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Cinta Tanah Air dan Moderasi Beragama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> untuk mata pelajaran PAI Kelas 12 (Fase F) menuntut peserta didik <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"aprLqe_1d\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwik1eG8z4uWAxXNjuEIHd10JjsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf aprLqe_1c/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb aprLqe_1c/HugV6-->mampu menganalisis dalil Al-Qur\'an dan Hadis, menginternalisasi nilai-nilai kebangsaan, serta menerapkan sikap toleran dan seimbang dalam kehidupan bermasyarakat yang majemuk.</mark></p>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Target Capaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwik1eG8z4uWAxXNjuEIHd10JjsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIExAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBMQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis Dalil:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Peserta didik mampu membaca, menterjemahkan, dan menganalisis ayat Al-Qur\'an (seperti Q.S. Al-Qasas/28: 85 dan Q.S. Al-Baqarah/2: 143) serta Hadis terkait konsep cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama.</span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwik1eG8z4uWAxXNjuEIHd10JjsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIExAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBMQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami Konsep:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Peserta didik menguasai makna konseptual cinta tanah air sebagai bagian dari iman (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hubbul wathan minal iman<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) dan prinsip moderasi beragama (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">wasathiyah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>).</span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwik1eG8z4uWAxXNjuEIHd10JjsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIExAN\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBMQDQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Internalisasi Nilai:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Peserta didik mampu mengidentifikasi empat pilar utama moderasi beragama, yaitu komitmen kebangsaan, toleransi, anti-kekerasan, dan akomodasi budaya loka</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">cinta tanah air<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">moderasi beragama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> adalah <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"mxFoT_m\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiWlJTpz4uWAxULgeEIHQeIPY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf mxFoT_l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb mxFoT_l/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu memahami konsep nasionalisme dan sikap beragama yang seimbang, menghargai perbedaan, menolak sikap ekstrem, serta mengamalkan nilai toleransi dan kerukunan dalam kehidupan berbangsa</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"BezPqd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiq5dH7z4uWAxUEj-EIHWZmMJ0QuJAPegoIAggACAAIDxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf BezPqd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb BezPqd_1b/HugV6-->menggunakan pendekatan interaktif, kontekstual, dan afektif seperti <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Problem Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, diskusi kelompok, pemutaran video, dan penugasan proyek sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Metode ini bertujuan membentuk sikap toleran, adil, serta nasionalis.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Metode Pembelajaran yang Digunakan<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiq5dH7z4uWAxUEj-EIHWZmMJ0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Contextual Teaching and Learning (CTL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mengaitkan materi cinta tanah air dengan isu nyata kebangsaan dan keragaman di Indonesia saat ini.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiq5dH7z4uWAxUEj-EIHWZmMJ0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Problem Based Learning (PBL):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Siswa memecahkan kasus nyata konflik radikalisme atau intoleransi dalam bentuk studi kasus kelompok.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiq5dH7z4uWAxUEj-EIHWZmMJ0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Role Playing (Bermain Peran):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Mensimulasikan dialog lintas budaya atau cara mengatasi perbedaan pendapat secara bijak dan moderat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiq5dH7z4uWAxUEj-EIHWZmMJ0Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIEhAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBIQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode Keteladanan dan Pembiasaan:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Guru memberi contoh sikap santun dan menghargai perbedaan di lingkungan sekolah</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"vauqz_1d\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiOm9iO0IuWAxXqDy4FHR6lFg4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf vauqz_1c/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb vauqz_1c/HugV6-->penggunaan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">modul ajar berbasis teks<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-si