|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pai-kelas-12-sma-cinta-tanah-air-dan-moderasi-dalam-beragama/275330985&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;PAI Kelas 12 SMA - Cinta Tanah Air dan Moderasi dalam Beragama&quot;,&quot;Cinta tanah air dipandang sebagai bagian dari iman dan diharapkan dapat menumbuhkan sikap nasionalisme serta menjaga persatuan bangsa. Selain itu, moderasi beragama diartikan sebagai sikap seimbang yang menghindari ekstremisme, dengan tujuan menciptakan kehidupan yang damai dan harmonis di masyarakat.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQr75-5jVwxwHRKpcb_Pg1lBO-Zr-jKfsuTvpAI-q7_CG3YQQIc7NGSS14IbkIRn7c3Ze1Dt3h2lmdbhtA&quot;,&quot;Slideshare&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786006571338395,149000720,2483368227],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,22]]],null,&quot;a8585d18-fb51-4a8b-8714-86182899cba6&quot;]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiblYH60IuWAxUQkuEIHSMxBZQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFBAM\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQDA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video pengantar<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan konsep di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSNnQiccNUU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiblYH60IuWAxUQkuEIHSMxBZQQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFBAO\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQDg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">YouTube PAI Kelas 12</a></span></span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"s4uUAe_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiX3byL0YuWAxWBlOEIHbHrLzQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf s4uUAe_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb s4uUAe_j/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah: asesmen diagnostik, formatif, dan sumatif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Aspek yang dinilai meliputi pemahaman konsep, pengamalan sikap nasionalisme-toleransi, serta keterampilan menyajikan gagasan</p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"MdPmjb_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwicxNaj0IuWAxUaieEIHQO4MzEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf MdPmjb_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb MdPmjb_1b/HugV6-->menggunakan model berpusat pada siswa seperti <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Discovery Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, dan studi kasus<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru memakai metode diskusi kelompok, analisis teks atau video, serta refleksi nilai agar siswa mampu bersikap adil, toleran, dan nasionalis</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XXqTee_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj1tKq00IuWAxXTgeEIHc-aOiEQuJAPegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XXqTee_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XXqTee_1b/HugV6-->dibangun melalui iklim sekolah yang inklusif, dialog interaktif, keteladanan guru, serta pembiasaan sikap toleran dan nasionalisme dalam kehidupan sehari-hari</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan media digital dalam materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">cinta tanah air<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dan <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">moderasi beragama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dapat dilakukan melalui <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"Yl6v7_1e\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiOtdTJ0IuWAxX-gOEIHRkII18QuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf Yl6v7_1d/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb Yl6v7_1d/HugV6-->pembuatan konten video kolaboratif, diskusi berbasis e-learning, pemanfaatan infografis toleransi, serta kampanye damai di media sosial untuk membangun sikap nasionalisme dan anti-kekerasan</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pengalaman belajar materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"mrNQEc_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwimzePc0IuWAxX1guEIHeBiGZcQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf mrNQEc_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb mrNQEc_j/HugV6-->memberikan pemahaman mendalam bahwa nasionalisme adalah bagian dari iman (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">hubbul wathan minal iman<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta mengajarkan sikap tengah (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">wasathiyah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) yang adil, toleran, dan rukun dalam keberagaman</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang cinta tanah air dan moderasi beragama </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"gCFoSd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi_ouLt0IuWAxU3OS4FHSgtD80QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf gCFoSd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gCFoSd_j/HugV6-->menunjukkan pentingnya menanamkan sikap nasionalisme yang selaras dengan nilai agama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Siswa belajar bahwa menjaga keutuhan bangsa dan bersikap adil, toleran, serta tidak ekstrem adalah bagian dari pengamalan iman dalam kehidupan majemuk</p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 08:57:19','2026-08-06 08:57:19'),
(116,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'adab menggunakan media sosial','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dalam mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Fase F (umumnya pada tingkat SMA/SMK Kelas 12 atau Fase F) <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"unn6qd_1d\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf unn6qd_1c/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb unn6qd_1c/HugV6-->berfokus pada elemen <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Akhlak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Peserta didik diharapkan mampu menganalisis dan membiasakan etika digital sesuai ajaran Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CP-ATP-PAI-FASE-F_KELAS-12.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://sdkrambilsawitsaptosari.pendidikan.gunungkidulkab.go.id/file?path=media%2Fsdkrambilsawitsaptosari_1719212819968_cppaibpsdrevisi24.pdf\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/994408931/LKPD-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial-1\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berikut adalah rincian capaian pembelajaran dan substansi materi tersebut:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Inti Capaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami Konsep<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu menganalisis adab dan etika menggunakan media sosial berdasarkan ajaran Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis Dampak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu mengevaluasi dampak positif dan negatif penggunaan media sosial bagi individu dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penerapan Sikap<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik meyakini bahwa adab digital mendatangkan keselamatan serta terbiasa bersikap jujur, santun, dan bertanggung jawab di dunia maya</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XlpZGd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV-8nf0YuWAxWVkeEIHaHEG98QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XlpZGd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XlpZGd_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menjelaskan etika digital Islam, menganalisis dalil naqli, menyaring informasi (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta membiasakan perilaku santun, jujur, dan bertanggung jawab saat berinteraksi di ruang digital</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 berbasis media sosial dapat dilakukan dengan memanfaatkan platform seperti </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"OLCsce_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9nNLr0YuWAxWrkeEIHbdSOqQQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf OLCsce_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb OLCsce_j/HugV6-->YouTube untuk bedah video ceramah materi iman kepada hari akhir, Instagram untuk infografis hukum Islam atau tajuk keteladanan tokoh Islam, serta WhatsApp untuk diskusi kelompok interaktif dan pengumpulan tugas</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) dirancang untuk membentuk kesadaran etika digital peserta didik</span>. Materi ini <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"iDo3ld_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinua7-0YuWAxUtieEIHZ17EFsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf iDo3ld_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb iDo3ld_1b/HugV6-->mencakup prinsip <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring sebelum sharing), menghindari hoaks, ujaran kebencian, serta pemanfaatan platform digital untuk menyebarkan kebaikan berdasarkan ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Catatan: Materi \"Adab Menggunakan Media Sosial\" dalam kurikulum PAI umumnya diajarkan pada tingkat Kelas 11 (Kurikulum Merdeka)</span>, bukan Kelas 12. Sumber belajar utama mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qvldJd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQuJAPegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qvldJd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qvldJd_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 11, Modul Ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, materi presentasi (PPT), serta video pembelajaran daring<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/883967870/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">5</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi inti pembelajaran ini merujuk pada pedoman <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[17]}]],17,null,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam&quot;,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam * Mencari informasi yang bermanfaat. ... * Tabayyun. ... * Tidak menebarkan kebencian dan berita palsu. ... * Menjaga lisan dan kata-kata dalam berucap. ... * Jadikan media sosial sebagai sarana menyebarkan kebaikan.&quot;,null,&quot;Perpustakaan UMY&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://library.umy.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,18]]],null,&quot;767efeb6-da31-4dd9-83d8-ba456595f955&quot;]]--></span> dan dapat diakses melalui berbagai sarana berikut. [<a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar PAI<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Teks Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Paket Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XI (Bab tentang Adab Bermedia Sosial).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Dokumen perangkat pembelajaran guru seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Modul Ajar Adab Bersosial Media di Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Adab Bersosial Media dalam Islam | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Pembelajaran mencakup pemahaman etika digital, dampak media sosial, dan pembuatan konten positif, menggunakan metode Project-Based Learning dan berbagai alat ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcT63gNEI1itFGD5sgF7QAqzSVSplMlqY1vUhPlDG9hA88al5sgT536STmLAf13bjXKOs3XtrLX97c33aLU&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,23]]],null,&quot;0c92cb92-8a6f-41ca-a68f-5ea9f21b2595&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi (PPT)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Ringkasan visual materi bab adab digital di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAI\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">SlideShare Bab Adab Media Sosial</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;ppt-bab-8-adab-menggunakan-media-sosial.pdf - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Materi ini mencakup pengertian adab, dalil naqli yang mendasari, serta praktik baik seperti memilih teman yang baik, meneliti informasi, dan menyampaikan berita ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTwzAPb0ufXfP_O1zleAEgGzXpRqWzKfN6qI8ujS7M2UIUyNdDqiqDDWzBsk6d4rVNc-7HTmkTSaHKbIyY&quot;,&quot;Slideshare&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,24]]],null,&quot;4fd1c730-4eeb-46a2-97c5-3c76fc3f48e6&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan ringkas konsep etika dan adab di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">YouTube Rangkuman Materi PAI</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dNJyvPq-3z6I&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 11 Bab 8 Kurikulum Merdeka&quot;,&quot;Penerapan karakter dalam adab bermedia sosial mencakup saling menghormati dan menghargai antar pengguna media sosial. Selain itu, penting untuk menggunakan bahasa yang santun dan tidak menyinggung perasaan orang lain. Menghindari menyebarkan berita buruk sangka, mencari-cari kesalahan orang lain, dan bergosip juga merupakan bagian dari penerapan karakter ini. Pengguna media sosial sebaiknya menggunakan platform ini untuk hal-hal yang bermanfaat dan menghindari memproduksi atau menyebarkan berita bohong serta ujaran kebencian.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQT7aBcazTcql0pdA1OS2OrZT6YQizYatcHcqXsgZSODeENMyX_oIzR_Vw1wGxKYXuwxwLMSCHI5o5VeWQ&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,25]]],null,&quot;be2ba893-0155-4017-81f0-6195f8a90a05&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">4</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIFhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"IhtiKf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjnr96D04uWAxW2ieEIHWmVHJwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf IhtiKf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb IhtiKf_1b/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah utama: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sikap (afektif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui lembar pengamatan perilaku digital, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">pengetahuan (kognitif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> lewat tes tertulis analisis dalil dan konsep <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">keterampilan (psikomotorik)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui praktik membuat konten dakwah atau kampanye etika bermedia sosial</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran adab bermedia sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"FRdaHc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjj_7SX0ouWAxXlj-EIHYiZNjkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf FRdaHc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb FRdaHc_1b/HugV6-->menerapkan pendekatan kontekstual dan berbasis projek<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, di mana siswa menganalisis konten digital secara kritis, melakukan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta mempraktikkan pembuatan konten dakwah yang santun di platform digital nyata</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uNeLkc_91\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uNeLkc_90/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uNeLkc_90/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas fisik dan ruang digital secara interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini berfokus pada penerapan etika Islam seperti <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (mengecek kebenaran berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah, serta menjadikan media sosial sebagai sarana dakwah dan penyebar kebaikan. [<a href=\"https://perpustakaan.uad.ac.id/adab-bersosial-media-dalam-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://ejournal.yayasanpendidikandzurriyatulquran.id/index.php/ihsan/article/view/942\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kombinasi Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggabungkan diskusi tatap muka di kelas dengan penugasan praktik langsung di platform digital nyata.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Kolaboratif &amp; Reflektif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Siswa diajak menganalisis kasus nyata pelanggaran etika digital yang sering terjadi di dunia maya.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berpusat pada Siswa (Student-Centered)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggunakan metode berbasis proyek seperti pembuatan konten positif atau kampanye antikebencian (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hoax<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>).</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hFj73c_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwilxrG80ouWAxXekOEIHevnItcQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hFj73c_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hFj73c_1b/HugV6-->penerapan nilai <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah online, serta memproduksi konten dakwah positif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media sosial berfungsi ganda sebagai objek kajian etika sekaligus sarana praktik langsung komunikasi islami di ruang digital</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) memberikan pengalaman nyata bagi siswa untuk </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"scMksf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjijbPN0ouWAxULgeEIHQeIPY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf scMksf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb scMksf_j/HugV6-->memahami <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (meneliti kebenaran berita), menjaga lisan, serta menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan hoaks di dunia maya sesuai ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hZqKWb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiEwfzl0ouWAxVNgeEIHROqGpkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hZqKWb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hZqKWb_j/HugV6-->pemahaman pentingnya etika Islam saat bermedia sosial, introspeksi diri terhadap jejak digital, serta komitmen menyebarkan kebaikan dan menghindari hoaks sesuai ajaran Al-Qur\'an dan Sunnah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 09:05:55','2026-08-06 09:05:55'),
(117,7,1,NULL,23,NULL,'adab menggunakan media sosial','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dalam mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Fase F (umumnya pada tingkat SMA/SMK Kelas 12 atau Fase F) <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"unn6qd_1d\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf unn6qd_1c/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb unn6qd_1c/HugV6-->berfokus pada elemen <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Akhlak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Peserta didik diharapkan mampu menganalisis dan membiasakan etika digital sesuai ajaran Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CP-ATP-PAI-FASE-F_KELAS-12.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://sdkrambilsawitsaptosari.pendidikan.gunungkidulkab.go.id/file?path=media%2Fsdkrambilsawitsaptosari_1719212819968_cppaibpsdrevisi24.pdf\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/994408931/LKPD-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial-1\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berikut adalah rincian capaian pembelajaran dan substansi materi tersebut:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Inti Capaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami Konsep<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu menganalisis adab dan etika menggunakan media sosial berdasarkan ajaran Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis Dampak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu mengevaluasi dampak positif dan negatif penggunaan media sosial bagi individu dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penerapan Sikap<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik meyakini bahwa adab digital mendatangkan keselamatan serta terbiasa bersikap jujur, santun, dan bertanggung jawab di dunia maya</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XlpZGd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV-8nf0YuWAxWVkeEIHaHEG98QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XlpZGd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XlpZGd_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menjelaskan etika digital Islam, menganalisis dalil naqli, menyaring informasi (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta membiasakan perilaku santun, jujur, dan bertanggung jawab saat berinteraksi di ruang digital</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 berbasis media sosial dapat dilakukan dengan memanfaatkan platform seperti </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"OLCsce_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9nNLr0YuWAxWrkeEIHbdSOqQQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf OLCsce_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb OLCsce_j/HugV6-->YouTube untuk bedah video ceramah materi iman kepada hari akhir, Instagram untuk infografis hukum Islam atau tajuk keteladanan tokoh Islam, serta WhatsApp untuk diskusi kelompok interaktif dan pengumpulan tugas</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) dirancang untuk membentuk kesadaran etika digital peserta didik</span>. Materi ini <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"iDo3ld_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinua7-0YuWAxUtieEIHZ17EFsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf iDo3ld_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb iDo3ld_1b/HugV6-->mencakup prinsip <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring sebelum sharing), menghindari hoaks, ujaran kebencian, serta pemanfaatan platform digital untuk menyebarkan kebaikan berdasarkan ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Catatan: Materi \"Adab Menggunakan Media Sosial\" dalam kurikulum PAI umumnya diajarkan pada tingkat Kelas 11 (Kurikulum Merdeka)</span>, bukan Kelas 12. Sumber belajar utama mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qvldJd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQuJAPegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qvldJd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qvldJd_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 11, Modul Ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, materi presentasi (PPT), serta video pembelajaran daring<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/883967870/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">5</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi inti pembelajaran ini merujuk pada pedoman <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[17]}]],17,null,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam&quot;,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam * Mencari informasi yang bermanfaat. ... * Tabayyun. ... * Tidak menebarkan kebencian dan berita palsu. ... * Menjaga lisan dan kata-kata dalam berucap. ... * Jadikan media sosial sebagai sarana menyebarkan kebaikan.&quot;,null,&quot;Perpustakaan UMY&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://library.umy.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,18]]],null,&quot;767efeb6-da31-4dd9-83d8-ba456595f955&quot;]]--></span> dan dapat diakses melalui berbagai sarana berikut. [<a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar PAI<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Teks Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Paket Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XI (Bab tentang Adab Bermedia Sosial).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Dokumen perangkat pembelajaran guru seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Modul Ajar Adab Bersosial Media di Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Adab Bersosial Media dalam Islam | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Pembelajaran mencakup pemahaman etika digital, dampak media sosial, dan pembuatan konten positif, menggunakan metode Project-Based Learning dan berbagai alat ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcT63gNEI1itFGD5sgF7QAqzSVSplMlqY1vUhPlDG9hA88al5sgT536STmLAf13bjXKOs3XtrLX97c33aLU&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,23]]],null,&quot;0c92cb92-8a6f-41ca-a68f-5ea9f21b2595&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi (PPT)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Ringkasan visual materi bab adab digital di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAI\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">SlideShare Bab Adab Media Sosial</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;ppt-bab-8-adab-menggunakan-media-sosial.pdf - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Materi ini mencakup pengertian adab, dalil naqli yang mendasari, serta praktik baik seperti memilih teman yang baik, meneliti informasi, dan menyampaikan berita ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTwzAPb0ufXfP_O1zleAEgGzXpRqWzKfN6qI8ujS7M2UIUyNdDqiqDDWzBsk6d4rVNc-7HTmkTSaHKbIyY&quot;,&quot;Slideshare&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,24]]],null,&quot;4fd1c730-4eeb-46a2-97c5-3c76fc3f48e6&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan ringkas konsep etika dan adab di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">YouTube Rangkuman Materi PAI</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dNJyvPq-3z6I&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 11 Bab 8 Kurikulum Merdeka&quot;,&quot;Penerapan karakter dalam adab bermedia sosial mencakup saling menghormati dan menghargai antar pengguna media sosial. Selain itu, penting untuk menggunakan bahasa yang santun dan tidak menyinggung perasaan orang lain. Menghindari menyebarkan berita buruk sangka, mencari-cari kesalahan orang lain, dan bergosip juga merupakan bagian dari penerapan karakter ini. Pengguna media sosial sebaiknya menggunakan platform ini untuk hal-hal yang bermanfaat dan menghindari memproduksi atau menyebarkan berita bohong serta ujaran kebencian.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQT7aBcazTcql0pdA1OS2OrZT6YQizYatcHcqXsgZSODeENMyX_oIzR_Vw1wGxKYXuwxwLMSCHI5o5VeWQ&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,25]]],null,&quot;be2ba893-0155-4017-81f0-6195f8a90a05&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">4</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIFhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"IhtiKf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjnr96D04uWAxW2ieEIHWmVHJwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf IhtiKf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb IhtiKf_1b/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah utama: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sikap (afektif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui lembar pengamatan perilaku digital, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">pengetahuan (kognitif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> lewat tes tertulis analisis dalil dan konsep <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">keterampilan (psikomotorik)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui praktik membuat konten dakwah atau kampanye etika bermedia sosial</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran adab bermedia sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"FRdaHc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjj_7SX0ouWAxXlj-EIHYiZNjkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf FRdaHc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb FRdaHc_1b/HugV6-->menerapkan pendekatan kontekstual dan berbasis projek<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, di mana siswa menganalisis konten digital secara kritis, melakukan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta mempraktikkan pembuatan konten dakwah yang santun di platform digital nyata</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uNeLkc_91\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uNeLkc_90/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uNeLkc_90/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas fisik dan ruang digital secara interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini berfokus pada penerapan etika Islam seperti <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (mengecek kebenaran berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah, serta menjadikan media sosial sebagai sarana dakwah dan penyebar kebaikan. [<a href=\"https://perpustakaan.uad.ac.id/adab-bersosial-media-dalam-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://ejournal.yayasanpendidikandzurriyatulquran.id/index.php/ihsan/article/view/942\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kombinasi Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggabungkan diskusi tatap muka di kelas dengan penugasan praktik langsung di platform digital nyata.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Kolaboratif &amp; Reflektif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Siswa diajak menganalisis kasus nyata pelanggaran etika digital yang sering terjadi di dunia maya.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berpusat pada Siswa (Student-Centered)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggunakan metode berbasis proyek seperti pembuatan konten positif atau kampanye antikebencian (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hoax<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>).</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hFj73c_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwilxrG80ouWAxXekOEIHevnItcQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hFj73c_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hFj73c_1b/HugV6-->penerapan nilai <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah online, serta memproduksi konten dakwah positif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media sosial berfungsi ganda sebagai objek kajian etika sekaligus sarana praktik langsung komunikasi islami di ruang digital</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) memberikan pengalaman nyata bagi siswa untuk </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"scMksf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjijbPN0ouWAxULgeEIHQeIPY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf scMksf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb scMksf_j/HugV6-->memahami <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (meneliti kebenaran berita), menjaga lisan, serta menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan hoaks di dunia maya sesuai ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hZqKWb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiEwfzl0ouWAxVNgeEIHROqGpkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hZqKWb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hZqKWb_j/HugV6-->pemahaman pentingnya etika Islam saat bermedia sosial, introspeksi diri terhadap jejak digital, serta komitmen menyebarkan kebaikan dan menghindari hoaks sesuai ajaran Al-Qur\'an dan Sunnah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 09:05:55','2026-08-06 09:05:55'),
(118,7,1,NULL,24,NULL,'adab menggunakan media sosial','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dalam mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Fase F (umumnya pada tingkat SMA/SMK Kelas 12 atau Fase F) <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"unn6qd_1d\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf unn6qd_1c/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb unn6qd_1c/HugV6-->berfokus pada elemen <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Akhlak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Peserta didik diharapkan mampu menganalisis dan membiasakan etika digital sesuai ajaran Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CP-ATP-PAI-FASE-F_KELAS-12.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://sdkrambilsawitsaptosari.pendidikan.gunungkidulkab.go.id/file?path=media%2Fsdkrambilsawitsaptosari_1719212819968_cppaibpsdrevisi24.pdf\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/994408931/LKPD-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial-1\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berikut adalah rincian capaian pembelajaran dan substansi materi tersebut:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Inti Capaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami Konsep<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu menganalisis adab dan etika menggunakan media sosial berdasarkan ajaran Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis Dampak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu mengevaluasi dampak positif dan negatif penggunaan media sosial bagi individu dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penerapan Sikap<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik meyakini bahwa adab digital mendatangkan keselamatan serta terbiasa bersikap jujur, santun, dan bertanggung jawab di dunia maya</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XlpZGd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV-8nf0YuWAxWVkeEIHaHEG98QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XlpZGd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XlpZGd_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menjelaskan etika digital Islam, menganalisis dalil naqli, menyaring informasi (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta membiasakan perilaku santun, jujur, dan bertanggung jawab saat berinteraksi di ruang digital</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 berbasis media sosial dapat dilakukan dengan memanfaatkan platform seperti </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"OLCsce_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9nNLr0YuWAxWrkeEIHbdSOqQQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf OLCsce_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb OLCsce_j/HugV6-->YouTube untuk bedah video ceramah materi iman kepada hari akhir, Instagram untuk infografis hukum Islam atau tajuk keteladanan tokoh Islam, serta WhatsApp untuk diskusi kelompok interaktif dan pengumpulan tugas</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) dirancang untuk membentuk kesadaran etika digital peserta didik</span>. Materi ini <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"iDo3ld_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinua7-0YuWAxUtieEIHZ17EFsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf iDo3ld_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb iDo3ld_1b/HugV6-->mencakup prinsip <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring sebelum sharing), menghindari hoaks, ujaran kebencian, serta pemanfaatan platform digital untuk menyebarkan kebaikan berdasarkan ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Catatan: Materi \"Adab Menggunakan Media Sosial\" dalam kurikulum PAI umumnya diajarkan pada tingkat Kelas 11 (Kurikulum Merdeka)</span>, bukan Kelas 12. Sumber belajar utama mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qvldJd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQuJAPegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qvldJd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qvldJd_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 11, Modul Ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, materi presentasi (PPT), serta video pembelajaran daring<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/883967870/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">5</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi inti pembelajaran ini merujuk pada pedoman <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[17]}]],17,null,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam&quot;,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam * Mencari informasi yang bermanfaat. ... * Tabayyun. ... * Tidak menebarkan kebencian dan berita palsu. ... * Menjaga lisan dan kata-kata dalam berucap. ... * Jadikan media sosial sebagai sarana menyebarkan kebaikan.&quot;,null,&quot;Perpustakaan UMY&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://library.umy.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,18]]],null,&quot;767efeb6-da31-4dd9-83d8-ba456595f955&quot;]]--></span> dan dapat diakses melalui berbagai sarana berikut. [<a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar PAI<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Teks Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Paket Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XI (Bab tentang Adab Bermedia Sosial).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Dokumen perangkat pembelajaran guru seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Modul Ajar Adab Bersosial Media di Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Adab Bersosial Media dalam Islam | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Pembelajaran mencakup pemahaman etika digital, dampak media sosial, dan pembuatan konten positif, menggunakan metode Project-Based Learning dan berbagai alat ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcT63gNEI1itFGD5sgF7QAqzSVSplMlqY1vUhPlDG9hA88al5sgT536STmLAf13bjXKOs3XtrLX97c33aLU&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,23]]],null,&quot;0c92cb92-8a6f-41ca-a68f-5ea9f21b2595&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi (PPT)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Ringkasan visual materi bab adab digital di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAI\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">SlideShare Bab Adab Media Sosial</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;ppt-bab-8-adab-menggunakan-media-sosial.pdf - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Materi ini mencakup pengertian adab, dalil naqli yang mendasari, serta praktik baik seperti memilih teman yang baik, meneliti informasi, dan menyampaikan berita ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTwzAPb0ufXfP_O1zleAEgGzXpRqWzKfN6qI8ujS7M2UIUyNdDqiqDDWzBsk6d4rVNc-7HTmkTSaHKbIyY&quot;,&quot;Slideshare&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,24]]],null,&quot;4fd1c730-4eeb-46a2-97c5-3c76fc3f48e6&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan ringkas konsep etika dan adab di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">YouTube Rangkuman Materi PAI</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dNJyvPq-3z6I&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 11 Bab 8 Kurikulum Merdeka&quot;,&quot;Penerapan karakter dalam adab bermedia sosial mencakup saling menghormati dan menghargai antar pengguna media sosial. Selain itu, penting untuk menggunakan bahasa yang santun dan tidak menyinggung perasaan orang lain. Menghindari menyebarkan berita buruk sangka, mencari-cari kesalahan orang lain, dan bergosip juga merupakan bagian dari penerapan karakter ini. Pengguna media sosial sebaiknya menggunakan platform ini untuk hal-hal yang bermanfaat dan menghindari memproduksi atau menyebarkan berita bohong serta ujaran kebencian.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQT7aBcazTcql0pdA1OS2OrZT6YQizYatcHcqXsgZSODeENMyX_oIzR_Vw1wGxKYXuwxwLMSCHI5o5VeWQ&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,25]]],null,&quot;be2ba893-0155-4017-81f0-6195f8a90a05&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">4</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIFhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"IhtiKf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjnr96D04uWAxW2ieEIHWmVHJwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf IhtiKf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb IhtiKf_1b/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah utama: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sikap (afektif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui lembar pengamatan perilaku digital, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">pengetahuan (kognitif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> lewat tes tertulis analisis dalil dan konsep <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">keterampilan (psikomotorik)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui praktik membuat konten dakwah atau kampanye etika bermedia sosial</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran adab bermedia sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"FRdaHc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjj_7SX0ouWAxXlj-EIHYiZNjkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf FRdaHc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb FRdaHc_1b/HugV6-->menerapkan pendekatan kontekstual dan berbasis projek<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, di mana siswa menganalisis konten digital secara kritis, melakukan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta mempraktikkan pembuatan konten dakwah yang santun di platform digital nyata</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uNeLkc_91\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uNeLkc_90/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uNeLkc_90/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas fisik dan ruang digital secara interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini berfokus pada penerapan etika Islam seperti <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (mengecek kebenaran berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah, serta menjadikan media sosial sebagai sarana dakwah dan penyebar kebaikan. [<a href=\"https://perpustakaan.uad.ac.id/adab-bersosial-media-dalam-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://ejournal.yayasanpendidikandzurriyatulquran.id/index.php/ihsan/article/view/942\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kombinasi Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggabungkan diskusi tatap muka di kelas dengan penugasan praktik langsung di platform digital nyata.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Kolaboratif &amp; Reflektif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Siswa diajak menganalisis kasus nyata pelanggaran etika digital yang sering terjadi di dunia maya.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berpusat pada Siswa (Student-Centered)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggunakan metode berbasis proyek seperti pembuatan konten positif atau kampanye antikebencian (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hoax<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>).</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hFj73c_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwilxrG80ouWAxXekOEIHevnItcQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hFj73c_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hFj73c_1b/HugV6-->penerapan nilai <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah online, serta memproduksi konten dakwah positif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media sosial berfungsi ganda sebagai objek kajian etika sekaligus sarana praktik langsung komunikasi islami di ruang digital</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) memberikan pengalaman nyata bagi siswa untuk </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"scMksf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjijbPN0ouWAxULgeEIHQeIPY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf scMksf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb scMksf_j/HugV6-->memahami <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (meneliti kebenaran berita), menjaga lisan, serta menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan hoaks di dunia maya sesuai ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hZqKWb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiEwfzl0ouWAxVNgeEIHROqGpkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hZqKWb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hZqKWb_j/HugV6-->pemahaman pentingnya etika Islam saat bermedia sosial, introspeksi diri terhadap jejak digital, serta komitmen menyebarkan kebaikan dan menghindari hoaks sesuai ajaran Al-Qur\'an dan Sunnah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 09:05:55','2026-08-06 09:05:55'),
(119,7,1,NULL,25,NULL,'adab menggunakan media sosial','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) materi </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dalam mata pelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) Fase F (umumnya pada tingkat SMA/SMK Kelas 12 atau Fase F) <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"unn6qd_1d\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf unn6qd_1c/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb unn6qd_1c/HugV6-->berfokus pada elemen <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Akhlak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Peserta didik diharapkan mampu menganalisis dan membiasakan etika digital sesuai ajaran Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/CP-ATP-PAI-FASE-F_KELAS-12.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://sdkrambilsawitsaptosari.pendidikan.gunungkidulkab.go.id/file?path=media%2Fsdkrambilsawitsaptosari_1719212819968_cppaibpsdrevisi24.pdf\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/994408931/LKPD-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial-1\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA8QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berikut adalah rincian capaian pembelajaran dan substansi materi tersebut:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Inti Capaian Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami Konsep<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu menganalisis adab dan etika menggunakan media sosial berdasarkan ajaran Islam.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menganalisis Dampak<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik mampu mengevaluasi dampak positif dan negatif penggunaan media sosial bagi individu dan masyarakat.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiFr4fJ0YuWAxXYDy4FHa5MD2AQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penerapan Sikap<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Peserta didik meyakini bahwa adab digital mendatangkan keselamatan serta terbiasa bersikap jujur, santun, dan bertanggung jawab di dunia maya</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Tujuan pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) adalah </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"XlpZGd_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiV-8nf0YuWAxWVkeEIHaHEG98QuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf XlpZGd_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb XlpZGd_j/HugV6-->agar siswa mampu menjelaskan etika digital Islam, menganalisis dalil naqli, menyaring informasi (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>), serta membiasakan perilaku santun, jujur, dan bertanggung jawab saat berinteraksi di ruang digital</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 berbasis media sosial dapat dilakukan dengan memanfaatkan platform seperti </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"OLCsce_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj9nNLr0YuWAxWrkeEIHbdSOqQQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf OLCsce_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb OLCsce_j/HugV6-->YouTube untuk bedah video ceramah materi iman kepada hari akhir, Instagram untuk infografis hukum Islam atau tajuk keteladanan tokoh Islam, serta WhatsApp untuk diskusi kelompok interaktif dan pengumpulan tugas</mark></p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial dalam Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) dirancang untuk membentuk kesadaran etika digital peserta didik</span>. Materi ini <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"iDo3ld_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwinua7-0YuWAxUtieEIHZ17EFsQuJAPegoIAggACAAIERAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf iDo3ld_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb iDo3ld_1b/HugV6-->mencakup prinsip <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring sebelum sharing), menghindari hoaks, ujaran kebencian, serta pemanfaatan platform digital untuk menyebarkan kebaikan berdasarkan ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Catatan: Materi \"Adab Menggunakan Media Sosial\" dalam kurikulum PAI umumnya diajarkan pada tingkat Kelas 11 (Kurikulum Merdeka)</span>, bukan Kelas 12. Sumber belajar utama mencakup <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"qvldJd_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQuJAPegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf qvldJd_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb qvldJd_1b/HugV6-->Buku Paket PAI Kelas 11, Modul Ajar Kurikulum Merdeka, materi presentasi (PPT), serta video pembelajaran daring<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/883967870/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">5</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Materi inti pembelajaran ini merujuk pada pedoman <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[17]}]],17,null,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam&quot;,&quot;Adab Dalam Bermedia Sosial Menurut Pandangan Islam * Mencari informasi yang bermanfaat. ... * Tabayyun. ... * Tidak menebarkan kebencian dan berita palsu. ... * Menjaga lisan dan kata-kata dalam berucap. ... * Jadikan media sosial sebagai sarana menyebarkan kebaikan.&quot;,null,&quot;Perpustakaan UMY&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://library.umy.ac.id\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,18]]],null,&quot;767efeb6-da31-4dd9-83d8-ba456595f955&quot;]]--></span> dan dapat diakses melalui berbagai sarana berikut. [<a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBUQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Jenis Sumber Belajar PAI<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Buku Teks Utama<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Buku Paket Pendidikan Agama Islam dan Budi Pekerti Kelas XI (Bab tentang Adab Bermedia Sosial).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Modul Ajar / RPP<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Dokumen perangkat pembelajaran guru seperti <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">Modul Ajar Adab Bersosial Media di Scribd</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Adab Bersosial Media dalam Islam | PDF - Scribd&quot;,&quot;Pembelajaran mencakup pemahaman etika digital, dampak media sosial, dan pembuatan konten positif, menggunakan metode Project-Based Learning dan berbagai alat ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcT63gNEI1itFGD5sgF7QAqzSVSplMlqY1vUhPlDG9hA88al5sgT536STmLAf13bjXKOs3XtrLX97c33aLU&quot;,&quot;Scribd&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://id.scribd.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,23]]],null,&quot;0c92cb92-8a6f-41ca-a68f-5ea9f21b2595&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAG\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Slide Presentasi (PPT)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Ringkasan visual materi bab adab digital di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAI\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">SlideShare Bab Adab Media Sosial</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;ppt-bab-8-adab-menggunakan-media-sosial.pdf - Slideshare&quot;,&quot;Materi ini mencakup pengertian adab, dalil naqli yang mendasari, serta praktik baik seperti memilih teman yang baik, meneliti informasi, dan menyampaikan berita ...&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcTwzAPb0ufXfP_O1zleAEgGzXpRqWzKfN6qI8ujS7M2UIUyNdDqiqDDWzBsk6d4rVNc-7HTmkTSaHKbIyY&quot;,&quot;Slideshare&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.slideshare.net\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,24]]],null,&quot;4fd1c730-4eeb-46a2-97c5-3c76fc3f48e6&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIFhAJ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Video Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Penjelasan ringkas konsep etika dan adab di <span class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQy_kOegoIAggACAAIFhAL\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQCw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\">YouTube Rangkuman Materi PAI</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dNJyvPq-3z6I&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[16]}]],16,null,&quot;Rangkuman Materi PAI Kelas 11 Bab 8 Kurikulum Merdeka&quot;,&quot;Penerapan karakter dalam adab bermedia sosial mencakup saling menghormati dan menghargai antar pengguna media sosial. Selain itu, penting untuk menggunakan bahasa yang santun dan tidak menyinggung perasaan orang lain. Menghindari menyebarkan berita buruk sangka, mencari-cari kesalahan orang lain, dan bergosip juga merupakan bagian dari penerapan karakter ini. Pengguna media sosial sebaiknya menggunakan platform ini untuk hal-hal yang bermanfaat dan menghindari memproduksi atau menyebarkan berita bohong serta ujaran kebencian.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcQT7aBcazTcql0pdA1OS2OrZT6YQizYatcHcqXsgZSODeENMyX_oIzR_Vw1wGxKYXuwxwLMSCHI5o5VeWQ&quot;,&quot;YouTube&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.youtube.com\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1786007094076771,86914358,4095719859],null,null,null,null,[[2,0,0,25]]],null,&quot;be2ba893-0155-4017-81f0-6195f8a90a05&quot;]]--></span>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.belajarpai.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/BAB-8_Adab-Menggunakan-Media-Sosial_BS-11.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/870706461/Modul-Ajar-Adab-Bersosial-Media-DeepLearning-3\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/pptbab8adabmenggunakanmediasosialpdf/267553263\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJyvPq-3z6I&amp;t=236\">4</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIFhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBYQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjjyqLz0ouWAxU2NS4FHbO5H_QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGhAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Penilaian pembelajaran materi adab menggunakan media sosial pada mata pelajaran PAI kelas 12 </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"IhtiKf_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjnr96D04uWAxW2ieEIHWmVHJwQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf IhtiKf_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb IhtiKf_1b/HugV6-->mencakup tiga ranah utama: <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">sikap (afektif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui lembar pengamatan perilaku digital, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">pengetahuan (kognitif)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> lewat tes tertulis analisis dalil dan konsep <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">keterampilan (psikomotorik)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> melalui praktik membuat konten dakwah atau kampanye etika bermedia sosial</mark></p>','3 X 45 Menit','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Praktik pedagogis pembelajaran adab bermedia sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"FRdaHc_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjj_7SX0ouWAxXlj-EIHYiZNjkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf FRdaHc_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb FRdaHc_1b/HugV6-->menerapkan pendekatan kontekstual dan berbasis projek<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Guru menggunakan model <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Project-Based Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, di mana siswa menganalisis konten digital secara kritis, melakukan <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, serta mempraktikkan pembuatan konten dakwah yang santun di platform digital nyata</p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA4QAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Lingkungan pembelajaran materi PAI kelas 12 tentang </span><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">adab menggunakan media sosial<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"uNeLkc_91\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf uNeLkc_90/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb uNeLkc_90/HugV6-->memadukan suasana kelas fisik dan ruang digital secara interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Pembelajaran ini berfokus pada penerapan etika Islam seperti <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (mengecek kebenaran berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah, serta menjadikan media sosial sebagai sarana dakwah dan penyebar kebaikan. [<a href=\"https://perpustakaan.uad.ac.id/adab-bersosial-media-dalam-pandangan-islam/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://ejournal.yayasanpendidikandzurriyatulquran.id/index.php/ihsan/article/view/942\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://library.umy.ac.id/adab-dalam-bermedia-sosial-menurut-pandangan-islam/\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Karakteristik Lingkungan Pembelajaran<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Kombinasi Blended Learning<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggabungkan diskusi tatap muka di kelas dengan penugasan praktik langsung di platform digital nyata.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Iklim Kolaboratif &amp; Reflektif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Siswa diajak menganalisis kasus nyata pelanggaran etika digital yang sering terjadi di dunia maya.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjgxdWn0ouWAxVrluEIHaDsCDQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBAQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Berpusat pada Siswa (Student-Centered)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Menggunakan metode berbasis proyek seperti pembuatan konten positif atau kampanye antikebencian (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">hoax<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>).</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pemanfaatan digital pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hFj73c_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwilxrG80ouWAxXekOEIHevnItcQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hFj73c_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hFj73c_1b/HugV6-->penerapan nilai <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (saring berita), menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> atau fitnah online, serta memproduksi konten dakwah positif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Media sosial berfungsi ganda sebagai objek kajian etika sekaligus sarana praktik langsung komunikasi islami di ruang digital</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) memberikan pengalaman nyata bagi siswa untuk </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"scMksf_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjijbPN0ouWAxULgeEIHQeIPY4QuJAPegoIAggACAAIBxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf scMksf_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb scMksf_j/HugV6-->memahami <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">tabayyun<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (meneliti kebenaran berita), menjaga lisan, serta menghindari <em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ghibah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> dan hoaks di dunia maya sesuai ajaran Islam</mark></p>','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAQQAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Refleksi pembelajaran adab menggunakan media sosial pada materi PAI kelas 12 mencakup </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"hZqKWb_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiEwfzl0ouWAxVNgeEIHROqGpkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIBBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf hZqKWb_j/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb hZqKWb_j/HugV6-->pemahaman pentingnya etika Islam saat bermedia sosial, introspeksi diri terhadap jejak digital, serta komitmen menyebarkan kebaikan dan menghindari hoaks sesuai ajaran Al-Qur\'an dan Sunnah<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 09:05:55','2026-08-06 09:05:55'),
(120,43,21,NULL,1,NULL,'Modul Ajar',NULL,'<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Murid mampu mengidentifikasi karakteristik fisik bunyi (<em>timbre</em>, volume, durasi) dari berbagai objek lingkungan sekitar secara cermat, serta terampil mengombinasikan dan memodifikasikannya menjadi karya komposisi musik eksperimental kelompok yang harmonis, kreatif, dan estetik.</span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Model:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> <em>Project-Based Learning</em> (PjBL) terintegrasi Inkuiri Auditif.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Metode:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Eksplorasi mandiri, diskusi kelompok terpumpun (<em>FGD</em>), unjuk kerja pertunjukan, dan <em>peer-review</em>.</span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Media:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Laptop, proyektor, speaker, video sampel perkusi barang bekas, aplikasi <em>Sound Analyzer</em>.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Alat/Bahan:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Smartphone (perekam suara), lembar kerja (LKPD), benda lingkungan (botol, kaleng, penggaris, ember).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Lingkungan Belajar:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Ruang kelas mandiri (formasi U-Shape) dan area luar kelas (halaman sekolah</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">/ruang tari)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">.</span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Kemendikbudristek. (2022). <em>Buku Panduan Guru Seni Musik untuk SMA/SMK Kelas X</em>. Jakarta: Pusat Perbukuan, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Campbell, P. S. (2010). <em>Music in Cultural Context</em>. Reston: MENC.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Rubrik Penilaian Performa Kelompok: Eksplorasi Bunyi</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Mata Pelajaran<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> Seni Musik<br><strong>Materi<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 3;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>:</strong> Eksplorasi Bunyi dalam Musik<br><strong>Fase / Kelas<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 2;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>:</strong> E / Kelas X</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">A. Tabel Kriteria Penilaian</span></strong></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Aspek Penilaian</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Mahir (Skor 4)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Cakap (Skor 3)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Layak (Skor 2)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Baru Berkembang (Skor 1)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Kreativitas Eksplorasi Sumber Bunyi</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Menemukan &gt;3 benda non-konvensional dengan <strong>variasi timbre yang sangat kontras</strong> dan unik.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Menemukan 3 benda non-konvensional dengan <strong>variasi timbre yang cukup berbeda</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Menemukan 2-3 benda namun <strong>karakter timbrenya hampir seragam/sama</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Hanya menemukan 1 benda atau benda yang digunakan <strong>kurang variatif</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Struktur Pola Ritme (Komposisi)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme dalam birama 4/4 <strong>sangat variatif</strong>, mengalir baik, dan estetis.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme dalam birama 4/4 <strong>jelas strukturnya</strong> namun cenderung monoton.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme <strong>kurang konsisten</strong> dalam hitungan birama 4/4.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme <strong>tidak terbentuk</strong> atau tidak sesuai dengan aturan hitungan birama.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Teknik &amp; Kestabilan Tempo</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Memainkan pola bunyi secara berulang dengan <strong>tempo yang sangat stabil</strong> tanpa salah.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Memainkan pola bunyi dengan <strong>tempo cukup stabil</strong>, ada sedikit fluktuasi namun cepat kembali.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Tempo <strong>sering berubah-ubah</strong> (mempercepat/melambat) sehingga merusak pola.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Gagal menjaga tempo</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> dan ketukan sering terhenti di tengah jalan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Kerjasama &amp; Kekompakan Tim</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Semua anggota kelompok <strong>terlibat aktif</strong> dan saling mengisi suara dengan harmonis.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Mayoritas anggota terlibat aktif, suara antar benda <strong>cukup seimbang</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Hanya <strong>didominasi oleh 1-2 orang</strong> anggota kelompok saja.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Anggota kelompok <strong>berjalan sendiri-sendiri</strong> tanpa ada koordinasi bunyi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">B. Rumus Perhitungan Nilai Akhir (Skor Konversi 1-100)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">$$\\text{Nilai Akhir} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{Total Skor Perolehan}}{\\text{Skor Maksimal (16)}} \\right) \\times 100$$ </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Kategori Predikat:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'