tom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Siswa menguji coba teknik memukul, memetik, atau mengocok untuk menghasilkan variasi ketukan (<span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Eksperimen<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Ruang Kelas, Ruang Tari atau Lapangan Sekolah</p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: IN; mso-fareast-language: IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Smartphone</span>,<span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: IN; mso-fareast-language: IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">video sampel perkusi barang bekas</span></p>','<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: windowtext; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Mengapa suara ketukan penggaris besi di atas meja terdengar sangat berbeda dengan ketukan buku tulis?</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: windowtext; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Jika semua alat musik di dunia ini tiba-tiba hilang, bagaimana cara kalian membuat sebuah konser musik?</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: windowtext; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Perfoma Berbagi (Showcasing)Siswa menampilkan komposisi bunyi mereka di depan kelas, sementara kelompok lain bertindak sebagai audiens yang fokus mendengarkan.</span></li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 12:53:51','2026-08-06 12:53:51'),
(124,43,21,NULL,5,NULL,'Modul Ajar',NULL,'<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Murid mampu mengidentifikasi karakteristik fisik bunyi (<em>timbre</em>, volume, durasi) dari berbagai objek lingkungan sekitar secara cermat, serta terampil mengombinasikan dan memodifikasikannya menjadi karya komposisi musik eksperimental kelompok yang harmonis, kreatif, dan estetik.</span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Model:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> <em>Project-Based Learning</em> (PjBL) terintegrasi Inkuiri Auditif.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Metode:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Eksplorasi mandiri, diskusi kelompok terpumpun (<em>FGD</em>), unjuk kerja pertunjukan, dan <em>peer-review</em>.</span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Media:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Laptop, proyektor, speaker, video sampel perkusi barang bekas, aplikasi <em>Sound Analyzer</em>.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Alat/Bahan:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Smartphone (perekam suara), lembar kerja (LKPD), benda lingkungan (botol, kaleng, penggaris, ember).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Lingkungan Belajar:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\"> Ruang kelas mandiri (formasi U-Shape) dan area luar kelas (halaman sekolah</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">/ruang tari)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">.</span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Kemendikbudristek. (2022). <em>Buku Panduan Guru Seni Musik untuk SMA/SMK Kelas X</em>. Jakarta: Pusat Perbukuan, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Campbell, P. S. (2010). <em>Music in Cultural Context</em>. Reston: MENC.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Rubrik Penilaian Performa Kelompok: Eksplorasi Bunyi</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Mata Pelajaran<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> Seni Musik<br><strong>Materi<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 3;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>:</strong> Eksplorasi Bunyi dalam Musik<br><strong>Fase / Kelas<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 2;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>:</strong> E / Kelas X</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">A. Tabel Kriteria Penilaian</span></strong></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Aspek Penilaian</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Mahir (Skor 4)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Cakap (Skor 3)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Layak (Skor 2)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Baru Berkembang (Skor 1)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Kreativitas Eksplorasi Sumber Bunyi</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Menemukan &gt;3 benda non-konvensional dengan <strong>variasi timbre yang sangat kontras</strong> dan unik.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Menemukan 3 benda non-konvensional dengan <strong>variasi timbre yang cukup berbeda</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Menemukan 2-3 benda namun <strong>karakter timbrenya hampir seragam/sama</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Hanya menemukan 1 benda atau benda yang digunakan <strong>kurang variatif</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Struktur Pola Ritme (Komposisi)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme dalam birama 4/4 <strong>sangat variatif</strong>, mengalir baik, dan estetis.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme dalam birama 4/4 <strong>jelas strukturnya</strong> namun cenderung monoton.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme <strong>kurang konsisten</strong> dalam hitungan birama 4/4.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Pola ritme <strong>tidak terbentuk</strong> atau tidak sesuai dengan aturan hitungan birama.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Teknik &amp; Kestabilan Tempo</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Memainkan pola bunyi secara berulang dengan <strong>tempo yang sangat stabil</strong> tanpa salah.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Memainkan pola bunyi dengan <strong>tempo cukup stabil</strong>, ada sedikit fluktuasi namun cepat kembali.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Tempo <strong>sering berubah-ubah</strong> (mempercepat/melambat) sehingga merusak pola.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Gagal menjaga tempo</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> dan ketukan sering terhenti di tengah jalan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Kerjasama &amp; Kekompakan Tim</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Semua anggota kelompok <strong>terlibat aktif</strong> dan saling mengisi suara dengan harmonis.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Mayoritas anggota terlibat aktif, suara antar benda <strong>cukup seimbang</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Hanya <strong>didominasi oleh 1-2 orang</strong> anggota kelompok saja.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Anggota kelompok <strong>berjalan sendiri-sendiri</strong> tanpa ada koordinasi bunyi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">B. Rumus Perhitungan Nilai Akhir (Skor Konversi 1-100)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">$$\\text{Nilai Akhir} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{Total Skor Perolehan}}{\\text{Skor Maksimal (16)}} \\right) \\times 100$$ </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Kategori Predikat:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">86 - 100:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> Sangat Baik (A)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">71 - 85:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> Baik (B)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">56 - 70:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> Cukup (C)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">&lt; 55:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\"> Perlu Bimbingan (D)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">C. Lembar Penilaian Kelompok (Untuk Guru)</span></strong></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">No</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: IN;\">Nama Kelompok</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p c