opy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--><span class=\"iNqyIf\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Proses Mendalam:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwidleqBgIyWAxXQ8jgGHbmXIzwQ-7AUegYIAAgLEAY\" data-hveid=\"CAAICxAG\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAAICxAH\" data-sae=\"\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Siswa bereksperimen mengubah volume air di botol atau ketegangan karet di kardus untuk menghasilkan tinggi rendah nada berbeda (<span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Mengaplikasi<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\r\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAAICxAI\" data-sae=\"\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Siswa menguji coba teknik memukul, memetik, atau mengocok untuk menghasilkan variasi ketukan (<span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Eksperimen<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Ruang Kelas, Ruang Tari atau Lapangan Sekolah</p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: IN; mso-fareast-language: IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Smartphone</span>,<span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: IN; mso-fareast-language: IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">video sampel perkusi barang bekas</span></p>','<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: windowtext; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Mengapa suara ketukan penggaris besi di atas meja terdengar sangat berbeda dengan ketukan buku tulis?</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: windowtext; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Jika semua alat musik di dunia ini tiba-tiba hilang, bagaimana cara kalian membuat sebuah konser musik?</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: windowtext; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: IN;\">Perfoma Berbagi (Showcasing)Siswa menampilkan komposisi bunyi mereka di depan kelas, sementara kelompok lain bertindak sebagai audiens yang fokus mendengarkan.</span></li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-06 12:53:51','2026-08-06 12:53:51'),
(129,7,1,NULL,22,NULL,'Hakikat iman islam dan ikhsan','<p><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"ryYwab_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4vubQqY2WAxX_3zgGHeo5N50QuJAPegoIAggACAAICxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf ryYwab_1b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb ryYwab_1b/HugV6-->kemampuan peserta didik Menganalisis dan mengevaluasi makna, keterkaitan, serta penerapan ketiga pilar ajaran Islam tersebut dalam membentuk pribadi yang berakhlak mulia dan berkehidupan bermakna<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. [<a href=\"https://id.scribd.com/document/829942162/MATERI-PAI-BAB-2-KELAS-12\">1</a>]</p>','<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4vubQqY2WAxX_3zgGHeo5N50Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIFBAB\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Memahami dalil-dalil naqli dan aqli tentang hubungan iman, Islam, dan ihsan.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4vubQqY2WAxX_3zgGHeo5N50Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIFBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menyadari keterpaduan antara keyakinan hati, pelaksanaan syariat, dan keikhlasan amal.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi4vubQqY2WAxX_3zgGHeo5N50Qi4wTegoIAggACAAIFBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBQQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Menerapkan perilaku ihsan dalam kehidupan sehari-hari di masyarakat</span></div>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Metode pembelajaran untuk materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang hakikat iman, Islam, dan ihsan yang efektif meliputi </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"OJ53Bc_1q\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjL0-S2qo2WAxUDV2wGHWpwDzkQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\"><!--qkimaf OJ53Bc_1p/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb OJ53Bc_1p/HugV6-->metode <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">inkuiri<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">diskusi kelompok<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">ceramah interaktif<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, serta <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);\">proyek pengamatan perilaku nyata<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. Kombinasi ini membantu siswa memahami konsep akidah, syariat, dan tasawuf secara mendalam</p>','<p><span data-subtree=\"aimfl,mfl\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Media pembelajaran materi Pendidikan Agama Islam (PAI) kelas 12 tentang hakikat iman, Islam, dan ihsan dapat menggunakan </span><mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"ja9rff_k\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiAw-XIqo2WAxUuS3ADHbu_MowQuJAPegoIAggACAAICBAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; te