\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\"> modern.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">Penilaian</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">Formatif</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">Observasi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">Penilaian</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">sikap</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">saat</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">diskusi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">kelompok</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\"> (</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">kerjasama</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">keaktifan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">etika</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">berkomunikasi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">bernalar</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">kritis</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">).</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">Tugas</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\"> LKPD Digital</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">Penilaian</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">hasil</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">diskusi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">kelompok</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">pada</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">rancangan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\"> ide </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">IoT</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">analisis</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">layanan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\"> Cloud, </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">dan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">peta</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">konsep</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">keterkaitan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">teknologi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">Penilaian</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">Sumatif</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">Tes</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">tertulis</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\"> (</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">Pilihan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\"> Ganda &amp; </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">Uraian</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">atau</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">penugasan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">proyek</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\"> poster digital / </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">makalah</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">singkat</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">mengenai</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">topik</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">&quot;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">Peran</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">Teknologi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\"> Modern (</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">IoT</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">, Big Data, AI, Cloud) </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">dalam</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">Menyelesaikan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">Masalah</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\"> di </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">Masyarakat</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;\">&quot;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n','2026-08-07 01:56:02','2026-08-07 01:56:02'),
(138,50,16,NULL,14,NULL,'Suggestion and Offering','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Pada akhir fase F, peserta didik menggunakan bahasa Inggris untuk berkomunikasi dengan guru, teman sebaya, dan orang lain dalam berbagai situasi dan tujuan yang membutuhkan penalaran lebih tinggi, termasuk memberi dan merespons saran (suggestion) serta tawaran (offering) secara lisan dan tulisan sesuai konteks penggunaannya, dengan struktur teks dan unsur kebahasaan yang tepat.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Tujuan Pembelajaran (TP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion (saran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering (tawaran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan suggestion secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan offering serta responnya secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Peserta didik dapat mendemonstrasikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion and offering melalui role play secara percaya diri dan komunikatif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Diskusi kelompok, tanya jawab, role play, penugasan</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Kartu situasi (situation cards) untuk role play</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Papan tulis, spidol, alat tulis</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kementerian Pendidikan, Kebudayaan, Riset, dan Teknologi. Capaian Pembelajaran Bahasa Inggris Fase F. Jakarta: Kemendikbudristek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Buku Teks Bahasa Inggris SMA/SMK Kelas XI Kurikulum Merdeka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Azar, B.S. (2019). Understanding and Using English Grammar. Pearson Education.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Asesmen</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">a. Asesmen Diagnostik</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Dilakukan pada awal Pertemuan 1 melalui tanya jawab lisan untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran dan tawaran dalam bahasa Inggris.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">b. Asesmen Formatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1 &amp; 3: Hasil diskusi dan presentasi kelompok (LKPD).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Pertemuan 2 &amp; 4: Unjuk kerja/role play berpasangan atau kelompok (rubrik speaking).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kuis lisan singkat pada akhir Pertemuan 3.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">c. Asesmen Sumatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Dilaksanakan pada Pertemuan 4 berupa soal evaluasi tertulis (pilihan ganda dan esai) mencakup keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering (terlampir pada dokumen Soal Evaluasi).</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Rubrik Penilaian Keterampilan Berbicara (Role Play)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Aspek</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kriteria Penilaian</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Skor (1-4)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pengucapan (Pronunciation)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Ketepatan pelafalan kata dan intonasi</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kelancaran (Fluency)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kelancaran dalam berbicara tanpa jeda berlebihan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Ketepatan Struktur</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penggunaan struktur suggestion/offering yang tepat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kepercayaan Diri</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Sikap percaya diri saat tampil di depan kelas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Keterangan skor: 4 = Sangat Baik, 3 = Baik, 2 = Cukup, 1 = Perlu Bimbingan. Nilai akhir = (Total skor / 16) x 100.</span></p>','4 Pertemuan x 3 JP x 45 menit (120 menit/pertemuan)','<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1: Mengenal Ungkapan Suggestion (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru melakukan presensi dan asesmen diagnostik singkat (tanya jawab lisan) untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan cakupan materi dan teknik penilaian.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menayangkan slide PPT berisi cuplikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion (contoh: \'You should exercise regularly.\', \'Why don\'t you see a doctor?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik dibagi ke dalam kelompok kecil (4-5 orang) untuk mengamati dan mendiskusikan fungsi sosial serta struktur kalimat pada dialog tersebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi pola kalimat suggestion (should/shouldn\'t, why don\'t you, how about, let\'s, I suggest, if I were you) dari beberapa contoh teks/dialog pada LKPD Pertemuan 1.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Setiap kelompok menuliskan hasil identifikasi struktur dan contoh kalimat suggestion pada LKPD.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Perwakilan kelompok mempresentasikan hasil diskusi; kelompok lain menanggapi; guru memberikan penguatan dan koreksi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik bersama guru menyimpulkan struktur dan fungsi sosial ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik (formatif) dan refleksi singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran pertemuan berikutnya (latihan produksi ungkapan suggestion).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 2: Berlatih Menggunakan Ungkapan Suggestion (Keterampilan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik menyusun, mengucapkan, dan merespons ungkapan suggestion sesuai konteks melalui latihan lisan dan tulisan.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa serta presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview materi pertemuan sebelumnya melalui tanya jawab singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru membagikan kartu situasi (situation cards) berisi berbagai masalah sehari-hari (contoh: teman sakit, nilai turun, ingin diet sehat).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Secara berpasangan, peserta didik menyusun ungkapan suggestion beserta respons yang sesuai untuk setiap situasi pada LKPD Pertemuan 2.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik berlatih mengucapkan dialog yang telah disusun dengan pelafalan dan intonasi yang tepat (drilling terbimbing oleh guru).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Beberapa pasangan tampil mempraktikkan dialog singkat di depan kelas secara bergiliran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik lain memberikan umpan balik terhadap penampilan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan penguatan terhadap kesalahan umum yang muncul.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik melakukan refleksi pembelajaran (apa yang sudah dikuasai dan yang masih sulit).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran offering pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 3: Mengenal Ungkapan Offering (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mengaitkan materi suggestion dengan materi offering melalui pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menampilkan video/audio pendek atau dialog tertulis yang memuat ungkapan offering (contoh: \'Would you like some tea?\', \'Shall I open the window?\', \'Can I help you?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik berdiskusi dalam kelompok mengidentifikasi struktur kalimat offering dan responnya (menerima/menolak tawaran dengan sopan).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Kelompok mengerjakan LKPD Pertemuan 3 untuk mengklasifikasikan ungkapan offering formal dan informal beserta responnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Kelompok menyusun tabel perbandingan struktur suggestion vs offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Presentasi hasil diskusi kelompok dan penguatan konsep oleh guru.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik menyimpulkan perbedaan dan persamaan suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan kuis lisan singkat sebagai asesmen formatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana praktik dan evaluasi pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Pertemuan 4: Praktik Terpadu dan Evaluasi Suggestion and Offering</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mendemonstrasikan penggunaan ungkapan suggestion and offering secara terpadu melalui role play dan mengerjakan evaluasi sumatif.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering melalui permainan tanya-jawab cepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan mekanisme penilaian hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Peserta didik berkelompok (3-4 orang) menyusun dialog pendek yang memadukan ungkapan suggestion dan offering berdasarkan tema yang dipilih (LKPD Pertemuan 4), misalnya: merencanakan acara kelas, membantu teman yang sakit, atau melayani tamu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setiap kelompok berlatih dan mendemonstrasikan role play dialog di depan kelas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menilai penampilan menggunakan rubrik penilaian keterampilan berbicara (speaking).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setelah seluruh kelompok tampil, peserta didik mengerjakan soal evaluasi sumatif (tertulis) secara individu yang mencakup pilihan ganda dan esai tentang suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru bersama peserta didik menyimpulkan seluruh materi suggestion and offering.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik terhadap hasil evaluasi dan penampilan role play.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tindak lanjut (remedial/pengayaan) berdasarkan hasil evaluasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pembelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Lingkungan pembelajaran di kelas dan sekitarnya mendukung murid untuk belajar secara kondusif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, HP dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\">&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik reguler kelas XI, tanpa kesulitan belajar yang signifikan dalam memahami materi.</span></p>','<p>Siswa aktif dan antusias saat melakukan simulasi peran (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">role-play<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) menawarkan bantuan dan memberikan penawaran kepada siswa lainnya, serta meresponnya.</p>',NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 02:04:26','2026-08-07 02:04:26');
INSERT INTO `rencana_pembelajarans` VALUES
(139,50,16,NULL,15,NULL,'Suggestion and Offering','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Pada akhir fase F, peserta didik menggunakan bahasa Inggris untuk berkomunikasi dengan guru, teman sebaya, dan orang lain dalam berbagai situasi dan tujuan yang membutuhkan penalaran lebih tinggi, termasuk memberi dan merespons saran (suggestion) serta tawaran (offering) secara lisan dan tulisan sesuai konteks penggunaannya, dengan struktur teks dan unsur kebahasaan yang tepat.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Tujuan Pembelajaran (TP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion (saran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering (tawaran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan suggestion secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan offering serta responnya secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Peserta didik dapat mendemonstrasikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion and offering melalui role play secara percaya diri dan komunikatif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Diskusi kelompok, tanya jawab, role play, penugasan</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Kartu situasi (situation cards) untuk role play</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Papan tulis, spidol, alat tulis</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kementerian Pendidikan, Kebudayaan, Riset, dan Teknologi. Capaian Pembelajaran Bahasa Inggris Fase F. Jakarta: Kemendikbudristek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Buku Teks Bahasa Inggris SMA/SMK Kelas XI Kurikulum Merdeka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Azar, B.S. (2019). Understanding and Using English Grammar. Pearson Education.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Asesmen</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">a. Asesmen Diagnostik</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Dilakukan pada awal Pertemuan 1 melalui tanya jawab lisan untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran dan tawaran dalam bahasa Inggris.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">b. Asesmen Formatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1 &amp; 3: Hasil diskusi dan presentasi kelompok (LKPD).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Pertemuan 2 &amp; 4: Unjuk kerja/role play berpasangan atau kelompok (rubrik speaking).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kuis lisan singkat pada akhir Pertemuan 3.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">c. Asesmen Sumatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Dilaksanakan pada Pertemuan 4 berupa soal evaluasi tertulis (pilihan ganda dan esai) mencakup keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering (terlampir pada dokumen Soal Evaluasi).</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Rubrik Penilaian Keterampilan Berbicara (Role Play)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Aspek</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kriteria Penilaian</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Skor (1-4)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pengucapan (Pronunciation)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Ketepatan pelafalan kata dan intonasi</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kelancaran (Fluency)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kelancaran dalam berbicara tanpa jeda berlebihan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Ketepatan Struktur</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penggunaan struktur suggestion/offering yang tepat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kepercayaan Diri</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Sikap percaya diri saat tampil di depan kelas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Keterangan skor: 4 = Sangat Baik, 3 = Baik, 2 = Cukup, 1 = Perlu Bimbingan. Nilai akhir = (Total skor / 16) x 100.</span></p>','4 Pertemuan x 3 JP x 45 menit (120 menit/pertemuan)','<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1: Mengenal Ungkapan Suggestion (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru melakukan presensi dan asesmen diagnostik singkat (tanya jawab lisan) untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan cakupan materi dan teknik penilaian.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menayangkan slide PPT berisi cuplikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion (contoh: \'You should exercise regularly.\', \'Why don\'t you see a doctor?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik dibagi ke dalam kelompok kecil (4-5 orang) untuk mengamati dan mendiskusikan fungsi sosial serta struktur kalimat pada dialog tersebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi pola kalimat suggestion (should/shouldn\'t, why don\'t you, how about, let\'s, I suggest, if I were you) dari beberapa contoh teks/dialog pada LKPD Pertemuan 1.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Setiap kelompok menuliskan hasil identifikasi struktur dan contoh kalimat suggestion pada LKPD.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Perwakilan kelompok mempresentasikan hasil diskusi; kelompok lain menanggapi; guru memberikan penguatan dan koreksi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik bersama guru menyimpulkan struktur dan fungsi sosial ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik (formatif) dan refleksi singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran pertemuan berikutnya (latihan produksi ungkapan suggestion).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 2: Berlatih Menggunakan Ungkapan Suggestion (Keterampilan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik menyusun, mengucapkan, dan merespons ungkapan suggestion sesuai konteks melalui latihan lisan dan tulisan.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa serta presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview materi pertemuan sebelumnya melalui tanya jawab singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru membagikan kartu situasi (situation cards) berisi berbagai masalah sehari-hari (contoh: teman sakit, nilai turun, ingin diet sehat).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Secara berpasangan, peserta didik menyusun ungkapan suggestion beserta respons yang sesuai untuk setiap situasi pada LKPD Pertemuan 2.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik berlatih mengucapkan dialog yang telah disusun dengan pelafalan dan intonasi yang tepat (drilling terbimbing oleh guru).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Beberapa pasangan tampil mempraktikkan dialog singkat di depan kelas secara bergiliran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik lain memberikan umpan balik terhadap penampilan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan penguatan terhadap kesalahan umum yang muncul.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik melakukan refleksi pembelajaran (apa yang sudah dikuasai dan yang masih sulit).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran offering pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 3: Mengenal Ungkapan Offering (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mengaitkan materi suggestion dengan materi offering melalui pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menampilkan video/audio pendek atau dialog tertulis yang memuat ungkapan offering (contoh: \'Would you like some tea?\', \'Shall I open the window?\', \'Can I help you?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik berdiskusi dalam kelompok mengidentifikasi struktur kalimat offering dan responnya (menerima/menolak tawaran dengan sopan).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Kelompok mengerjakan LKPD Pertemuan 3 untuk mengklasifikasikan ungkapan offering formal dan informal beserta responnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Kelompok menyusun tabel perbandingan struktur suggestion vs offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Presentasi hasil diskusi kelompok dan penguatan konsep oleh guru.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik menyimpulkan perbedaan dan persamaan suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan kuis lisan singkat sebagai asesmen formatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana praktik dan evaluasi pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Pertemuan 4: Praktik Terpadu dan Evaluasi Suggestion and Offering</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mendemonstrasikan penggunaan ungkapan suggestion and offering secara terpadu melalui role play dan mengerjakan evaluasi sumatif.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering melalui permainan tanya-jawab cepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan mekanisme penilaian hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Peserta didik berkelompok (3-4 orang) menyusun dialog pendek yang memadukan ungkapan suggestion dan offering berdasarkan tema yang dipilih (LKPD Pertemuan 4), misalnya: merencanakan acara kelas, membantu teman yang sakit, atau melayani tamu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setiap kelompok berlatih dan mendemonstrasikan role play dialog di depan kelas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menilai penampilan menggunakan rubrik penilaian keterampilan berbicara (speaking).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setelah seluruh kelompok tampil, peserta didik mengerjakan soal evaluasi sumatif (tertulis) secara individu yang mencakup pilihan ganda dan esai tentang suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru bersama peserta didik menyimpulkan seluruh materi suggestion and offering.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik terhadap hasil evaluasi dan penampilan role play.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tindak lanjut (remedial/pengayaan) berdasarkan hasil evaluasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pembelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Lingkungan pembelajaran di kelas dan sekitarnya mendukung murid untuk belajar secara kondusif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, HP dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\">&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik reguler kelas XI, tanpa kesulitan belajar yang signifikan dalam memahami materi.</span></p>','<p>Siswa aktif dan antusias saat melakukan simulasi peran (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">role-play<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) menawarkan bantuan dan memberikan penawaran kepada siswa lainnya, serta meresponnya.</p>',NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 02:04:26','2026-08-07 02:04:26'),
(140,50,16,NULL,16,NULL,'Suggestion and Offering','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Pada akhir fase F, peserta didik menggunakan bahasa Inggris untuk berkomunikasi dengan guru, teman sebaya, dan orang lain dalam berbagai situasi dan tujuan yang membutuhkan penalaran lebih tinggi, termasuk memberi dan merespons saran (suggestion) serta tawaran (offering) secara lisan dan tulisan sesuai konteks penggunaannya, dengan struktur teks dan unsur kebahasaan yang tepat.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Tujuan Pembelajaran (TP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion (saran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering (tawaran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan suggestion secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan offering serta responnya secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Peserta didik dapat mendemonstrasikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion and offering melalui role play secara percaya diri dan komunikatif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Diskusi kelompok, tanya jawab, role play, penugasan</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Kartu situasi (situation cards) untuk role play</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Papan tulis, spidol, alat tulis</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kementerian Pendidikan, Kebudayaan, Riset, dan Teknologi. Capaian Pembelajaran Bahasa Inggris Fase F. Jakarta: Kemendikbudristek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Buku Teks Bahasa Inggris SMA/SMK Kelas XI Kurikulum Merdeka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Azar, B.S. (2019). Understanding and Using English Grammar. Pearson Education.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Asesmen</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">a. Asesmen Diagnostik</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Dilakukan pada awal Pertemuan 1 melalui tanya jawab lisan untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran dan tawaran dalam bahasa Inggris.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">b. Asesmen Formatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1 &amp; 3: Hasil diskusi dan presentasi kelompok (LKPD).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Pertemuan 2 &amp; 4: Unjuk kerja/role play berpasangan atau kelompok (rubrik speaking).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kuis lisan singkat pada akhir Pertemuan 3.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">c. Asesmen Sumatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Dilaksanakan pada Pertemuan 4 berupa soal evaluasi tertulis (pilihan ganda dan esai) mencakup keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering (terlampir pada dokumen Soal Evaluasi).</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Rubrik Penilaian Keterampilan Berbicara (Role Play)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Aspek</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kriteria Penilaian</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Skor (1-4)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pengucapan (Pronunciation)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Ketepatan pelafalan kata dan intonasi</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kelancaran (Fluency)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kelancaran dalam berbicara tanpa jeda berlebihan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Ketepatan Struktur</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penggunaan struktur suggestion/offering yang tepat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kepercayaan Diri</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Sikap percaya diri saat tampil di depan kelas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Keterangan skor: 4 = Sangat Baik, 3 = Baik, 2 = Cukup, 1 = Perlu Bimbingan. Nilai akhir = (Total skor / 16) x 100.</span></p>','4 Pertemuan x 3 JP x 45 menit (120 menit/pertemuan)','<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1: Mengenal Ungkapan Suggestion (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru melakukan presensi dan asesmen diagnostik singkat (tanya jawab lisan) untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan cakupan materi dan teknik penilaian.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menayangkan slide PPT berisi cuplikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion (contoh: \'You should exercise regularly.\', \'Why don\'t you see a doctor?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik dibagi ke dalam kelompok kecil (4-5 orang) untuk mengamati dan mendiskusikan fungsi sosial serta struktur kalimat pada dialog tersebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi pola kalimat suggestion (should/shouldn\'t, why don\'t you, how about, let\'s, I suggest, if I were you) dari beberapa contoh teks/dialog pada LKPD Pertemuan 1.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Setiap kelompok menuliskan hasil identifikasi struktur dan contoh kalimat suggestion pada LKPD.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Perwakilan kelompok mempresentasikan hasil diskusi; kelompok lain menanggapi; guru memberikan penguatan dan koreksi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik bersama guru menyimpulkan struktur dan fungsi sosial ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik (formatif) dan refleksi singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran pertemuan berikutnya (latihan produksi ungkapan suggestion).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 2: Berlatih Menggunakan Ungkapan Suggestion (Keterampilan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik menyusun, mengucapkan, dan merespons ungkapan suggestion sesuai konteks melalui latihan lisan dan tulisan.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa serta presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview materi pertemuan sebelumnya melalui tanya jawab singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru membagikan kartu situasi (situation cards) berisi berbagai masalah sehari-hari (contoh: teman sakit, nilai turun, ingin diet sehat).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Secara berpasangan, peserta didik menyusun ungkapan suggestion beserta respons yang sesuai untuk setiap situasi pada LKPD Pertemuan 2.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik berlatih mengucapkan dialog yang telah disusun dengan pelafalan dan intonasi yang tepat (drilling terbimbing oleh guru).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Beberapa pasangan tampil mempraktikkan dialog singkat di depan kelas secara bergiliran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik lain memberikan umpan balik terhadap penampilan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan penguatan terhadap kesalahan umum yang muncul.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik melakukan refleksi pembelajaran (apa yang sudah dikuasai dan yang masih sulit).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran offering pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 3: Mengenal Ungkapan Offering (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mengaitkan materi suggestion dengan materi offering melalui pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menampilkan video/audio pendek atau dialog tertulis yang memuat ungkapan offering (contoh: \'Would you like some tea?\', \'Shall I open the window?\', \'Can I help you?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik berdiskusi dalam kelompok mengidentifikasi struktur kalimat offering dan responnya (menerima/menolak tawaran dengan sopan).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Kelompok mengerjakan LKPD Pertemuan 3 untuk mengklasifikasikan ungkapan offering formal dan informal beserta responnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Kelompok menyusun tabel perbandingan struktur suggestion vs offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Presentasi hasil diskusi kelompok dan penguatan konsep oleh guru.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik menyimpulkan perbedaan dan persamaan suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan kuis lisan singkat sebagai asesmen formatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana praktik dan evaluasi pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Pertemuan 4: Praktik Terpadu dan Evaluasi Suggestion and Offering</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mendemonstrasikan penggunaan ungkapan suggestion and offering secara terpadu melalui role play dan mengerjakan evaluasi sumatif.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering melalui permainan tanya-jawab cepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan mekanisme penilaian hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Peserta didik berkelompok (3-4 orang) menyusun dialog pendek yang memadukan ungkapan suggestion dan offering berdasarkan tema yang dipilih (LKPD Pertemuan 4), misalnya: merencanakan acara kelas, membantu teman yang sakit, atau melayani tamu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setiap kelompok berlatih dan mendemonstrasikan role play dialog di depan kelas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menilai penampilan menggunakan rubrik penilaian keterampilan berbicara (speaking).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setelah seluruh kelompok tampil, peserta didik mengerjakan soal evaluasi sumatif (tertulis) secara individu yang mencakup pilihan ganda dan esai tentang suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru bersama peserta didik menyimpulkan seluruh materi suggestion and offering.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik terhadap hasil evaluasi dan penampilan role play.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tindak lanjut (remedial/pengayaan) berdasarkan hasil evaluasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pembelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Lingkungan pembelajaran di kelas dan sekitarnya mendukung murid untuk belajar secara kondusif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, HP dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\">&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik reguler kelas XI, tanpa kesulitan belajar yang signifikan dalam memahami materi.</span></p>','<p>Siswa aktif dan antusias saat melakukan simulasi peran (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">role-play<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) menawarkan bantuan dan memberikan penawaran kepada siswa lainnya, serta meresponnya.</p>',NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 02:04:26','2026-08-07 02:04:26'),
(141,50,16,NULL,17,NULL,'Suggestion and Offering','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Pada akhir fase F, peserta didik menggunakan bahasa Inggris untuk berkomunikasi dengan guru, teman sebaya, dan orang lain dalam berbagai situasi dan tujuan yang membutuhkan penalaran lebih tinggi, termasuk memberi dan merespons saran (suggestion) serta tawaran (offering) secara lisan dan tulisan sesuai konteks penggunaannya, dengan struktur teks dan unsur kebahasaan yang tepat.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Tujuan Pembelajaran (TP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion (saran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering (tawaran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan suggestion secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan offering serta responnya secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Peserta didik dapat mendemonstrasikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion and offering melalui role play secara percaya diri dan komunikatif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Diskusi kelompok, tanya jawab, role play, penugasan</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Kartu situasi (situation cards) untuk role play</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Papan tulis, spidol, alat tulis</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kementerian Pendidikan, Kebudayaan, Riset, dan Teknologi. Capaian Pembelajaran Bahasa Inggris Fase F. Jakarta: Kemendikbudristek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Buku Teks Bahasa Inggris SMA/SMK Kelas XI Kurikulum Merdeka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Azar, B.S. (2019). Understanding and Using English Grammar. Pearson Education.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Asesmen</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">a. Asesmen Diagnostik</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Dilakukan pada awal Pertemuan 1 melalui tanya jawab lisan untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran dan tawaran dalam bahasa Inggris.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">b. Asesmen Formatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1 &amp; 3: Hasil diskusi dan presentasi kelompok (LKPD).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Pertemuan 2 &amp; 4: Unjuk kerja/role play berpasangan atau kelompok (rubrik speaking).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kuis lisan singkat pada akhir Pertemuan 3.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">c. Asesmen Sumatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Dilaksanakan pada Pertemuan 4 berupa soal evaluasi tertulis (pilihan ganda dan esai) mencakup keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering (terlampir pada dokumen Soal Evaluasi).</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Rubrik Penilaian Keterampilan Berbicara (Role Play)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Aspek</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kriteria Penilaian</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Skor (1-4)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pengucapan (Pronunciation)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Ketepatan pelafalan kata dan intonasi</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kelancaran (Fluency)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kelancaran dalam berbicara tanpa jeda berlebihan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Ketepatan Struktur</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penggunaan struktur suggestion/offering yang tepat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kepercayaan Diri</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Sikap percaya diri saat tampil di depan kelas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Keterangan skor: 4 = Sangat Baik, 3 = Baik, 2 = Cukup, 1 = Perlu Bimbingan. Nilai akhir = (Total skor / 16) x 100.</span></p>','4 Pertemuan x 3 JP x 45 menit (120 menit/pertemuan)','<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1: Mengenal Ungkapan Suggestion (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru melakukan presensi dan asesmen diagnostik singkat (tanya jawab lisan) untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan cakupan materi dan teknik penilaian.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menayangkan slide PPT berisi cuplikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion (contoh: \'You should exercise regularly.\', \'Why don\'t you see a doctor?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik dibagi ke dalam kelompok kecil (4-5 orang) untuk mengamati dan mendiskusikan fungsi sosial serta struktur kalimat pada dialog tersebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi pola kalimat suggestion (should/shouldn\'t, why don\'t you, how about, let\'s, I suggest, if I were you) dari beberapa contoh teks/dialog pada LKPD Pertemuan 1.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Setiap kelompok menuliskan hasil identifikasi struktur dan contoh kalimat suggestion pada LKPD.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Perwakilan kelompok mempresentasikan hasil diskusi; kelompok lain menanggapi; guru memberikan penguatan dan koreksi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik bersama guru menyimpulkan struktur dan fungsi sosial ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik (formatif) dan refleksi singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran pertemuan berikutnya (latihan produksi ungkapan suggestion).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 2: Berlatih Menggunakan Ungkapan Suggestion (Keterampilan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik menyusun, mengucapkan, dan merespons ungkapan suggestion sesuai konteks melalui latihan lisan dan tulisan.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa serta presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview materi pertemuan sebelumnya melalui tanya jawab singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru membagikan kartu situasi (situation cards) berisi berbagai masalah sehari-hari (contoh: teman sakit, nilai turun, ingin diet sehat).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Secara berpasangan, peserta didik menyusun ungkapan suggestion beserta respons yang sesuai untuk setiap situasi pada LKPD Pertemuan 2.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik berlatih mengucapkan dialog yang telah disusun dengan pelafalan dan intonasi yang tepat (drilling terbimbing oleh guru).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Beberapa pasangan tampil mempraktikkan dialog singkat di depan kelas secara bergiliran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik lain memberikan umpan balik terhadap penampilan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan penguatan terhadap kesalahan umum yang muncul.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik melakukan refleksi pembelajaran (apa yang sudah dikuasai dan yang masih sulit).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran offering pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 3: Mengenal Ungkapan Offering (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mengaitkan materi suggestion dengan materi offering melalui pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menampilkan video/audio pendek atau dialog tertulis yang memuat ungkapan offering (contoh: \'Would you like some tea?\', \'Shall I open the window?\', \'Can I help you?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik berdiskusi dalam kelompok mengidentifikasi struktur kalimat offering dan responnya (menerima/menolak tawaran dengan sopan).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Kelompok mengerjakan LKPD Pertemuan 3 untuk mengklasifikasikan ungkapan offering formal dan informal beserta responnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Kelompok menyusun tabel perbandingan struktur suggestion vs offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Presentasi hasil diskusi kelompok dan penguatan konsep oleh guru.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik menyimpulkan perbedaan dan persamaan suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan kuis lisan singkat sebagai asesmen formatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana praktik dan evaluasi pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Pertemuan 4: Praktik Terpadu dan Evaluasi Suggestion and Offering</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mendemonstrasikan penggunaan ungkapan suggestion and offering secara terpadu melalui role play dan mengerjakan evaluasi sumatif.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering melalui permainan tanya-jawab cepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan mekanisme penilaian hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Peserta didik berkelompok (3-4 orang) menyusun dialog pendek yang memadukan ungkapan suggestion dan offering berdasarkan tema yang dipilih (LKPD Pertemuan 4), misalnya: merencanakan acara kelas, membantu teman yang sakit, atau melayani tamu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setiap kelompok berlatih dan mendemonstrasikan role play dialog di depan kelas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menilai penampilan menggunakan rubrik penilaian keterampilan berbicara (speaking).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setelah seluruh kelompok tampil, peserta didik mengerjakan soal evaluasi sumatif (tertulis) secara individu yang mencakup pilihan ganda dan esai tentang suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru bersama peserta didik menyimpulkan seluruh materi suggestion and offering.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik terhadap hasil evaluasi dan penampilan role play.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tindak lanjut (remedial/pengayaan) berdasarkan hasil evaluasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pembelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Lingkungan pembelajaran di kelas dan sekitarnya mendukung murid untuk belajar secara kondusif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, HP dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\">&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik reguler kelas XI, tanpa kesulitan belajar yang signifikan dalam memahami materi.</span></p>','<p>Siswa aktif dan antusias saat melakukan simulasi peran (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">role-play<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) menawarkan bantuan dan memberikan penawaran kepada siswa lainnya, serta meresponnya.</p>',NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 02:04:26','2026-08-07 02:04:26'),
(142,50,16,NULL,20,NULL,'Suggestion and Offering','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Pada akhir fase F, peserta didik menggunakan bahasa Inggris untuk berkomunikasi dengan guru, teman sebaya, dan orang lain dalam berbagai situasi dan tujuan yang membutuhkan penalaran lebih tinggi, termasuk memberi dan merespons saran (suggestion) serta tawaran (offering) secara lisan dan tulisan sesuai konteks penggunaannya, dengan struktur teks dan unsur kebahasaan yang tepat.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Tujuan Pembelajaran (TP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion (saran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering (tawaran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan suggestion secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan offering serta responnya secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Peserta didik dapat mendemonstrasikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion and offering melalui role play secara percaya diri dan komunikatif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Diskusi kelompok, tanya jawab, role play, penugasan</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Kartu situasi (situation cards) untuk role play</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Papan tulis, spidol, alat tulis</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kementerian Pendidikan, Kebudayaan, Riset, dan Teknologi. Capaian Pembelajaran Bahasa Inggris Fase F. Jakarta: Kemendikbudristek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Buku Teks Bahasa Inggris SMA/SMK Kelas XI Kurikulum Merdeka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Azar, B.S. (2019). Understanding and Using English Grammar. Pearson Education.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Asesmen</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">a. Asesmen Diagnostik</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Dilakukan pada awal Pertemuan 1 melalui tanya jawab lisan untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran dan tawaran dalam bahasa Inggris.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">b. Asesmen Formatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1 &amp; 3: Hasil diskusi dan presentasi kelompok (LKPD).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Pertemuan 2 &amp; 4: Unjuk kerja/role play berpasangan atau kelompok (rubrik speaking).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kuis lisan singkat pada akhir Pertemuan 3.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">c. Asesmen Sumatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Dilaksanakan pada Pertemuan 4 berupa soal evaluasi tertulis (pilihan ganda dan esai) mencakup keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering (terlampir pada dokumen Soal Evaluasi).</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Rubrik Penilaian Keterampilan Berbicara (Role Play)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Aspek</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kriteria Penilaian</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Skor (1-4)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pengucapan (Pronunciation)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Ketepatan pelafalan kata dan intonasi</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kelancaran (Fluency)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kelancaran dalam berbicara tanpa jeda berlebihan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Ketepatan Struktur</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penggunaan struktur suggestion/offering yang tepat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kepercayaan Diri</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Sikap percaya diri saat tampil di depan kelas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Keterangan skor: 4 = Sangat Baik, 3 = Baik, 2 = Cukup, 1 = Perlu Bimbingan. Nilai akhir = (Total skor / 16) x 100.</span></p>','4 Pertemuan x 3 JP x 45 menit (120 menit/pertemuan)','<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1: Mengenal Ungkapan Suggestion (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru melakukan presensi dan asesmen diagnostik singkat (tanya jawab lisan) untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan cakupan materi dan teknik penilaian.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menayangkan slide PPT berisi cuplikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion (contoh: \'You should exercise regularly.\', \'Why don\'t you see a doctor?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik dibagi ke dalam kelompok kecil (4-5 orang) untuk mengamati dan mendiskusikan fungsi sosial serta struktur kalimat pada dialog tersebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi pola kalimat suggestion (should/shouldn\'t, why don\'t you, how about, let\'s, I suggest, if I were you) dari beberapa contoh teks/dialog pada LKPD Pertemuan 1.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Setiap kelompok menuliskan hasil identifikasi struktur dan contoh kalimat suggestion pada LKPD.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Perwakilan kelompok mempresentasikan hasil diskusi; kelompok lain menanggapi; guru memberikan penguatan dan koreksi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik bersama guru menyimpulkan struktur dan fungsi sosial ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik (formatif) dan refleksi singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran pertemuan berikutnya (latihan produksi ungkapan suggestion).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 2: Berlatih Menggunakan Ungkapan Suggestion (Keterampilan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik menyusun, mengucapkan, dan merespons ungkapan suggestion sesuai konteks melalui latihan lisan dan tulisan.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa serta presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview materi pertemuan sebelumnya melalui tanya jawab singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru membagikan kartu situasi (situation cards) berisi berbagai masalah sehari-hari (contoh: teman sakit, nilai turun, ingin diet sehat).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Secara berpasangan, peserta didik menyusun ungkapan suggestion beserta respons yang sesuai untuk setiap situasi pada LKPD Pertemuan 2.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik berlatih mengucapkan dialog yang telah disusun dengan pelafalan dan intonasi yang tepat (drilling terbimbing oleh guru).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Beberapa pasangan tampil mempraktikkan dialog singkat di depan kelas secara bergiliran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik lain memberikan umpan balik terhadap penampilan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan penguatan terhadap kesalahan umum yang muncul.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik melakukan refleksi pembelajaran (apa yang sudah dikuasai dan yang masih sulit).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran offering pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 3: Mengenal Ungkapan Offering (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mengaitkan materi suggestion dengan materi offering melalui pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menampilkan video/audio pendek atau dialog tertulis yang memuat ungkapan offering (contoh: \'Would you like some tea?\', \'Shall I open the window?\', \'Can I help you?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik berdiskusi dalam kelompok mengidentifikasi struktur kalimat offering dan responnya (menerima/menolak tawaran dengan sopan).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Kelompok mengerjakan LKPD Pertemuan 3 untuk mengklasifikasikan ungkapan offering formal dan informal beserta responnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Kelompok menyusun tabel perbandingan struktur suggestion vs offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Presentasi hasil diskusi kelompok dan penguatan konsep oleh guru.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik menyimpulkan perbedaan dan persamaan suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan kuis lisan singkat sebagai asesmen formatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana praktik dan evaluasi pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Pertemuan 4: Praktik Terpadu dan Evaluasi Suggestion and Offering</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mendemonstrasikan penggunaan ungkapan suggestion and offering secara terpadu melalui role play dan mengerjakan evaluasi sumatif.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering melalui permainan tanya-jawab cepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan mekanisme penilaian hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Peserta didik berkelompok (3-4 orang) menyusun dialog pendek yang memadukan ungkapan suggestion dan offering berdasarkan tema yang dipilih (LKPD Pertemuan 4), misalnya: merencanakan acara kelas, membantu teman yang sakit, atau melayani tamu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setiap kelompok berlatih dan mendemonstrasikan role play dialog di depan kelas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menilai penampilan menggunakan rubrik penilaian keterampilan berbicara (speaking).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setelah seluruh kelompok tampil, peserta didik mengerjakan soal evaluasi sumatif (tertulis) secara individu yang mencakup pilihan ganda dan esai tentang suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru bersama peserta didik menyimpulkan seluruh materi suggestion and offering.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik terhadap hasil evaluasi dan penampilan role play.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tindak lanjut (remedial/pengayaan) berdasarkan hasil evaluasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pembelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Lingkungan pembelajaran di kelas dan sekitarnya mendukung murid untuk belajar secara kondusif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, HP dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\">&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik reguler kelas XI, tanpa kesulitan belajar yang signifikan dalam memahami materi.</span></p>','<p>Siswa aktif dan antusias saat melakukan simulasi peran (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">role-play<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) menawarkan bantuan dan memberikan penawaran kepada siswa lainnya, serta meresponnya.</p>',NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 02:04:26','2026-08-07 02:04:26'),
(143,50,16,NULL,21,NULL,'Suggestion and Offering','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Pada akhir fase F, peserta didik menggunakan bahasa Inggris untuk berkomunikasi dengan guru, teman sebaya, dan orang lain dalam berbagai situasi dan tujuan yang membutuhkan penalaran lebih tinggi, termasuk memberi dan merespons saran (suggestion) serta tawaran (offering) secara lisan dan tulisan sesuai konteks penggunaannya, dengan struktur teks dan unsur kebahasaan yang tepat.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Tujuan Pembelajaran (TP)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion (saran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering (tawaran) dalam berbagai konteks percakapan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan suggestion secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik dapat menyusun dan mengucapkan ungkapan offering serta responnya secara lisan maupun tertulis sesuai konteks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Peserta didik dapat mendemonstrasikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion and offering melalui role play secara percaya diri dan komunikatif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Diskusi kelompok, tanya jawab, role play, penugasan</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Kartu situasi (situation cards) untuk role play</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Papan tulis, spidol, alat tulis</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kementerian Pendidikan, Kebudayaan, Riset, dan Teknologi. Capaian Pembelajaran Bahasa Inggris Fase F. Jakarta: Kemendikbudristek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Buku Teks Bahasa Inggris SMA/SMK Kelas XI Kurikulum Merdeka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Azar, B.S. (2019). Understanding and Using English Grammar. Pearson Education.</p>','<h2 style=\"margin: 11.0pt 0cm 5.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1e2761;\">Asesmen</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">a. Asesmen Diagnostik</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Dilakukan pada awal Pertemuan 1 melalui tanya jawab lisan untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran dan tawaran dalam bahasa Inggris.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">b. Asesmen Formatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1 &amp; 3: Hasil diskusi dan presentasi kelompok (LKPD).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Pertemuan 2 &amp; 4: Unjuk kerja/role play berpasangan atau kelompok (rubrik speaking).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kuis lisan singkat pada akhir Pertemuan 3.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">c. Asesmen Sumatif</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Dilaksanakan pada Pertemuan 4 berupa soal evaluasi tertulis (pilihan ganda dan esai) mencakup keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering (terlampir pada dokumen Soal Evaluasi).</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Rubrik Penilaian Keterampilan Berbicara (Role Play)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Aspek</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kriteria Penilaian</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Skor (1-4)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pengucapan (Pronunciation)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Ketepatan pelafalan kata dan intonasi</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kelancaran (Fluency)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Kelancaran dalam berbicara tanpa jeda berlebihan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Ketepatan Struktur</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penggunaan struktur suggestion/offering yang tepat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Kepercayaan Diri</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Sikap percaya diri saat tampil di depan kelas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">1-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Keterangan skor: 4 = Sangat Baik, 3 = Baik, 2 = Cukup, 1 = Perlu Bimbingan. Nilai akhir = (Total skor / 16) x 100.</span></p>','4 Pertemuan x 3 JP x 45 menit (120 menit/pertemuan)','<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 1: Mengenal Ungkapan Suggestion (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru melakukan presensi dan asesmen diagnostik singkat (tanya jawab lisan) untuk mengetahui pemahaman awal peserta didik tentang ungkapan saran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan cakupan materi dan teknik penilaian.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menayangkan slide PPT berisi cuplikan dialog yang memuat ungkapan suggestion (contoh: \'You should exercise regularly.\', \'Why don\'t you see a doctor?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik dibagi ke dalam kelompok kecil (4-5 orang) untuk mengamati dan mendiskusikan fungsi sosial serta struktur kalimat pada dialog tersebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi pola kalimat suggestion (should/shouldn\'t, why don\'t you, how about, let\'s, I suggest, if I were you) dari beberapa contoh teks/dialog pada LKPD Pertemuan 1.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Setiap kelompok menuliskan hasil identifikasi struktur dan contoh kalimat suggestion pada LKPD.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Perwakilan kelompok mempresentasikan hasil diskusi; kelompok lain menanggapi; guru memberikan penguatan dan koreksi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik bersama guru menyimpulkan struktur dan fungsi sosial ungkapan suggestion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik (formatif) dan refleksi singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran pertemuan berikutnya (latihan produksi ungkapan suggestion).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 2: Berlatih Menggunakan Ungkapan Suggestion (Keterampilan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik menyusun, mengucapkan, dan merespons ungkapan suggestion sesuai konteks melalui latihan lisan dan tulisan.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam dan doa serta presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview materi pertemuan sebelumnya melalui tanya jawab singkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru membagikan kartu situasi (situation cards) berisi berbagai masalah sehari-hari (contoh: teman sakit, nilai turun, ingin diet sehat).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Secara berpasangan, peserta didik menyusun ungkapan suggestion beserta respons yang sesuai untuk setiap situasi pada LKPD Pertemuan 2.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik berlatih mengucapkan dialog yang telah disusun dengan pelafalan dan intonasi yang tepat (drilling terbimbing oleh guru).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Beberapa pasangan tampil mempraktikkan dialog singkat di depan kelas secara bergiliran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik lain memberikan umpan balik terhadap penampilan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan penguatan terhadap kesalahan umum yang muncul.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik melakukan refleksi pembelajaran (apa yang sudah dikuasai dan yang masih sulit).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana pembelajaran offering pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Pertemuan 3: Mengenal Ungkapan Offering (Pengetahuan)</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mengidentifikasi fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan ungkapan offering.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mengaitkan materi suggestion dengan materi offering melalui pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Orientasi masalah: Guru menampilkan video/audio pendek atau dialog tertulis yang memuat ungkapan offering (contoh: \'Would you like some tea?\', \'Shall I open the window?\', \'Can I help you?\').</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengorganisasi peserta didik: Peserta didik berdiskusi dalam kelompok mengidentifikasi struktur kalimat offering dan responnya (menerima/menolak tawaran dengan sopan).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Membimbing penyelidikan: Kelompok mengerjakan LKPD Pertemuan 3 untuk mengklasifikasikan ungkapan offering formal dan informal beserta responnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Mengembangkan hasil karya: Kelompok menyusun tabel perbandingan struktur suggestion vs offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Menganalisis &amp; mengevaluasi: Presentasi hasil diskusi kelompok dan penguatan konsep oleh guru.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru dan peserta didik menyimpulkan perbedaan dan persamaan suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru memberikan kuis lisan singkat sebagai asesmen formatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan rencana praktik dan evaluasi pada pertemuan berikutnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Pertemuan 4: Praktik Terpadu dan Evaluasi Suggestion and Offering</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\">Tujuan: Peserta didik mendemonstrasikan penggunaan ungkapan suggestion and offering secara terpadu melalui role play dan mengerjakan evaluasi sumatif.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 462.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"616\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tahap</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Kegiatan</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #CADCFC; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Waktu</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Pendahuluan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru membuka pelajaran dengan salam, doa, dan presensi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru mereview keseluruhan materi suggestion and offering melalui permainan tanya-jawab cepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran dan mekanisme penilaian hari ini.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Inti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(90 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Peserta didik berkelompok (3-4 orang) menyusun dialog pendek yang memadukan ungkapan suggestion dan offering berdasarkan tema yang dipilih (LKPD Pertemuan 4), misalnya: merencanakan acara kelas, membantu teman yang sakit, atau melayani tamu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setiap kelompok berlatih dan mendemonstrasikan role play dialog di depan kelas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menilai penampilan menggunakan rubrik penilaian keterampilan berbicara (speaking).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Setelah seluruh kelompok tampil, peserta didik mengerjakan soal evaluasi sumatif (tertulis) secara individu yang mencakup pilihan ganda dan esai tentang suggestion and offering.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">90\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"93\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Penutup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">(15 menit)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 332.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"443\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru bersama peserta didik menyimpulkan seluruh materi suggestion and offering.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">Guru memberikan umpan balik terhadap hasil evaluasi dan penampilan role play.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menyampaikan tindak lanjut (remedial/pengayaan) berdasarkan hasil evaluasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Guru menutup pembelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\">15\'</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Lingkungan pembelajaran di kelas dan sekitarnya mendukung murid untuk belajar secara kondusif.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Laptop, LCD proyektor, HP dan slide presentasi (PPT)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Jaringan internet (opsional, untuk video pendukung)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -13.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 3.0pt 22.5pt;\">&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt;\"><span lang=\"SV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: SV;\">Peserta didik reguler kelas XI, tanpa kesulitan belajar yang signifikan dalam memahami materi.</span></p>','<p>Siswa aktif dan antusias saat melakukan simulasi peran (<em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">role-play<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>) menawarkan bantuan dan memberikan penawaran kepada siswa lainnya, serta meresponnya.</p>',NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 02:04:26','2026-08-07 02:04:26'),
(158,19,4,NULL,1,NULL,'Eksponen','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pada akhir fase E (Kelas X), peserta didik dapat menggeneralisasi sifat-sifat eksponen dan logaritma, serta menggunakan barisan dan deret aritmetika dan geometri. Mereka dapat menerapkan barisan dan deret aritmetika dan geometri untuk menyelesaikan masalah kontekstual (termasuk pertumbuhan, peluruhan, bunga majemuk, dan anuitas).</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 1 (3 JP): Definisi Eksponen dan Sifat-Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 1)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi definisi eksponen dengan tepat setelah mengamati ilustrasi permasalahan pertumbuhan populasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menggunakan sifat-sifat perkalian dan pembagian eksponen dalam menyelesaikan soal-soal sederhana secara mandiri dengan teliti.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat membuktikan sifat-sifat eksponen (am&times;an=am+n dan am:an=am&minus;n) melalui diskusi kelompok.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 2 (3 JP): Sifat-Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 2) dan Eksponen Nol/Negatif</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menggunakan sifat-sifat eksponen lainnya (pangkat dari pangkat, pangkat dari perkalian/pembagian) dalam menyelesaikan soal-soal kompleks dengan cermat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menjelaskan makna eksponen nol dan eksponen negatif serta menggunakannya dalam perhitungan dengan tepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menganalisis kesalahan umum dalam perhitungan eksponen dan mengidentifikasi solusinya melalui studi kasus.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 3 (3 JP): Fungsi Eksponensial</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat memodelkan fenomena pertumbuhan dan peluruhan menggunakan fungsi eksponensial setelah melakukan eksplorasi data.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menggambar grafik fungsi eksponensial dengan benar berdasarkan tabel nilai.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menginterpretasikan karakteristik grafik fungsi eksponensial (domain, range, asimtot) dalam konteks permasalahan nyata.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 4 (3 JP): Bentuk Akar</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat mengubah bentuk bilangan berpangkat pecahan ke dalam bentuk akar dan sebaliknya dengan tepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat melakukan operasi aljabar pada bentuk akar (penjumlahan, pengurangan, perkalian, pembagian, merasionalkan penyebut) secara sistematis.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menyelesaikan masalah kontekstual yang melibatkan bentuk akar, seperti perhitungan jarak atau luas bidang.</span></p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Discovery Learning</li>\r\n<li>Problem Based Learning (PBL)</li>\r\n<li>Diskusi Kelompok</li>\r\n<li>Tanya Jawab</li>\r\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n<li>LKPD : Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik sebagai panduan penemuan konsep</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Buku Paket Matematika SMA/MA kelas X</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Asesmen Awal Pembelajaran (Diagnostik)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tujuan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengidentifikasi pengetahuan awal, keterampilan prasyarat, dan gaya belajar peserta didik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Kuesioner:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Pertanyaan singkat tentang pengalaman belajar matematika sebelumnya dan preferensi belajar.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tes Diagnostik (5 soal):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Hitunglah 23&times;22.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Sederhanakan 3235​.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tuliskan 4&times;4&times;4&times;4&times;4 dalam bentuk pangkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jika 3x=81, berapakah nilai x?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Apa yang Anda ketahui tentang pangkat? Berikan contohnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Observasi:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengamati partisipasi peserta didik dalam diskusi awal dan respons terhadap pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Wawancara Singkat:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Berbicara secara informal dengan beberapa peserta didik untuk memahami latar belakang pengetahuan mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Asesmen Proses Pembelajaran (Formatif)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tujuan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Memantau pemahaman peserta didik selama proses pembelajaran, memberikan umpan balik, dan menyesuaikan strategi pengajaran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tugas Harian/LKPD:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Penilaian lembar kerja kelompok atau individu yang dikumpulkan di akhir sesi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi Kelompok:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengamati partisipasi aktif, kualitas argumen, dan kemampuan kolaborasi dalam diskusi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Presentasi:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Penilaian presentasi hasil eksplorasi atau pemecahan masalah kelompok.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Contoh Soal (pertemuan 1, bagian diskusi kelompok/tugas harian):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jelaskan dengan kata-kata Anda sendiri apa yang dimaksud dengan eksponen dan berikan satu contoh penerapannya dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Dengan menggunakan sifat eksponen, sederhanakan (23&times;25):24.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Sebuah amoeba membelah diri menjadi 2 setiap 30 menit. Jika mula-mula terdapat 5 amoeba, berapa banyak amoeba setelah 2 jam?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Benar atau salah pernyataan berikut: (22)3=25. Jelaskan alasannya!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jika a2&times;a3=32, berapakah nilai a?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Asesmen Akhir Pembelajaran (Sumatif)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tujuan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengukur pencapaian tujuan pembelajaran secara keseluruhan setelah unit selesai.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jurnal Reflektif:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik menulis refleksi menyeluruh tentang pembelajaran eksponen, mulai dari </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">konsep</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> yang paling dikuasai, kesulitan yang berhasil diatasi, hingga manfaat yang dirasakan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tes Tertulis (5 soal):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Sederhanakan bentuk eksponen berikut: x4y&minus;1(x3y2)2​.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Hitunglah nilai dari (641/3)+(272/3)&minus;(1251/3).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Populasi suatu kota pada tahun 2020 adalah 1.000.000 jiwa. Jika laju pertumbuhan penduduk kota tersebut 2% per tahun, berapa perkiraan populasi kota tersebut pada tahun 2025? (Gunakan rumus Pt​=P0​(1+r)t)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Gambarkan grafik fungsi f(x)=3x untuk domain x&isin;{&minus;2,&minus;1,0,1,2} dan tentukan asimtotnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Seorang peneliti mengamati peluruhan zat radioaktif. Massa awal zat adalah 100 gram. Jika massa zat berkurang menjadi setengahnya setiap 5 jam, tentukan massa zat setelah 15 jam.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tugas Akhir/Proyek:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> \"Modelling Pertumbuhan/Peluruhan dengan Fungsi Eksponensial\" atau \"</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Aplikasi</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Eksponen dan Bentuk Akar dalam Desain\" (dinilai menggunakan rubrik proyek).</span></p>','12 Jam Pelajaran (JP) @ 45 menit (4 pertemuan)','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Metode Pembelajaran Berbasis Proyek (PjBL):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik akan mengerjakan proyek \"Modelling Pertumbuhan/Peluruhan dengan Fungsi Eksponensial\" atau \"Aplikasi Eksponen dan Bentuk Akar dalam Desain\". Proyek ini melibatkan eksplorasi lapangan (jika memungkinkan, misalnya mengamati pertumbuhan tanaman), wawancara (misalnya dengan ekonom untuk bunga majemuk), dan presentasi hasil proyek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi Kelompok:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mendorong kolaborasi dan berbagi ide dalam memecahkan masalah.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penemuan Terbimbing:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik akan dibimbing untuk menemukan sifat-sifat eksponen melalui eksplorasi dan contoh-contoh.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pembelajaran Aktif:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengintegrasikan permainan (misalnya teka-teki eksponen), studi kasus, dan simulasi.</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Ruang Fisik:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Kelas yang fleksibel memungkinkan pengaturan tempat duduk untuk diskusi kelompok, area presentasi, dan akses ke papan tulis/layar proyektor.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Ruang Virtual:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Pemanfaatan Learning Management System (LMS) seperti Google Classroom untuk berbagi materi, forum diskusi, dan pengumpulan tugas.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Budaya Belajar:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mendorong budaya kolaboratif (saling membantu, menghargai perbedaan pendapat), partisipasi aktif (siswa berani bertanya dan berpendapat), dan rasa ingin tahu yang tinggi (siswa termotivasi untuk mencari tahu lebih dalam).</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Perpustakaan Digital:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengakses e-book, artikel, dan sumber belajar relevan tentang eksponen dan aplikasinya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Forum Diskusi Daring:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Google Classroom atau platform serupa untuk diskusi asinkron, bertanya jawab, dan berbagi sumber.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penilaian Daring:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Google Forms untuk kuesioner dan tes diagnostik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Gamifikasi:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Pemanfaatan Kahoot untuk kuis interaktif dan review materi secara menyenangkan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Aplikasi Grafis:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Geogebra untuk memvisualisasikan grafik fungsi eksponensial.</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">Kegiatan Pendahuluan (15 menit)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pembukaan (Mindful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menyapa peserta didik dengan hangat, mengajak berdoa, dan melakukan <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">ice breaking</em> ringan yang relevan dengan topik (misalnya, tebak angka dengan pangkat sederhana). Ini bertujuan untuk menciptakan suasana positif dan fokus.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Apersepsi (Meaningful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru mengajukan pertanyaan pemantik yang relevan dengan kehidupan sehari-hari dan melibatkan konsep eksponen secara implisit, misalnya: \"Bagaimana cara menghitung jumlah sel bakteri setelah beberapa jam jika setiap jamnya membelah diri menjadi dua?\", atau \"Pernahkah kalian mendengar tentang bunga bank? Bagaimana cara bank menghitung bunga tabungan?\" Guru mengaitkan jawaban peserta didik dengan pengalaman mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Motivasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menampilkan video singkat atau gambar menarik tentang fenomena yang melibatkan eksponen (misalnya pertumbuhan populasi, skala Richter gempa bumi). Guru menjelaskan relevansi materi eksponen dalam berbagai bidang ilmu dan kehidupan nyata, menciptakan rasa penasaran dan antusiasme.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penyampaian Tujuan Pembelajaran:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran yang akan dicapai pada pertemuan tersebut secara jelas, agar peserta didik memahami apa yang akan mereka pelajari dan mengapa materi tersebut penting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">Kegiatan Inti (60-70 menit))</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 1: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Definisi dan Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 1)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diferensiasi Konten:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menyajikan definisi eksponen melalui berbagai media (teks, visual, contoh konkret). Bagi peserta didik yang memiliki gaya belajar visual, disajikan infografis. Bagi auditori, dijelaskan secara verbal dengan contoh. Bagi kinestetik, diajak membuat ilustrasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memandu peserta didik untuk memahami definisi eksponen (an=a&times;a&times;⋯&times;a sebanyak n kali) dengan contoh-contoh sederhana.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Eksplorasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik dalam kelompok kecil melakukan aktivitas eksplorasi untuk menemukan sifat perkalian eksponen (am&times;an=am+n) dan pembagian eksponen (am:an=am&minus;n) melalui pola bilangan. Guru memberikan LKPD yang berbeda tingkat kesulitannya bagi kelompok yang berbeda kesiapannya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru mendampingi kelompok yang mengalami kesulitan dan memberikan scaffolding.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diferensiasi Proses:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengerjakan latihan soal yang bervariasi tingkat kesulitannya sesuai dengan penguasaan konsep awal mereka. Guru menyediakan kumpulan soal berjenjang (mulai dari mudah hingga menantang).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memberikan contoh aplikasi sifat-sifat eksponen dalam soal cerita sederhana yang relevan dengan kehidupan sehari-hari (misalnya, perhitungan jumlah penduduk yang tumbuh).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi Kelompok:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mempresentasikan hasil diskusi dan penyelesaian soal di depan kelas. Guru memberikan umpan balik konstruktif dan meluruskan miskonsepsi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru meminta peserta didik untuk membuat rangkuman singkat tentang definisi dan sifat-sifat eksponen yang telah dipelajari dalam catatan pribadi atau menggunakan tools digital seperti MindMeister.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru mengajukan pertanyaan reflektif: \"Apa yang paling menarik dari pembelajaran hari ini?\", \"Konsep mana yang paling menantang dan mengapa?\", \"Bagaimana sifat eksponen ini bisa digunakan dalam kehidupan sehari-hari?\"</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 2: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 2) dan Eksponen Nol/Negatif</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru mengajak peserta didik meninjau kembali sifat-sifat eksponen yang telah dipelajari.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Eksplorasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik secara mandiri atau kelompok kecil melakukan aktivitas penemuan untuk sifat-sifat eksponen lainnya (pangkat dari pangkat, pangkat dari perkalian/pembagian) dan konsep eksponen nol serta eksponen negatif, bisa menggunakan lembar kerja terstruktur atau eksplorasi dengan kalkulator.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memfasilitasi diskusi untuk menyimpulkan sifat-sifat baru dan konsep eksponen nol/negatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diferensiasi Produk:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik diminta untuk membuat \"mini-poster\" atau \"infografis\" digital tentang rangkuman sifat-sifat eksponen, termasuk eksponen nol dan negatif, yang dapat mereka gunakan sebagai referensi. Mereka bebas memilih format dan gaya visual.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Latihan soal aplikasi yang lebih kompleks, termasuk soal-soal penalaran. Guru dapat memberikan soal yang terbuka (open-ended problem) yang memungkinkan berbagai solusi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik melakukan peer teaching atau menjelaskan konsep eksponen kepada teman sebaya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru meminta peserta didik menuliskan \"Satu hal yang paling saya pahami hari ini tentang eksponen\" dan \"Satu pertanyaan yang masih mengganjal di pikiran saya tentang eksponen.\"</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 3: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Fungsi Eksponensial</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Eksplorasi Lapangan/Studi Kasus (Meaningful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru membawa peserta didik ke luar kelas (jika memungkinkan) untuk mengamati fenomena pertumbuhan (misalnya, pertumbuhan daun/tanaman) atau menayangkan video simulasi pertumbuhan bakteri.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memperkenalkan fungsi eksponensial sebagai model matematis untuk fenomena pertumbuhan dan peluruhan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Visualisasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik menggunakan aplikasi seperti Geogebra atau Desmos untuk menggambar grafik fungsi eksponensial y=ax dengan berbagai nilai a. Mereka mengamati perubahan bentuk grafik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik bekerja dalam kelompok untuk menyelesaikan masalah kontekstual yang melibatkan fungsi eksponensial (misalnya, pertumbuhan penduduk, peluruhan zat). Guru memberikan data nyata atau data simulasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Proyek Mini:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mulai merencanakan proyek \"Modelling Pertumbuhan/Peluruhan dengan Fungsi Eksponensial\", mengidentifikasi data yang dibutuhkan dan metode pengumpulan data.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru meminta peserta didik untuk mengidentifikasi setidaknya dua contoh fenomena di sekitar mereka yang dapat dimodelkan dengan fungsi eksponensial.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi kelas tentang karakteristik penting dari grafik fungsi eksponensial (fungsi naik/turun, asimtot).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 4: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Bentuk Akar</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memulai dengan mengaitkan konsep bentuk akar dengan eksponen pecahan (a1/n=na​).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memberikan contoh-contoh bilangan yang dapat diubah ke bentuk akar dan sebaliknya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Game Interaktif (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Kahoot atau Mentimeter untuk kuis singkat tentang identifikasi bentuk akar dan eksponen pecahan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik berlatih melakukan operasi hitung pada bentuk akar, mulai dari menyederhanakan, penjumlahan, pengurangan, perkalian, hingga pembagian dan merasionalkan penyebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Proyek Lanjutan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengaplikasikan konsep bentuk akar dalam masalah desain atau arsitektur sederhana (misalnya, menghitung panjang diagonal, luas bidang).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik bekerja dalam kelompok untuk memecahkan soal-soal aplikasi bentuk akar dalam konteks kehidupan nyata.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik membuat peta konsep tentang hubungan antara eksponen dan bentuk akar.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memberikan kesempatan kepada peserta didik untuk berbagi strategi mereka dalam menyelesaikan masalah bentuk akar yang rumit.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">Kegiatan Penutup (15 menit)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Umpan Balik Konstruktif (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan umpan balik individual atau kelompok terhadap hasil kerja peserta didik selama kegiatan inti, menyoroti kekuatan dan area yang perlu ditingkatkan. Umpan balik dapat diberikan secara lisan, tertulis, atau melalui rubrik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Menyimpulkan Pembelajaran (Bermakna):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru dan peserta didik bersama-sama menyimpulkan materi yang telah dipelajari pada pertemuan tersebut. Guru dapat meminta beberapa peserta didik untuk menyampaikan kesimpulan mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Refleksi Diri (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengisi jurnal reflektif singkat tentang pengalaman belajar mereka, termasuk apa yang mereka pelajari, kesulitan yang dihadapi, dan bagaimana mereka mengatasinya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Perencanaan Pembelajaran Selanjutnya (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan gambaran singkat tentang materi yang akan dipelajari pada pertemuan berikutnya atau proyek lanjutan. Guru juga menanyakan harapan atau saran peserta didik untuk pembelajaran selanjutnya, melibatkan mereka dalam perencanaan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penugasan (jika ada):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan tugas rumah atau proyek yang relevan untuk dikerjakan di luar jam pelajaran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">6.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Salam Penutup:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Umpan Balik Konstruktif (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan umpan balik individual atau kelompok terhadap hasil kerja peserta didik selama kegiatan inti, menyoroti kekuatan dan area yang perlu ditingkatkan. Umpan balik dapat diberikan secara lisan, tertulis, atau melalui rubrik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Menyimpulkan Pembelajaran (Bermakna):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru dan peserta didik bersama-sama menyimpulkan materi yang telah dipelajari pada pertemuan tersebut. Guru dapat meminta beberapa peserta didik untuk menyampaikan kesimpulan mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Refleksi Diri (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengisi jurnal reflektif singkat tentang pengalaman belajar mereka, termasuk apa yang mereka pelajari, kesulitan yang dihadapi, dan bagaimana mereka mengatasinya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Perencanaan Pembelajaran Selanjutnya (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan gambaran singkat tentang materi yang akan dipelajari pada pertemuan berikutnya atau proyek lanjutan. Guru juga menanyakan harapan atau saran peserta didik untuk pembelajaran selanjutnya, melibatkan mereka dalam perencanaan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penugasan (jika ada):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan tugas rumah atau proyek yang relevan untuk dikerjakan di luar jam pelajaran.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 13:50:18','2026-08-07 13:50:18'),
(159,19,4,NULL,2,NULL,'Eksponen','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pada akhir fase E (Kelas X), peserta didik dapat menggeneralisasi sifat-sifat eksponen dan logaritma, serta menggunakan barisan dan deret aritmetika dan geometri. Mereka dapat menerapkan barisan dan deret aritmetika dan geometri untuk menyelesaikan masalah kontekstual (termasuk pertumbuhan, peluruhan, bunga majemuk, dan anuitas).</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 1 (3 JP): Definisi Eksponen dan Sifat-Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 1)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat mengidentifikasi definisi eksponen dengan tepat setelah mengamati ilustrasi permasalahan pertumbuhan populasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menggunakan sifat-sifat perkalian dan pembagian eksponen dalam menyelesaikan soal-soal sederhana secara mandiri dengan teliti.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat membuktikan sifat-sifat eksponen (am&times;an=am+n dan am:an=am&minus;n) melalui diskusi kelompok.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 2 (3 JP): Sifat-Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 2) dan Eksponen Nol/Negatif</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menggunakan sifat-sifat eksponen lainnya (pangkat dari pangkat, pangkat dari perkalian/pembagian) dalam menyelesaikan soal-soal kompleks dengan cermat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menjelaskan makna eksponen nol dan eksponen negatif serta menggunakannya dalam perhitungan dengan tepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menganalisis kesalahan umum dalam perhitungan eksponen dan mengidentifikasi solusinya melalui studi kasus.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 3 (3 JP): Fungsi Eksponensial</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat memodelkan fenomena pertumbuhan dan peluruhan menggunakan fungsi eksponensial setelah melakukan eksplorasi data.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menggambar grafik fungsi eksponensial dengan benar berdasarkan tabel nilai.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menginterpretasikan karakteristik grafik fungsi eksponensial (domain, range, asimtot) dalam konteks permasalahan nyata.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pertemuan 4 (3 JP): Bentuk Akar</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat mengubah bentuk bilangan berpangkat pecahan ke dalam bentuk akar dan sebaliknya dengan tepat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat melakukan operasi aljabar pada bentuk akar (penjumlahan, pengurangan, perkalian, pembagian, merasionalkan penyebut) secara sistematis.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik dapat menyelesaikan masalah kontekstual yang melibatkan bentuk akar, seperti perhitungan jarak atau luas bidang.</span></p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Discovery Learning</li>\r\n<li>Problem Based Learning (PBL)</li>\r\n<li>Diskusi Kelompok</li>\r\n<li>Tanya Jawab</li>\r\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n<li>LKPD : Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik sebagai panduan penemuan konsep</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Buku Paket Matematika SMA/MA kelas X</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Asesmen Awal Pembelajaran (Diagnostik)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tujuan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengidentifikasi pengetahuan awal, keterampilan prasyarat, dan gaya belajar peserta didik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Kuesioner:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Pertanyaan singkat tentang pengalaman belajar matematika sebelumnya dan preferensi belajar.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tes Diagnostik (5 soal):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Hitunglah 23&times;22.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Sederhanakan 3235​.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tuliskan 4&times;4&times;4&times;4&times;4 dalam bentuk pangkat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jika 3x=81, berapakah nilai x?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Apa yang Anda ketahui tentang pangkat? Berikan contohnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Observasi:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengamati partisipasi peserta didik dalam diskusi awal dan respons terhadap pertanyaan pemantik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Wawancara Singkat:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Berbicara secara informal dengan beberapa peserta didik untuk memahami latar belakang pengetahuan mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Asesmen Proses Pembelajaran (Formatif)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tujuan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Memantau pemahaman peserta didik selama proses pembelajaran, memberikan umpan balik, dan menyesuaikan strategi pengajaran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tugas Harian/LKPD:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Penilaian lembar kerja kelompok atau individu yang dikumpulkan di akhir sesi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi Kelompok:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengamati partisipasi aktif, kualitas argumen, dan kemampuan kolaborasi dalam diskusi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Presentasi:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Penilaian presentasi hasil eksplorasi atau pemecahan masalah kelompok.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Contoh Soal (pertemuan 1, bagian diskusi kelompok/tugas harian):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jelaskan dengan kata-kata Anda sendiri apa yang dimaksud dengan eksponen dan berikan satu contoh penerapannya dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Dengan menggunakan sifat eksponen, sederhanakan (23&times;25):24.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Sebuah amoeba membelah diri menjadi 2 setiap 30 menit. Jika mula-mula terdapat 5 amoeba, berapa banyak amoeba setelah 2 jam?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Benar atau salah pernyataan berikut: (22)3=25. Jelaskan alasannya!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo3; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jika a2&times;a3=32, berapakah nilai a?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Asesmen Akhir Pembelajaran (Sumatif)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tujuan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengukur pencapaian tujuan pembelajaran secara keseluruhan setelah unit selesai.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Jurnal Reflektif:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik menulis refleksi menyeluruh tentang pembelajaran eksponen, mulai dari </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">konsep</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> yang paling dikuasai, kesulitan yang berhasil diatasi, hingga manfaat yang dirasakan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tes Tertulis (5 soal):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Sederhanakan bentuk eksponen berikut: x4y&minus;1(x3y2)2​.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Hitunglah nilai dari (641/3)+(272/3)&minus;(1251/3).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Populasi suatu kota pada tahun 2020 adalah 1.000.000 jiwa. Jika laju pertumbuhan penduduk kota tersebut 2% per tahun, berapa perkiraan populasi kota tersebut pada tahun 2025? (Gunakan rumus Pt​=P0​(1+r)t)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Gambarkan grafik fungsi f(x)=3x untuk domain x&isin;{&minus;2,&minus;1,0,1,2} dan tentukan asimtotnya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 59.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Seorang peneliti mengamati peluruhan zat radioaktif. Massa awal zat adalah 100 gram. Jika massa zat berkurang menjadi setengahnya setiap 5 jam, tentukan massa zat setelah 15 jam.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 41.25pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Tugas Akhir/Proyek:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> \"Modelling Pertumbuhan/Peluruhan dengan Fungsi Eksponensial\" atau \"</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Aplikasi</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Eksponen dan Bentuk Akar dalam Desain\" (dinilai menggunakan rubrik proyek).</span></p>','12 Jam Pelajaran (JP) @ 45 menit (4 pertemuan)','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Metode Pembelajaran Berbasis Proyek (PjBL):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik akan mengerjakan proyek \"Modelling Pertumbuhan/Peluruhan dengan Fungsi Eksponensial\" atau \"Aplikasi Eksponen dan Bentuk Akar dalam Desain\". Proyek ini melibatkan eksplorasi lapangan (jika memungkinkan, misalnya mengamati pertumbuhan tanaman), wawancara (misalnya dengan ekonom untuk bunga majemuk), dan presentasi hasil proyek.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi Kelompok:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mendorong kolaborasi dan berbagi ide dalam memecahkan masalah.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penemuan Terbimbing:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik akan dibimbing untuk menemukan sifat-sifat eksponen melalui eksplorasi dan contoh-contoh.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pembelajaran Aktif:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengintegrasikan permainan (misalnya teka-teki eksponen), studi kasus, dan simulasi.</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Ruang Fisik:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Kelas yang fleksibel memungkinkan pengaturan tempat duduk untuk diskusi kelompok, area presentasi, dan akses ke papan tulis/layar proyektor.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Ruang Virtual:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Pemanfaatan Learning Management System (LMS) seperti Google Classroom untuk berbagi materi, forum diskusi, dan pengumpulan tugas.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Budaya Belajar:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mendorong budaya kolaboratif (saling membantu, menghargai perbedaan pendapat), partisipasi aktif (siswa berani bertanya dan berpendapat), dan rasa ingin tahu yang tinggi (siswa termotivasi untuk mencari tahu lebih dalam).</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Perpustakaan Digital:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Mengakses e-book, artikel, dan sumber belajar relevan tentang eksponen dan aplikasinya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Forum Diskusi Daring:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Google Classroom atau platform serupa untuk diskusi asinkron, bertanya jawab, dan berbagi sumber.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penilaian Daring:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Google Forms untuk kuesioner dan tes diagnostik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Gamifikasi:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Pemanfaatan Kahoot untuk kuis interaktif dan review materi secara menyenangkan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Aplikasi Grafis:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Geogebra untuk memvisualisasikan grafik fungsi eksponensial.</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">Kegiatan Pendahuluan (15 menit)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Pembukaan (Mindful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menyapa peserta didik dengan hangat, mengajak berdoa, dan melakukan <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">ice breaking</em> ringan yang relevan dengan topik (misalnya, tebak angka dengan pangkat sederhana). Ini bertujuan untuk menciptakan suasana positif dan fokus.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Apersepsi (Meaningful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru mengajukan pertanyaan pemantik yang relevan dengan kehidupan sehari-hari dan melibatkan konsep eksponen secara implisit, misalnya: \"Bagaimana cara menghitung jumlah sel bakteri setelah beberapa jam jika setiap jamnya membelah diri menjadi dua?\", atau \"Pernahkah kalian mendengar tentang bunga bank? Bagaimana cara bank menghitung bunga tabungan?\" Guru mengaitkan jawaban peserta didik dengan pengalaman mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Motivasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menampilkan video singkat atau gambar menarik tentang fenomena yang melibatkan eksponen (misalnya pertumbuhan populasi, skala Richter gempa bumi). Guru menjelaskan relevansi materi eksponen dalam berbagai bidang ilmu dan kehidupan nyata, menciptakan rasa penasaran dan antusiasme.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penyampaian Tujuan Pembelajaran:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran yang akan dicapai pada pertemuan tersebut secara jelas, agar peserta didik memahami apa yang akan mereka pelajari dan mengapa materi tersebut penting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">Kegiatan Inti (60-70 menit))</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 1: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Definisi dan Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 1)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diferensiasi Konten:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menyajikan definisi eksponen melalui berbagai media (teks, visual, contoh konkret). Bagi peserta didik yang memiliki gaya belajar visual, disajikan infografis. Bagi auditori, dijelaskan secara verbal dengan contoh. Bagi kinestetik, diajak membuat ilustrasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memandu peserta didik untuk memahami definisi eksponen (an=a&times;a&times;⋯&times;a sebanyak n kali) dengan contoh-contoh sederhana.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Eksplorasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik dalam kelompok kecil melakukan aktivitas eksplorasi untuk menemukan sifat perkalian eksponen (am&times;an=am+n) dan pembagian eksponen (am:an=am&minus;n) melalui pola bilangan. Guru memberikan LKPD yang berbeda tingkat kesulitannya bagi kelompok yang berbeda kesiapannya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru mendampingi kelompok yang mengalami kesulitan dan memberikan scaffolding.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diferensiasi Proses:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengerjakan latihan soal yang bervariasi tingkat kesulitannya sesuai dengan penguasaan konsep awal mereka. Guru menyediakan kumpulan soal berjenjang (mulai dari mudah hingga menantang).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memberikan contoh aplikasi sifat-sifat eksponen dalam soal cerita sederhana yang relevan dengan kehidupan sehari-hari (misalnya, perhitungan jumlah penduduk yang tumbuh).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi Kelompok:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mempresentasikan hasil diskusi dan penyelesaian soal di depan kelas. Guru memberikan umpan balik konstruktif dan meluruskan miskonsepsi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru meminta peserta didik untuk membuat rangkuman singkat tentang definisi dan sifat-sifat eksponen yang telah dipelajari dalam catatan pribadi atau menggunakan tools digital seperti MindMeister.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru mengajukan pertanyaan reflektif: \"Apa yang paling menarik dari pembelajaran hari ini?\", \"Konsep mana yang paling menantang dan mengapa?\", \"Bagaimana sifat eksponen ini bisa digunakan dalam kehidupan sehari-hari?\"</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 2: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Sifat Eksponen (Bagian 2) dan Eksponen Nol/Negatif</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru mengajak peserta didik meninjau kembali sifat-sifat eksponen yang telah dipelajari.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Eksplorasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik secara mandiri atau kelompok kecil melakukan aktivitas penemuan untuk sifat-sifat eksponen lainnya (pangkat dari pangkat, pangkat dari perkalian/pembagian) dan konsep eksponen nol serta eksponen negatif, bisa menggunakan lembar kerja terstruktur atau eksplorasi dengan kalkulator.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memfasilitasi diskusi untuk menyimpulkan sifat-sifat baru dan konsep eksponen nol/negatif.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diferensiasi Produk:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik diminta untuk membuat \"mini-poster\" atau \"infografis\" digital tentang rangkuman sifat-sifat eksponen, termasuk eksponen nol dan negatif, yang dapat mereka gunakan sebagai referensi. Mereka bebas memilih format dan gaya visual.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Latihan soal aplikasi yang lebih kompleks, termasuk soal-soal penalaran. Guru dapat memberikan soal yang terbuka (open-ended problem) yang memungkinkan berbagai solusi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik melakukan peer teaching atau menjelaskan konsep eksponen kepada teman sebaya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru meminta peserta didik menuliskan \"Satu hal yang paling saya pahami hari ini tentang eksponen\" dan \"Satu pertanyaan yang masih mengganjal di pikiran saya tentang eksponen.\"</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 3: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Fungsi Eksponensial</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Eksplorasi Lapangan/Studi Kasus (Meaningful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru membawa peserta didik ke luar kelas (jika memungkinkan) untuk mengamati fenomena pertumbuhan (misalnya, pertumbuhan daun/tanaman) atau menayangkan video simulasi pertumbuhan bakteri.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memperkenalkan fungsi eksponensial sebagai model matematis untuk fenomena pertumbuhan dan peluruhan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Visualisasi (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik menggunakan aplikasi seperti Geogebra atau Desmos untuk menggambar grafik fungsi eksponensial y=ax dengan berbagai nilai a. Mereka mengamati perubahan bentuk grafik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik bekerja dalam kelompok untuk menyelesaikan masalah kontekstual yang melibatkan fungsi eksponensial (misalnya, pertumbuhan penduduk, peluruhan zat). Guru memberikan data nyata atau data simulasi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Proyek Mini:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mulai merencanakan proyek \"Modelling Pertumbuhan/Peluruhan dengan Fungsi Eksponensial\", mengidentifikasi data yang dibutuhkan dan metode pengumpulan data.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru meminta peserta didik untuk mengidentifikasi setidaknya dua contoh fenomena di sekitar mereka yang dapat dimodelkan dengan fungsi eksponensial.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Diskusi kelas tentang karakteristik penting dari grafik fungsi eksponensial (fungsi naik/turun, asimtot).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Pertemuan 4: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; text-transform: uppercase; background: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow;\">Bentuk Akar</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Memahami (Berkesadaran, Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memulai dengan mengaitkan konsep bentuk akar dengan eksponen pecahan (a1/n=na​).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memberikan contoh-contoh bilangan yang dapat diubah ke bentuk akar dan sebaliknya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Game Interaktif (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Menggunakan Kahoot atau Mentimeter untuk kuis singkat tentang identifikasi bentuk akar dan eksponen pecahan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Mengaplikasi (Bermakna):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik berlatih melakukan operasi hitung pada bentuk akar, mulai dari menyederhanakan, penjumlahan, pengurangan, perkalian, hingga pembagian dan merasionalkan penyebut.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Proyek Lanjutan:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengaplikasikan konsep bentuk akar dalam masalah desain atau arsitektur sederhana (misalnya, menghitung panjang diagonal, luas bidang).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik bekerja dalam kelompok untuk memecahkan soal-soal aplikasi bentuk akar dalam konteks kehidupan nyata.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 24.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Merefleksi (Berkesadaran):</span></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Peserta didik membuat peta konsep tentang hubungan antara eksponen dan bentuk akar.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 39.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">●<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Guru memberikan kesempatan kepada peserta didik untuk berbagi strategi mereka dalam menyelesaikan masalah bentuk akar yang rumit.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 21.3pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d; text-transform: uppercase; background: aqua; mso-highlight: aqua;\">Kegiatan Penutup (15 menit)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Umpan Balik Konstruktif (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan umpan balik individual atau kelompok terhadap hasil kerja peserta didik selama kegiatan inti, menyoroti kekuatan dan area yang perlu ditingkatkan. Umpan balik dapat diberikan secara lisan, tertulis, atau melalui rubrik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Menyimpulkan Pembelajaran (Bermakna):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru dan peserta didik bersama-sama menyimpulkan materi yang telah dipelajari pada pertemuan tersebut. Guru dapat meminta beberapa peserta didik untuk menyampaikan kesimpulan mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Refleksi Diri (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengisi jurnal reflektif singkat tentang pengalaman belajar mereka, termasuk apa yang mereka pelajari, kesulitan yang dihadapi, dan bagaimana mereka mengatasinya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Perencanaan Pembelajaran Selanjutnya (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan gambaran singkat tentang materi yang akan dipelajari pada pertemuan berikutnya atau proyek lanjutan. Guru juga menanyakan harapan atau saran peserta didik untuk pembelajaran selanjutnya, melibatkan mereka dalam perencanaan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penugasan (jika ada):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan tugas rumah atau proyek yang relevan untuk dikerjakan di luar jam pelajaran.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">6.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Salam Penutup:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru menutup pelajaran dengan doa dan salam.</span></p>','<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Umpan Balik Konstruktif (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan umpan balik individual atau kelompok terhadap hasil kerja peserta didik selama kegiatan inti, menyoroti kekuatan dan area yang perlu ditingkatkan. Umpan balik dapat diberikan secara lisan, tertulis, atau melalui rubrik.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Menyimpulkan Pembelajaran (Bermakna):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru dan peserta didik bersama-sama menyimpulkan materi yang telah dipelajari pada pertemuan tersebut. Guru dapat meminta beberapa peserta didik untuk menyampaikan kesimpulan mereka.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Refleksi Diri (Berkesadaran):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Peserta didik mengisi jurnal reflektif singkat tentang pengalaman belajar mereka, termasuk apa yang mereka pelajari, kesulitan yang dihadapi, dan bagaimana mereka mengatasinya.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Perencanaan Pembelajaran Selanjutnya (Joyful Learning):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan gambaran singkat tentang materi yang akan dipelajari pada pertemuan berikutnya atau proyek lanjutan. Guru juga menanyakan harapan atau saran peserta didik untuk pembelajaran selanjutnya, melibatkan mereka dalam perencanaan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Normal1\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\">Penugasan (jika ada):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Google Sans Text\'; color: #1b1c1d;\"> Guru memberikan tugas rumah atau proyek yang relevan untuk dikerjakan di luar jam pelajaran.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07 13:50:18','2026-08-07 13:50:18');
